<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ACT" style="id">- Saafi-Saafi</book>
  <para style="h">Tum ciŋ Apootar ci</para>
  <para style="toc3">Tum</para>
  <para style="toc2">Tum ci</para>
  <para style="toc1">Tum ciŋ Apootar ci</para>
  <para style="mt">Tum ciŋ Apootar ci</para>
  <para style="is">Rangsohaani</para>
  <para style="ip">Teerndi na woyse "Tum ciŋ <char style="w"><char style="tl">Apootar</char></char> ci", e Luk fiisa. Luk ɓaaheeɗi ŋ <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ciŋ Yeesu. A nikee paƴoh.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt"><ref loc="COL 4:14">Ɓi Kolos 4:14</ref></char></note> A yi dong nikɗi Yawuut ŋ ɓooɓi fiis <char style="tl">Biibali</char>. A koc fiis teerndi na woyse "Yegɗohiŋ Muci Luk Fiis", ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ kipes kiŋ Yeesu na kakaan kiŋ ɗe na hultiŋ ɗe. Ne a fiis ineem, a meeksee ɓooɓi meeɗ hun na Yeesu, ɓa woosa ɗe findi yeem pesohee po wa ñiinnda nga ɗe. Ƴutta a fiisiɗta ƴaar na woyse Tewofiil.</para>
  <para style="ip">"Tum ciŋ <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ci" wii, weɗ teerndi a kanakɗoh fiis, wa taalndiɗ in ci a naandsuk ŋ teerndiŋ ɗe koc.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ini kaɗ ŋ ɓaki koc, a tum findi a tumohee ŋ teerndiŋ ɗe koc, maanaam meekis ɓi maasoh in ca raake. Ini kooɗoh ŋ saar 16, aaya 10, a uupee nik na Pool, yi nam teeku Sool, kon ini uup ŋ ɓaki kanakɗoh ŋ teerndi, a maasohiɗ in ci a naandsuk.</para>
  <para style="ip">Wa a ɗiindoh teerndi, a woosoha Tewofiil, findi a tumoh ŋ wa koc.</para>
  <para style="ip">Teerndi na naandsuke cambi na ɓaatkiŋ Janguuni, mboolndiŋ ɓi kosee Yeesu. Wa na naandsuke findi <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ci <char style="w" lemma="Yegɗohiŋ Muci">Yegɗoh Muci</char>, na in ci feyohiɗ ci na firndeeci Kooh tum taamboh ŋ <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ci na kosiɗ ci ɓinooɓi. Ŋ tumohaaɗ ceem, raakiɗ ɓi neɓsee nga, raakka ɓi neɓseeɗi nga, ɓo' laayiɗ tolfiɗuuɗ nga, po ɓum sah, wa mineen ɓa ɓay kakaan. Ŋ ɗooƴ teerndii, yegɗohi kaɗ ŋ Yeesu pasarsohuuɗ ini kooɗoh Yerusalem taambohha ŋ kur laayiɗ po ŋ <char style="w">Rom</char>, te ɗisik nu woo keem kerhasseen ɗah, raakiɗ ɓooɓa kose.</para>
  <para style="iot">Teerndiŋ Tum ciŋ <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ci kaɗtiɗoh an :</para>
  <para style="io1">- Hultiŋ Yeesu po rapɗuukiŋ ɗe ŋ Asamaan <char style="ior"><ref loc="ACT 1:1-11">1:1-11</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Jamanooni <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ci sekohe<char style="ior"><ref loc="ACT 1:12-26">1:12-26</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani</char> hayiɗ <char style="ior"><ref loc="ACT 2:1-41">2:1-41</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Kipes kiŋ kosiɗ ci koc <char style="ior"><ref loc="ACT 2:42-7:60">2:42–7:60</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Tolfiɗi miskiɗ, Sool mirndohiɗ kos Yeesu <char style="ior"><ref loc="ACT 8:1-12:25">8:1–12:25</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Ɓaaɓiŋ Pool yakki koc <char style="ior"><ref loc="ACT 13-14">13–14</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Cohaŋ Yerusalem <char style="ior"><ref loc="ACT 15:1-39">15:1-39</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Ɓaaɓiŋ Pool yakki kanakɗoh <char style="ior"><ref loc="ACT 15:40-18:22">15:40–18:22</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Ɓaaɓiŋ Pool yakki kaahayɗoh <char style="ior"><ref loc="ACT 18:23-21:17">18:23–21:17</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Ɓi Rom ambiɗ Pool, ɓayya ɗe po Rom <char style="ior"><ref loc="ACT 21:27-28:31">21:27–28:31</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ACT 1"/>
  <para style="s">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ci gapse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 1:1"/>Tewofiil ƴaariŋ ngo, mi yii kañiɗ ɗa. Ŋ teerndiŋ ngo ŋ koc fiis, ŋ woyiɗ in ci Yeesu tumee na ci a jangɗohee ŋ cambohaana, <verse eid="ACT 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 1:2"/>po mbeha a rapɗohu ŋ Eel ci. Bala a rapan ɗah, a eɗta <char style="w"><char style="tl">Apootar</char></char> ci a kooɗe nakoh ciŋ ɗe, taamboh ŋ <char style="w">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh</char>.<verse eid="ACT 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 1:3"/>Ŋ finho kakaan kiŋ ɗe, a teeɓpa ɓa haf ce, a teeɓpa ɓa ŋ firnde laayiɗ ne a yii pes. A tummba po ɓa hoteeɗa ɗe, a woyeeɗa na ɓa ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ Nguuriŋ-Kooh, po wa mitta neeh ndaŋkiyaah-nikiis (40). <verse eid="ACT 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 1:4"/>Wa raakka mbeh nga, a ɓooffa a ñameeɗa na ɓa, a eɗta ɓa dengkohii an : « Kinaat pul Yerusalem, sekaat ini Baabi gapohe, wi ŋ woyee ɗu. <verse eid="ACT 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 1:5"/>Laam <char style="w">Yahya</char> ɓoktohee na masuɓ, waaye ndii na ɓi neeh, ɗu hey ɓoktasse na Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani. »<verse eid="ACT 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 1:6"/>Ɓooɓa cohee ŋ ɗiska meekissa Yeesu ne : « Heɗ ɓoo, andi jamanoonii weɗ fu na hee tufkiɗohisse Nguuriŋ Israayel ? » <verse eid="ACT 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 1:7"/>A loffa ɓa ne : « Ɗu onuuɗi ne ɗu inah jamanooni wala wahtuuni in ceem hayohan. A Baabi ŋ haf ce a yi gap mbehiŋ ca ŋ ini neɓ ɗe. <verse eid="ACT 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 1:8"/>Waaye Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani ruhus nga ɗu ɗah, ɗu hey rahse hatil te ɗu hey nike seedeeciŋ ngo ŋ Yerusalem, na ŋ kur caŋ Yudee jen na caŋ Samari jen po ɗiska Adina top. »<verse eid="ACT 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 1:9"/>Wa Yeesu woo po ƴutta, a rapɗasseeɗa Asamaan ŋ has ciŋ ɓa, eel hayya ulla ɗe, ɓa hotisɗi ɗe. <verse eid="ACT 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 1:10"/>Wa ɓa ris marak rapɗuukaŋ Yeesu, jaarra ƴaar kanak ɓekuk kulɓa yaanow nikka ŋ serooɓa, <verse eid="ACT 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 1:11"/>woosa ɓa ne : « Ƴaaɓiŋ Galileeci, wa ye tah ɗu tufuk, ɗu markee ŋ eel ci ? Yeesu yii, yi kooɗohu nga ɗu, cootta ŋ Eel ci, hey hayisse findi ɗu hotoh ɗe kaɗeeɗa ŋ Eel ci. »<verse eid="ACT 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Macaas kooɗuuɗ ne a namsiɗ Yudaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 1:12"/>
    <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ci kurkohha ɗiska ɓa nikee, ŋ tangoora na woyse Tangooraŋ-Oliiw-ca, ɓa dokukka Yerusalem. Harmban wa na Yerusalem nikee ŋ ɓak <char style="tl">kilomeet</char> yino. <verse eid="ACT 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 1:13"/>Wa ɓa ree, ɓa kaɗta ŋ tuuƴa uup ɗafuk ŋ kahna, ɗiska ɓa na dale. Ɓa nikee Piyeer, Saaŋ, Saak na Andare, Filip na Tomaa, Bartalemi na Macce, Saak kuɓkiŋ Alfe, Simong <char style="tl">Seloti</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="fq" closed="false"><char style="tl">Selot</char> </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: a yi ɓoyi waaɗ kur ce po a ƴutiɗ ne a hiñohiɗa.</char></note> na Yudaa kuɓkiŋ Saak. <verse eid="ACT 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 1:14"/>Ɓeɗ jen, na ɓi ɓitiɓ na Maryaama yaayiŋ Yeesu, na taambɗoh ciŋ Yeesu ƴaar ci, ɓeɗ meeɗ coh ne ɓa hun ɓa kiimee Kooh ŋ liiɓohaaɗ yino.<verse eid="ACT 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 1:15"/>Ŋ neeh caam, Piyeer nikee na kosiɗ ca cohee ŋ ɗiska, - ɓa nikeen ŋ ɓak teemet na ndaŋkiyaah-kanak (120) - a tufukka, a woosa ɓa ne : <verse eid="ACT 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 1:16"/>« Ɓaah ciŋ ngo, ini Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani woyee ŋ Fiis ci Hooliɗ ci taamboh ŋ nguɓiŋ Dawuuda te wa joyya nik, wa raakiɗ, weɗ ini kaɗ ŋ Yudaa yi ɓayee ɓooɓi hayee ne ɓa amb Yeesu. <verse eid="ACT 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 1:17"/>A ɓaahee nga ɓoo te a raakeen ɓak ŋ pangki ɓoo eɗu. »<verse eid="ACT 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 1:18"/>Ŋ ini Piyeer woo weem, kopori Yudaa rahsoh ŋ tumohaaɗaŋ ɗe moɗaaɗiina, a romoha yohon, a keennda ŋ yohna, hafiŋ ɗe adugka, rookiŋ ɗe pookka, liir ciŋ ɗe jen aamukka. <verse eid="ACT 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 1:19"/>Ɓi Yerusalem jen kerheen ineem weɗ tah ɓa teekee yohneem "Akeldama" ŋ peɗmiŋ ɓa, wa tokis "yohon ñif". <verse eid="ACT 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 1:20"/>Piyeer degga nga ne : « Wa fiisuuɗ ŋ teerndiŋ Sabuur ne :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 1:20">“ Kahan ce nikaat hulang,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 1:20">ali ɓo' kinaat gen nga<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:26">Sabuur 69:26</ref></char></note> ! ”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 1:20">Fiis ci woyissiɗ ne :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 1:20">“ Ɓo' wiiriis ɓayaat</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 1:20">ɓakiŋ ɗe ŋ pangki.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 109:8">Sabuur 109:8</ref></char></note> ”<verse eid="ACT 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 1:21"/>Kon book ɓoo joyiɗ kooɗ ƴaar yino, ŋ ɓi meeɗ hun na ɓoo ŋ jamanoona Heɗ ɓoo Yeesu nikoh na ɓoo, <verse eid="ACT 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 1:22"/>ini kooɗoh wa Yahya ɓokit ɗe po findi a kooɗohu nga ɓoo. Ɓoyeem joy hun na ɓoo, ne a seede'ee hultiŋ Yeesu. »<verse eid="ACT 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 1:23"/>Ŋ ineem, ɓa ɓayya ɓo' kanak : Suseef yi na woyse Barsabaas te a nammba tapu Yustus, na ƴaari na woyse Macaas. <verse eid="ACT 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 1:24"/>Ŋ ndeem, ɓa kiimeeɗa Kooh an : « Heɗ ɓoo, fu yi inah keeñ ciŋ ɓooɓi jen, teeɓoha yi fu kooɗ ŋ ɓooɓi kanak cii, <verse eid="ACT 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 1:25"/>ne a ɓay panguk <char style="tl">Apootar</char>, wi Yudaa faɗ a kaɗta ɗiska a joy nik. » <verse eid="ACT 1:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 1:26"/>Weɗ ɓa ɓayoh atoh ne ɓa marak ɓoyi Kooh kooɗ, wa hennda ŋ Macaas. A ɓaatuusa ŋ <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ci ndaŋkiyaah na yinooci (11).<verse eid="ACT 1:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ACT 2"/>
  <para style="s">Hayiŋ Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 2:1"/>Wa mbehiŋ <char style="w"><char style="tl">Paantakot</char></char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Paantakot </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Paantakotiŋ Yawuut ci, wa feetiŋ Nguɗ ci koc (marka teerndiŋ <char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 23:16">Pula 23:16</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 23:15-21">Lewiici 23:15-21</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:9-11">Rohƴiɗi 16:9-11</ref></char>). Wa na nike neeh ndaŋkiyaah-yatuus (50) ŋ finho feetiŋ <char style="tl"><char style="w" lemma="Paak">Paakiŋ</char></char> Yawuut ci. Feeteem weɗ ɓa na naandsukohe pulohaŋ ɓa Misra (marka teerndiŋ <char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 12">Pula 12</ref></char>). Paantakotiŋ <char style="tl">Kerceen</char> ci, weɗ ɓa na naandsukohe hayiŋ Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani. Wa na name nik neeh ndaŋkiyaah-yatuus (50) ŋ finho <char style="tl">Paakiŋ</char> <char style="tl">Kerceen</char> ci. <char style="tl">Paakeem</char>, weɗ ɓa na naandsukohe kakaan ki na hultiŋ Yeesu. Yeesu kaan ŋ jamanoona Yawuut ca feetkohee <char style="tl">Paakiŋ</char> ɓa ; Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani nam hay ŋ jamanoona Yawuut ca feetkohee Paantakotiŋ ɓa.</char></note> ree, ɓa jen ɓa cohha ŋ ɗisik yino. <verse eid="ACT 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 2:2"/>Ɗekka po ɗuuɗ pulohha Eel ci findi ɗuuɗ puuɗis yakak. Wa riiffa kahna ɓa nikohee del. <verse eid="ACT 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 2:3"/>Ŋ ineem, ɓa hotta ɓi in haa peɗeem, findi jaal yongkaah. Ca paysukohha, ca degukka ŋ yaa nu nga ɗah. <verse eid="ACT 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 2:4"/>Ɓa jen ɓa riiffa na <char style="w">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh</char>. Ɓa jombeeɗa ŋ ɓi peɗeem wiiriis findi Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani onoh ɓa ne ɓa woo.<verse eid="ACT 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 2:5"/>Waam raak ɓi Yawuut pulohiɗ kur na kur, ɓa hayya Yerusalem, ɓa nikee ɓo' nupiɗ Kooh. <verse eid="ACT 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 2:6"/>Wa ɓooɓa kerah ɗuuɗa, ɓa nangɗukohha ŋ mboolo yakak. Ɓa feyuusa lool laam yaa nu nga ɓa ɗah, kerheen kosiɗ ca woyeeɗa ŋ peɗma a ɓap. <verse eid="ACT 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 2:7"/>Ɓa jaahiɗta lool, wa feyya ɓa, ɓa woyeeɗa ne : « Ɓi na woye ɓii jen, ɓa gen Galile haa e ? <verse eid="ACT 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 2:8"/>Wa min na nikoh po yaa nu nga ɓoo ɗah, fu kerhee ɓa, ɓa woyee ŋ peɗmi fu ɓap ? <verse eid="ACT 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 2:9"/>Te ɓoo puloh Paarte, Medi, Elaam. Raakiɗ ɓi puloh Mesopotami, Yudee, Kapados, Pontos, na Asi.<figure style="fig" alt="Pentecost languages map" file="HG-Pentecost-B&amp;W-Saafi.jpg" size="span" loc="If possible, visible when the book is open to ACT 2:9-11. If that is not possible, then after those texts rather than before." ref="2:9"/> <verse eid="ACT 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 2:10"/>Raakka ɓi puloh Firisi, Pamfili, <char style="w">Misra</char> na ɓaka reɓ Sireen ŋ Libi, na ɓi ɓaah ŋ ɓi <char style="w">Rom</char>, <verse eid="ACT 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 2:11"/>ɓi nikee Yawuut nga ɓa, na ɓi aas ŋ waasiŋ Yawuut ci. Raakiɗ ɓi puloh Keret na Arabi, ɓoo jen, ɓoo ɓeɗi kerah ɓa, ɓa woyee ŋ peɗeem ciŋ ɓoo in ci yakiɗ ci Kooh tum. »<verse eid="ACT 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 2:12"/>Ɓa jen, ɓa feyuusa po haf ciŋ ɓa rangukka mak, ɓa woytiɗoheeɗa ne : « Moo ! Inii wa tokis ye ? » <verse eid="ACT 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 2:13"/>Ɓum njembtoheeɗa an : « Ɓa laar laar. »<verse eid="ACT 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Woo kiŋ Piyeer</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 2:14"/>Teemb ndeem Piyeer tufukka, na <char style="w"><char style="tl">Apootar</char></char> ci ndaŋkiyaah na yinooci (11) ɓinooɓi, a woosa ŋ ɗafka ne : « Ɗu ɓi Yawuut ci, na ɗu ɓi gen Yerusalem jen, rangsaat nof, ɗu sikɗuk woo ciŋ ngo, ɗu inah baahiɗ ini raak.<verse eid="ACT 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 2:15"/>Ɓo' cii laarɗi findi ɗu liiɓoha, ɓoo ɓii ŋ yoor-yoor dong. <verse eid="ACT 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 2:16"/>Inii weɗ Kooh woyee taamboh ŋ woosuuɗi Yowel an : <verse eid="ACT 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 2:17"/>“ Kooh woo ne :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:17">‘Ŋ mbeh ci mirndoh ŋ Adina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:17">ŋ hey pasarohe Fuuɗsiŋ ngo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:17">ngaŋ ɓooɓi jen.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:17">Kuɓuuciŋ ɗu, ƴaar na ɓitiɓ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:17">hey woye findi woosuuɗ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:17">Fiir ci hey hote in ci ŋ teeɓ ɓa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:17">te yaɓkoociŋ ɗu hey ca heeƴe.<verse eid="ACT 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 2:18"/>Ee, ŋ mbeh ceem,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:18">ŋ hey tume Fuuɗsiŋ ngo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:18">ŋ <char style="w">ñaam</char> ciŋ ngo, ƴaar na ɓitiɓ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:18">te ɓa hey nike woosuuɗ ciŋ ngo.<verse eid="ACT 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 2:19"/>Ŋ hey tume in feyohiɗ ŋ ɗafki, ngaŋ eel ci,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:19">ŋ tum firnde ŋ ndii ŋ kehƴi :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:19">ca nikan ñif, yongkaah na eel ɗuuku.<verse eid="ACT 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 2:20"/>Nohi hey ñuuse tuɗ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:20">caɓni ruumind findi ñif</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:20">bala mbehiŋ Heɗi hayan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:20">mbehi yakki hun na ndam.<verse eid="ACT 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 2:21"/>Teemb ndeem</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:21">yaa nu ɓeeɗuk Heɗi ɗah,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:21">a hey mucɗasse.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 3:1-5">Yowel 3:1-5</ref></char></note>’ ”<verse eid="ACT 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 2:22"/>Ɗu ɓi Israayel ci, sikɗukaat ini maa hee ɗu woye : Kooh teeɓiɗ ɗu ya ɓa Yeesu yiŋ Nasareet, ŋ firnde na keemaan na in feyohiɗ laayiɗ taamboh nga ɗe, findi ɗu inhoha.<verse eid="ACT 2:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 2:23"/>Ƴaareem faɗuusa ŋ yaah ciŋ ɗu, wa nikee ini Kooh inah maañiɗ, a yi kooɗkiɗoha ɗaa. Ɗu apɗukiɗ ɗe ŋ daaƴi a daaƴu ŋ kurwaa taamboh ŋ ɓi inahɗi waasiŋ Kooh. <verse eid="ACT 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 2:24"/>Waaye Kooh hultiɗiɗ ɗe, a kooɗohha ɗe ŋ miskiɗ ciŋ kakaan. Laam kakaan ki mineeɗi ɗe amb. <verse eid="ACT 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 2:25"/>Dawuuda sah woyiɗ ŋ Yeesu an :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:25">“ Ŋ genangeen hot Heɗi ŋ fikiiso.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:25">A yii ŋ serooso ne ŋ neƴƴohuu.<verse eid="ACT 2:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 2:26"/>Weɗ tah keeñiŋ ngo soosiɗ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:26">ƴeek ci na pulohe ŋ nguɓiŋ ngo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:26">teeɓohiɗ sum kiŋ ngo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:26">Po ŋ ɗooƴ ruy-ruyaŋ ngo sah,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:26">faaniŋ ngo hey iɗsiɗke ŋ ooluk.<verse eid="ACT 2:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 2:27"/>Kooh fu, fu faɗanɗi so muk ŋ Jaanim</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:27">te fu faɗanɗi ñaamiŋ ɗa yi fu min ooluk,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:27">a nopee ŋ ruy-ruy.<verse eid="ACT 2:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 2:28"/>Fu teeɓiɗ to waas ciŋ kipes ki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:28">fu hey yo riifɗe na sum ŋ nikiŋ ɗa ndii.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 16:8-11">Sabuur 16:8-11</ref></char></note> ” »<verse eid="ACT 2:28"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 2:29"/>Piyeer ɓaatta nga ne : « Ɓaah ciŋ ngo, ŋ miniɗ ɗu woo hooliɗ ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ caac ɓoo Dawuuda : A kaaniɗ, a uumbuuɗ te ruy-ruyiŋ ɗe ris na ɓoo ndii poyi. <verse eid="ACT 2:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 2:30"/>Dawuuda nikee buur, a nikka woosuuɗ. A inheen ne Kooh gapeen ɗe te a giñiɗta ɗe ne a hey name tum yino ŋ ɓi rimkohan nga ɗe buuri laman ɗe.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:12-16">2 Samuwel 7:12-16</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 132:11">Sabuur 132:11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 2:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 2:31"/>Dawuuda hoteen ini na haye, weɗ tahee ɗe woo ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ hultiŋ <char style="w">Mucɗohi Gapohse</char> ne</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:31">“ Kooh faɗanɗi yeem ŋ Jaanim,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:31">faaniŋ ɗe nopanɗi ŋ ɗooƴ ruy-ruy.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 16:10">Sabuur 16:10</ref></char></note> ”<verse eid="ACT 2:31"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 2:32"/>Yeesu yeem, Kooh hultiɗiɗ ɗe, ɓoo jen, ɓoo miniɗ ɗu seede'iɗ ineem. <verse eid="ACT 2:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 2:33"/>Kooh Baabi meeɓiɗ ɗe po ŋ ñaahmiŋ ɗe, a eɗta ɗe Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani gapohse, Yeesu ruhsiɗta Fuuɗsi nga ɓoo. Ineem weɗ ɗu na hote, ɗu kerhee wa wii. <verse eid="ACT 2:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 2:34"/>Dawuuda rapɗi ŋ Eel ci, moona a yi woo ne :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:34">“ Heɗi woyiɗ Heɗ to ne :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:34">‘Ɓoofa ŋ ñaahmiŋ ngo,<verse eid="ACT 2:34"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 2:35"/>po mbaɗna ŋ folan ɓi sang ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:35">fu tum ɓa degoha kot.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Sabuur 110:1</ref></char></note>’ ”<verse eid="ACT 2:35"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 2:36"/>Kon ɗu Israayel ci jen inhaat wooriɗ ne : Yeesu yi ɗu daaƴee ŋ kurwaa, a yi Kooh tum Heɗi, tummba ɗe Mucɗohi a gapohe. »<verse eid="ACT 2:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 2:37"/>Wa ɓooɓa kerah ineem, keeñ ciŋ ɓa reehha, ɓa woosa Piyeer na <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ci tas ne : « Ɓaah ci, ɓoo joy na tum ? » <verse eid="ACT 2:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 2:38"/>Piyeer loffa ɓa ne : « Ɓoƴsohaat pesohaaɗ ! Yaa nu nga ɗu ɗah ɓoktukaat ŋ tiikiŋ Yeesu <char style="w">Kiristaa</char> ne Kooh ɗaas ɗu bakaaɗ ciŋ ɗu te a eɗ ɗu Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani. <verse eid="ACT 2:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 2:39"/>Laam gapohiŋ Kooh wa wuu ɗu na ɓi rimkohan nga ɗu ; wa wuu ɓi us ndii, wa wuu ɓi Kooh Heɗ ɓoo na hee ɓeeɗke nga ɗe, ŋ findi ɓa hend jen. »<verse eid="ACT 2:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 2:40"/>Piyeer taalndiɗta woytoheeɗa ɓa na ɓi woo laayiɗ, a ñaaheeɗa ɓa an : « Teyɗukaat mucɗu, usaat ɓooɓi woti, ɓa baahɗi. » <verse eid="ACT 2:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 2:41"/>Ɓi teyɗuk woo kiŋ ɗe ɓoktuusa. Mbaɗi, ɓi ɓaatuk ŋ kosiɗ ci nikee ŋ ɓak junni-kaahay (3000).<verse eid="ACT 2:41"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kipes kiŋ kosiɗ ci ɗeɓ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 2:42"/>Ɓa genee ŋ sikɗuk jangɗohiŋ <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ci. Ɓa jen ɓa mandee na ɓooɓi taambɗoh, ɓa meeɗta ñam yino, ɓa meeɗta hun ɓa kiimee Kooh.<verse eid="ACT 2:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 2:43"/>Kooh taambohha ŋ <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ci a tumeeɗa in feyohiɗ laayiɗ na ɓi keemaan ; ɓooɓa jen, yaa nu nga ɗah feyuusa. <verse eid="ACT 2:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 2:44"/>Kosiɗ ca jen nikka yino, ɓa ɓaahha in ca ɓa raakee jen. <verse eid="ACT 2:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 2:45"/>Ɓa tooneeɗa kahan caŋ ɓa na raak-raak caŋ ɓa, ɓa paysohha kopora ŋ harmban ɓa, yaa nu nga eɗuusa in hend na ini a etoh. <verse eid="ACT 2:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 2:46"/>Kooh-nu-wiis, ɓa meeɗ coh ŋ <char style="w">Kahan Kooh</char> ; ɓa hunnda, ɓa ɓaaheeɗa kañam ŋ kahan caŋ ɓa, ɓa ñameeɗa kañam caŋ ɓa na keeñ soosiɗ na eɗef. <verse eid="ACT 2:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 2:47"/>Ɓa yakɗeeɗa Kooh, ɓooɓa jen neɓuusa nga ɓa. Kooh-nu-wiis ɗah, Heɗi ɓaat ɓa mucɗuuɗ wiiriis.<verse eid="ACT 2:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ACT 3"/>
  <para style="s">Piyeer na Saaŋ wirɗiɗ lafañ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 3:1"/>Wa raakka mbeh, Piyeer na Saaŋ kaɗta kiima Kooh ŋ <char style="w">Kahan Kooh</char>. Wa nikee jamanooniŋ kiimi na tumse ŋ ɓak noh soos. <verse eid="ACT 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 3:2"/>Waam raak ɓooɓa ɓayeeɗa ƴaar lafñiɗ nga, a rimuk rimuk na lafñiŋ ɗe. Mbeh nu nik, a na ɓayse ɓayu, a degu ŋ sero buntaana na woyse "Buntaani-Moɗohngaani" ne a min yalwaan ŋ ɓooɓi na aase ŋ Kahan Kooh.<verse eid="ACT 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 3:3"/>Wi a hot Piyeer na Saaŋ heeɗa aase, a meekissa ɓa yalwaan. <verse eid="ACT 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 3:4"/>Piyeer na Saaŋ jen iiƴeeɗa ɗe, Piyeer woosa ɗe ne : « Marka ɓoo ! » <verse eid="ACT 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 3:5"/>A markeeɗa ɓa baahiɗ, a ammba ne a hey rahse in nga ɓa. <verse eid="ACT 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 3:6"/>Piyeer woosa ɗe ne : « Ŋ raakɗi urus ŋ raakɗi haalis, waaye ini ŋ raak, ŋ hey ɗa wa one : Ŋ tiikiŋ Yeesu <char style="w">Kiristaa</char> yiŋ Nasareet, kurka fu tiind ! » <verse eid="ACT 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 3:7"/>A ammba ɗe ŋ yaah-ñaahum, a kurkiɗta ɗe, ŋ ɗiska ɗiska kot ciŋ ɗe nikka ndengiɗ tir.<verse eid="ACT 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 3:8"/>A kurukka japit, a tufukka, a tiindeeɗa. A hunnda na ɓa, a aassa Kahan Kooh, a tiindeeɗa, a gongtiɗkeeɗa, a yakɗeeɗa Kooh. <verse eid="ACT 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 3:9"/>Ɓooɓa jen hotta ɗe tiindeeɗa, a gidmeeɗa Kooh. <verse eid="ACT 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 3:10"/>Ɓa inhissa ɗe ne a yi meeɗ ɓoof, a yalwaanee ŋ buntaana na woyse "moɗohngaani" ŋ Kahan Kooh, weɗ ɓa jaahɗoh, ɓa feyuusa ŋ ini raak.<verse eid="ACT 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Woo kiŋ Piyeer</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 3:11"/>Ƴaara lafñee nikka ŋoɗiɗ ŋ Piyeer na Saaŋ, ɓooɓa jen feyuusa, ɓa faɗsukka ɗiska ɓi Piyeer nikee ŋ ɗiska na woyse Perngaŋ-Suleymaan ngaŋ Kahan Kooh. <verse eid="ACT 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 3:12"/>Wa Piyeer hot ineem, a woosa mboolnda ne : « Israayel ci, wa ye tah ɗu feyuusa ŋ inii, wa ye tah ɗu markee ɓoo ? Ɗu liiɓ ne wa hatiliŋ ɓoo, wala nupi ɓoo nup Kooh tah ƴaarii wir po a tiinde e ?<verse eid="ACT 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 3:13"/>Koohiŋ Ibrahiima na Isaahha na Yaŋhooɓa, Koohiŋ caac ciŋ ɓoo, teeɓohiɗ yaki surgaaniŋ ɗe Yeesu yak. Te e ɗu eɗoh ɗe, ɗu taasukka ɗe ŋ fiki Pilaat yi tufkee ŋ kot faɗis ɗe. <verse eid="ACT 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 3:14"/>Ɗu taaskiɗ Yi hool wuu Kooh te a yurahha, ɗu kiimmba Pilaat ne, ɗu faɗsiɗu apoh ɓo'.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:11-27">Macce 27:11-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-15">Maarko 15:1-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:3-25">Luk 23:3-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-19:16">Saaŋ 18:28–19:16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 3:15"/>Ɗu apɗukiɗ Heɗ kipes ki, waaye Kooh hultiɗiɗ ɗe. Ɓoo nak, ɓoo miniɗ seede ineem.<verse eid="ACT 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 3:16"/>Kosi ɓoo kos Yeesu, weɗ tah woo ki ɓoo woo ŋ tiikiŋ ɗe onnda ƴaari ɗu na hote yii te ɗu inahha ɗe, hatil po a minnda tufuk ndengiɗ. E tiikiŋ Yeesu, na kosi puloh nga ɗe, on ƴaari wir jameet findi ɗu hotoha an.<verse eid="ACT 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 3:17"/>Ɗiski wa nik ndii ɓaah ciŋ ngo, ŋ inhiɗ ne ɗu tum Yeesu ineem ŋ inhaaɗi, ɗu na kilifaaciŋ ɗu. <verse eid="ACT 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 3:18"/>Waaye Kooh raakiɗta ineem ne ini a woyee maañiɗ taamboh ŋ woo ciŋ woosuuɗ ci jen raak, ne <char style="w" lemma="Mucɗohi Gapohse">Mucɗohi a gapohee</char> joyiɗ raak miskiɗ.<verse eid="ACT 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 3:19"/>Mbaa ɓoƴsohaat pesohaaɗ, ɗu wiiruk ŋ Kooh ne a moos bakaaɗ ciŋ ɗu. <verse eid="ACT 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 3:20"/>Ŋ ineem, Heɗ ɓoo hey ɗu one ɓi jamano iɗsiɗkoha, a woosoh ɗu Mucɗohi a tanɗee ɗu maañiɗ, Yeesu. <verse eid="ACT 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 3:21"/>Waaye ɗiski wa nik, Eel ci joyiɗ daliɗ Yeesu po jamanooni in ci jen doknohsan as, findi Kooh woyoha maañiɗ taamboh ŋ woo ciŋ woosuuɗ ciŋ ɗe hooliɗ ci.<verse eid="ACT 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 3:22"/>Laam <char style="w">Musaa</char> woyeen ne : “ Heɗi, Koohiŋ ɗu, hey ɗu woosohe Woosuuɗ findiiso, a pulohan cuuɓiŋ ɗu, sikɗukaat in ci a woyan ɗu jen. <verse eid="ACT 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 3:23"/>Te ɓo' nu sikɗukɗi Woosuuɗeem ɗah, a hey pulɗasse ŋ cuuɓiŋ Kooh, a apu.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:29">Lewiici 23:29</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 18:15">Rohƴiɗi 18:15</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 18:19">19</ref></char></note> ” <verse eid="ACT 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 3:24"/>Woosuuɗ ci woo jen, ina amboh ŋ Samuwel<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 1:20-25:1">1 Samuwel 1:20–25:1</ref></char></note> po ɓi taamb nga ɗe, findi ɓa hend jen, namiɗ yegɗoh mbeh ci ɓoo na pese cii.<verse eid="ACT 3:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 3:25"/>E ɗu lam woosuuɗ ceem, ambtiɗohi Kooh tufkiɗee na caac ciŋ ɗu, wa wuu ɗu wi a woyee Ibrahiima ne : “ Ŋ hey barke'ɗe cuuɓ ciŋ kehƴi jen taamboh ŋ ɓi na hee rimkohe nga ɗa. ” <verse eid="ACT 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 3:26"/>Kooh koc woos surgaaniŋ ɗe nga ɗu, a woosiɗ ɗe ne a barke'iɗ ɗu, a tum po yaa nu nga ɗu ɗah eɗ finho tumohaaɗ ciŋ ɗe moɗaaɗiici. »<verse eid="ACT 3:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ACT 4"/>
  <para style="s">Piyeer na Saaŋ ŋ fiki atte'oh ca</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 4:1"/>Wa Piyeer na Saaŋ woyee na ɓooɓa, weɗ <char style="w">seeƴkiɗoh</char> caŋ <char style="w" lemma="waasiŋ Musaa">waasiŋ</char> <char style="w">Musaa</char> hunoh na ƴaara adgohee ɓooɓa niiɗee <char style="w">Kahan Kooh</char>, na ɓi <char style="w"><char style="tl">Sadusen</char></char>, ɓa hayya. <verse eid="ACT 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 4:2"/>Ɓa ayrukka Piyeer na Saaŋ ŋ ini ɓeem jangɗee ɓooɓa, woyeeɗa ɓa ne Yeesu hultiɗ te ɓa ndengɗeeɗa ne kaaniɗ ci hey hulte. <verse eid="ACT 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 4:3"/>Ɓa ammba ɓa, ɓa taƴohaahha ɓa sagu hooɓa Kooh hooɓe. <verse eid="ACT 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 4:4"/>Waaye raak laayiɗ ŋ ɓi kerhee jangɗohiŋ <char style="w"><char style="tl">Apootar</char></char> ci kosiɗ. Ɓi kosee jen, ƴaar ci dong reyeen junni-yatuus (5000).<verse eid="ACT 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 4:5"/>Wa Kooh wiis, weɗ kilifaaca na yakak ca na jangɗohoh caŋ waasiŋ Musaa, ɓi nikee ŋ Yerusalem cohoh. <verse eid="ACT 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 4:6"/>Hannas seeƴkiɗoha yakka nikee nga na Kayif na Saaŋ na Aleksaandar na ɓi kahan seeƴkiɗoha yakka jen. <verse eid="ACT 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 4:7"/>Ɓa nakohha komu Piyeer na Saaŋ ŋ leerooɓa, ɓa meekissa ɓa ne : « Ini ɗu haɓiɗ wii, ɗu haɓɗoha winde hatil ? Ɗu tuma ŋ tiikiŋ ya ɓa ? »<verse eid="ACT 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 4:8"/>Ŋ ndeem, Piyeer riiffa na <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani</char>, a woosa ɓa ne : « Ɗu ɓi kilifaaciŋ cuuɓi, na yakak ci, <verse eid="ACT 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 4:9"/>nik ne ɓoo na meeksasse woti, ini baahiɗi ɓoo tumiɗ ɓo' lafñiɗ, na findi a wirɗohu ɗah, <verse eid="ACT 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 4:10"/>ɗu jen, na Israayel ci findi ɓa hend jen inhaat ne ɓoo taamboh ŋ tiikiŋ Yeesu <char style="w">Kiristaa</char> yiŋ Nasareet ; saguuce weɗ tah ƴaarii tufkiɗ moɗoɗ ŋ fikiiɗu. Yeesu yeem, e ɗu daaƴ ɗe ŋ kurwaa, waaye Kooh hultiɗiɗ ɗe.<verse eid="ACT 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 4:11"/>Fiis ci Hooliɗ ci woo ŋ a yi ne :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:11">“ Atoh fi ɗu ɓi taɓahoh ci mbete</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:11">mirndohiɗ nik</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:11">atoh fi amb taɓahi.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:22">Sabuur 118:22</ref></char></note> ”<verse eid="ACT 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 4:12"/>Ali ɓo' minɗi muc, ne wa taambohɗi ŋ Yeesu ɗah. Ŋ Adina jen Kooh eɗoh ɗe dong ne tiikiŋ ɗe min mucɗohu. »<verse eid="ACT 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 4:13"/>Wa ɓa hot kaañi Piyeer na Saaŋ kaañ ini ɓa woye, ɓa feyuusa, laam ɓa inah ɓa ɓo' an rek, ɓo' jangaaɗi. Ɓa inhissa ne ɓa meeɗ hun na Yeesu. <verse eid="ACT 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 4:14"/>Waaye hota ɓa hotee ƴaara wirɗu tufkiɗ ŋ sero <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ci kanak ci, tahha po ɓa raakɗi woyaah. <verse eid="ACT 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 4:15"/>Ɓa woosa Piyeer na Saaŋ ne ɓa pulaat ŋ atte'ohaana, atte'oh ca tassa nga ne ɓa hotoh ŋ harmban ɓa. <verse eid="ACT 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 4:16"/>Ɓa woosa ne : « Ɓoo tuman ƴaaɓii na ? Ɓa haɓɗiɗ keemaan hooliɗ te ɓi Yerusalem jen inhiɗa, ɓoo minɗaa taas. <verse eid="ACT 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 4:17"/>Waaye wa joyɗi ɓaat pasarkoh ŋ harmban ɓooɓi, kon ɓoo huflukaat ɓa po ɓa woyissuu na ali ɓo' ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ tiikiŋ ƴaareem. »<verse eid="ACT 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 4:18"/>Ɓa ɓeeɗukka Piyeer na Saaŋ, ɓa sangohha ɓa keeh-keeh ne ɓa kinaat woyis wala ɓa jangɗohee ŋ tiikiŋ Yeesu. <verse eid="ACT 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 4:19"/>Waaye Piyeer na Saaŋ loffa ɓa ne : « Wa ye weɗ yurah ŋ has ciŋ Kooh, kerhiɗ ɗu wala kerhiɗ Kooh ? Atte'aat ! <verse eid="ACT 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 4:20"/>Ini kaɗ nga ɓoo, ɓoo minɗi ɗek ini ɓoo hot, kerahhaa. » <verse eid="ACT 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 4:21"/>Atte'oh ca ɓaatta hufluk Piyeer na Saaŋ, ɓa faɗissa ɓa, ɓa raakeeɗi waas nga ɓa ne ɓa tum ɓa miskiɗ laam ɓooɓa jen nikee yakɗeeɗa Kooh ŋ ini raakee weem. <verse eid="ACT 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 4:22"/>Ƴaara wirɗassee wirɗa feyohɗa uupɗeen kiis ndaŋkiyaah-nikiis (40).<verse eid="ACT 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kosiɗ ci kiimiɗ Kooh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 4:23"/>Wa Piyeer na Saaŋ faɗsu, ɓa kaɗta ŋ huntoh caŋ ɓa, ɓa naandsukka ɓa in ca kilifaacaŋ seeƴkiɗoh ca na yakak ca woo ɓa jen. <verse eid="ACT 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 4:24"/>Wa ɓa kerah ineem, ɓa jen ɓa hunnda ɓa kiimeeɗa Kooh an : « Heɗ ɓoo, a fu fer Eel ci na kehƴi na cookmi na in ci nik nga ca jen. <verse eid="ACT 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 4:25"/>A fu eɗ Dawuuda Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Dawuuda, yi caaciŋ ɓoo, surgaaniŋ ɗa. Fu taambohha nga ɗe, fu woosa ne :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:25">“ Wa ye tah cuuɓ ci ɗuuɗe ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:25">Wa ye tah</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:25">ɓooɓi waakohee ne ɓa tum in baahaaɗi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:25">ŋ ɓarang ɓarang ?<verse eid="ACT 4:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 4:26"/>Buur ciŋ kehƴi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:26">na kooɗkiɗe hiñoh,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:26">ɓi raak hatil hun ne</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:26">ɓa hiñoh na Heɗ ɓoo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:26">na buuri a tufkiɗ.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:1-2">Sabuur 2:1-2</ref></char></note> ”<verse eid="ACT 4:26"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 4:27"/>Laam wa keeh ne Herod Antipas na Ponse Pilaat ambsukohiɗ ŋ kur-taahii, ɓa hunnda na cuuɓ ci cinooci na Israayel ci jen ne ɓa hiñoh Yeesu, surgaaniŋ ɗa hooliɗi, yi fu tufkiɗ. <verse eid="ACT 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 4:28"/>Ɓa na tume in ci fu kooɗkiɗee maañiɗ ŋ hatiliŋ ɗa, ŋ ini neɓ ɗa. <verse eid="ACT 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 4:29"/>Ɗiski wa nik ndii, Heɗ ɓoo, marka findi ɓa na huflukohee ɓoo. Ona ɓoo, ɓi <char style="w">ñaam</char> ciŋ ɗa, ɓoo yegɗoh woo kiŋ ɗa te ɓoo neƴƴohuu nga. <verse eid="ACT 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 4:30"/>Raɗsa hatiliŋ yaahiŋ ɗa ne wir raak na ɓi firnde na keemaan ŋ tiikiŋ Yeesu surgaaniŋ ɗa hooliɗi. »<verse eid="ACT 4:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 4:31"/>Wa ɓa ƴut kiim Kooh, ɗiska ɓa cohee yoondeeɗa. Ɓa jen, ɓa riiffa na Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, ɓa yegɗoheeɗa woo kiŋ Kooh te ɓa neƴƴoheeɗi nga.<verse eid="ACT 4:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kosiɗ ca ɓaahiɗ in caŋ ɓa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 4:32"/>Ɓooɓa kosee jen hunnda, nikka yino, ɓeɗ ɓaahee keeñ yino na liiɓohaaɗ. Ali ɓo' woyeeɗi nga ɓa ne raak-raakiŋ ɗe, a yi raaka kiik ce, waaye ɓa ambsohee ambsoh in caŋ ɓa jen yino. <verse eid="ACT 4:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 4:33"/><char style="tl">Apootar</char> ci seede'eeɗa na hatil keeh-keeh, ne Heɗ ɓoo Yeesu hultiɗ, te Kooh baahoheeɗa ɓa keeh-keeh yaa nu nga ɗah. <verse eid="ACT 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 4:34"/>Ali ɓo' nga ɓa ñakeeɗi. Ɓi raakee yohon na kahan tooneeɗa ca, ɓa ɓayya candooma, <verse eid="ACT 4:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 4:35"/>ɓa deggaa ŋ yaah ciŋ <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ci, wa paysohuusa, yaa nu nga eɗuusa in hend na ini a etoh.<verse eid="ACT 4:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 4:36"/>Raakeen ƴaar nga ɓa teeku Suseef, a ɓaahee ŋ <char style="w">Lewiici</char>, a nikee ɓo' Siipar. <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ci teekee ɗe Barnabaas, wa tokis "ƴaari na ñaahe ɓooɓi". <verse eid="ACT 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 4:37"/>A toonnda yohon ce, a ɓayya kopora, a deggaa ŋ yaah ciŋ <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ci.<verse eid="ACT 4:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ACT 5"/>
  <para style="s">Anañaas na Safiira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 5:1"/>Waaye wa raakeen ƴaar teeku Anañaas na ɓitiice Safiira. Raakka yohni ɓa toon. <verse eid="ACT 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 5:2"/>Ƴaara ɗaakka ɓak ŋ kopora, ɓitiice nammba hun na ɗe ŋ ineem, ini tas ŋ kopora a ɓayyaa, a deggaa ŋ yaah ciŋ <char style="w"><char style="tl">Apootar</char></char> ci.<verse eid="ACT 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 5:3"/>Piyeer woosa ɗe ne : « Anañaas, wa ye tah fu faɗta Seytaani a riiffa keeñiŋ ɗa ? Po fu leyee <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani</char> ŋ ɗasɗi fu ɗasiɗ ɓak ngaŋ kopori fu toonoh yohon fu. <verse eid="ACT 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 5:4"/>Wi fu toonohɗaa, wa nikee wuu fu haa e ? Fu mineena sang toon, wala wi fu toona, kopori nikee wuu fu, fu mineen tum ini neɓ ɗa naa. Fu liiɓoh tum in mand an na ŋ keeñiŋ ɗa ? Fu lee ɓo' haa, fu lee Kooh ! »<verse eid="ACT 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 5:5"/>Wa Anañaas kerah woo ceem, a keennda, a kaannda. Ɓooɓa kerhee naandsukiŋ wa jen neƴƴohha keeh-keeh. <verse eid="ACT 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 5:6"/>Komaakca fiir ca hayya, ɓa muurra fiɗaafa, ɓa ɓayyaa ne ɓa uumb ɗe.<verse eid="ACT 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 5:7"/>Wa degga ini ree wahtu kaahay ɓitiice aassa ; a inheeɗi ini raak. <verse eid="ACT 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 5:8"/>Piyeer meekissa ɗe ne : « Woyaa so, ɗu toonoh kehƴi candoomii e ? » A loffa ne : « Ee, ɓoo toonoha ineem. » <verse eid="ACT 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 5:9"/>Piyeer woosa ɗe ne : « Ɗu min kerhiɗoh na ne ɗu markisuk <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsiŋ Heɗ ɓoo</char> ? Kot ci fu kerah ŋ yahndeeri, e ɓooɓi puloh uumba ƴaar fu ; ɓa hey ɗa name ɓay. »<verse eid="ACT 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 5:10"/>Ŋ saasi saasi, a keennda ŋ kot ciŋ Piyeer, a kaannda. Komaakca fiir ca aassa, ɓa hotta ne a kaaniɗ, ɓa ɓayya ɗe, ɓa uummba ɗe ŋ sero ƴaar ce. <verse eid="ACT 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 5:11"/>Ɓi Janguuna jen na ɓooɓa kerah ina raak jen neƴƴohha keeh-keeh.<verse eid="ACT 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">
    <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ca tumiɗ in feyohiɗ laayiɗ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 5:12"/>Kooh taambohha ŋ <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ci, a tumeeɗa in feyohiɗ na keemaan laayiɗ, ɓooɓa jen hoteeɗa nga. Kosiɗ ca jen ŋ findi ɓa hend, ɓa meeɗ meeɗ coh ŋ bayaalaŋ <char style="w">Kahan Kooh</char>, ŋ Perngaŋ-Suleymaan. <verse eid="ACT 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 5:13"/>Ali ɓo' wiiriis kaañeeɗi kaɗ nga ɓa, waaye ɓooɓa jen woyee in baahiɗ nga ɓa. <verse eid="ACT 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 5:14"/>Ɓooɓa kosee Heɗi uupeeɗa nga uup laay ƴaar na ɓitiɓ, ɓa ɓaatuusa ŋ mboolndaŋ kosiɗ ca.<verse eid="ACT 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 5:15"/>E keemaan ceem tah kosaayiɗ ca sah pulɗasseeɗa ŋ kahan ca, ɓa degseeɗa ŋ mbeeddaaca, ngaŋ fiƴaang wala ŋ basang ne Piyeer taamb ɗah, findi wa min mand ɗah, raak ɓi saangniŋ ɗe laalan. <verse eid="ACT 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 5:16"/>Ɓo' laayiɗ nameeɗa puloh kur ca wilee Yerusalem, ɓa ɓayeeɗa kosaayiɗ ca na ɓooɓa <char style="w">jiini</char> ambe, ɓa jen ɓa wirɗasseeɗa.<verse eid="ACT 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ambuukaŋ <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ca</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 5:17"/>Ŋ ineem, <char style="w" lemma="seeƴkiɗoh">seeƴkiɗoha</char> yakka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:17 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Seeƴkiɗoha yakka </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: a yi adgohee seeƴkiɗoh ciŋ Yawuut ci jen. A aasangee waas yino ŋ kiis ki ngaŋ <char style="w" lemma="Ɗiski Hooliɗi na Ɗiski Hoolohngaani">Ɗiska Hoolohngaana</char> ne a seeƴuk wuu Kooh. A yi dong meeɗ aas nga.</char></note> na ɓooɓa nikee na ɗe jen, ɓeɗ ɓa <char style="w"><char style="tl">Sadusen</char></char> ca, ɓa siissa <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ca, ɓa tufukka ŋ kot tum in ; <verse eid="ACT 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 5:18"/>ɓa ammba <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ci ɓa taƴca ɓa ŋ kasoona. <verse eid="ACT 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 5:19"/>Waaye ŋ weka, malaaka Heɗ ɓoo rangissa buntaacaŋ wa, a puliɗta ɓa, a woosa ɓa ne : <verse eid="ACT 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 5:20"/>« Kaɗaat Kahan Kooh, ɗu woo ɓooɓa woo ciŋ kipes ki asi wii. » <verse eid="ACT 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 5:21"/><char style="tl">Apootar</char> ci kerhiɗta ɗe, na ɓaaɓa teel ɓa kaɗta Kahan Kooh ɓa jangɗoheeɗa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:21">Seeƴkiɗoha yakka raakka coh na ɓooɓa na hune na ɗe, ɓa ɓeeɗukka <char style="w" lemma="saangniŋ yakak ciŋ Israayel">saangnaŋ yakak caŋ Israayel</char> jen, ɓa woossa ɓi ɓo' ne ɓa kaɗ ɓaya <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ca ŋ kasoona. <verse eid="ACT 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 5:22"/>Dag ca kaɗta kasoona waaye ɓa raakɗi ɓa nga. Ɓa dokukka, ɓa woosa ina ɓa ɓayoh nga an : <verse eid="ACT 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 5:23"/>« Ɓoo raak kasoona ranguuɗ ndengiɗ te niiɗoh ca nikee nga ŋ fiki yahndeera, waaye wi ɓoo rangis, ɓoo hotɗi ali ɓo' nga ɓa ŋ ɗooƴa. »<verse eid="ACT 5:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 5:24"/>Wa kilifaanaŋ dag ca niiɗee Kahan Kooh kerah woo keem, a yi na kilifaacaŋ seeƴkiɗoh ca, ɓa feyuusa, ɓa liiɓeeɗa ini rahas <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ci na findi wa mirndohan. <verse eid="ACT 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 5:25"/>Ŋ ineem ƴaar hayya woosa ɓa ne : « Ƴaaɓi ɗu taƴee ŋ kasoona, ɓa ɗaa ŋ Kahan Kooh na jangɗe ɓooɓa. » <verse eid="ACT 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 5:26"/>Weɗ kilifaanaŋ dag ca hunoh na ɓi dag, ɓa kaɗta, ɓa ɓayya ɓa ɓay moɗoɗ, ɓa kaañeeɗi ɓa tum in, sagu neƴƴoh ne mboolnda tap ɓa atoh.<verse eid="ACT 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 5:27"/>Wa ɓa ɓay ɓa, ɓa tufkiɗta ɓa ŋ fiki saangnaŋ yakak ca, seeƴkiɗoha yakka woosa ɓa ne : <verse eid="ACT 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 5:28"/>« Ɓoo sangoheeɗi ɗu keeh-keeh ne kinaat jangɗohis ŋ tiikiŋ ƴaareem e ? Weɗɗi, ɗu riifɗiɗ Yerusalem jen na jangɗohiŋ ɗu, ɓaatta nga, ɗu waaɗ ɓoo raan kakaan kiŋ ƴaareem ! »<verse eid="ACT 5:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 5:29"/>Piyeer na <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ci ɓinooɓi loffa ne : « Kerhiɗ Kooh weɗ ngisoh kerhiɗ ɓooɓi. <verse eid="ACT 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 5:30"/>Koohiŋ caac ciŋ ɓoo hultiɗiɗ Yeesu yi ɗu ap ŋ daaƴi ɗu daaƴ ɗe ŋ kurwaa. <verse eid="ACT 5:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 5:31"/>Kooh meeɓiɗ ɗe, po ŋ ñaahmiŋ ɗe, a tummba ɗe adgohoh na Mucɗoh ne a on Israayel ci ɓa ɓoƴsoh pesohaaɗ, ɓa ɗaasu bakaaɗ ciŋ ɓa. <verse eid="ACT 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 5:32"/>Ɓoo nak, ɓoo seede ngaŋ in ceem, ɓoo na Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani Kooh eɗ ɓi kerhiɗ ɗe. »<verse eid="ACT 5:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 5:33"/>Woo ceem ayrukiɗta ɓooɓaŋ saangna po ɓa heeɗa pooke, ɓa waaɗta ap <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ci. <verse eid="ACT 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 5:34"/>Waaye <char style="w"><char style="tl">Farisen</char></char> nikeen ngaŋ saangnaŋ yakak ca, a teeku Gamaliyel, a nikee jangɗohoh ŋ <char style="w" lemma="waasiŋ Musaa">waasiŋ</char> <char style="w">Musaa</char>, ɓooɓa jen eɗeen ɗe cir. A kurukka, a nakohha ne <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ci pulɗu ƴissuut.<verse eid="ACT 5:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 5:35"/>Ƴutta a woosa ɓooɓa ne : « Ɓaah ci, ɗu ɓi Israayel ci, wortukaat ini ɗu na hee tume ƴaaɓii. <verse eid="ACT 5:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 5:36"/>Maañaaɗi ƴaar teeku Tedaas hayiɗ, a tummba haf ce ɓo' yakak, ɓooɓi ñaakɗee ɗe nikee ŋ ɓak teemet-nikiis (400). Waaye wi a apu, ɓi ñaakɗee ɗe jen pasarkohha, ɓo' kerhisɗi ɓa. <verse eid="ACT 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 5:37"/>Wa a coot, Yudaa yi genee Galile nammba hay, wa nikee ŋ jamanoona ɓooɓiŋ kur ki kindse. A nammba nook ɓo' laayiɗ, ɓa ñaakiɗta ɗe. Wi a kaan, ɓooɓi ñaakɗee ɗe jen pasarkohha.<verse eid="ACT 5:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 5:38"/>Ɗiski wa nik, ñam na woyee ɗu ne : Kinaat rahsoh tus na ƴaaɓii, faɗaat ɓa ɓa coot. Nik ne ini tah ɓa kuruk na ini ɓa na tume puloh ŋ ɓo' ɗah, wa hey yahrukohe. <verse eid="ACT 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 5:39"/>Waaye nik ne wa puloh ŋ Kooh ɗah, ɗu minanɗaa yahroh. Wa miniɗ ɗu ɓek sah, hiñoh na Kooh. Wortukaat ineem ! »</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:39">Atte'oh ca jen hunnda na ɗe. <verse eid="ACT 5:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 5:40"/>Ɓa ɓeeɗukka <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ci, ɓa laɓɗukka ɓa. Ɓa woosa ɓa ne ɓa kinaat woyis ŋ tiikiŋ Yeesu ; ƴutta ɓa faɗta ɓa ne ɓa coot.<verse eid="ACT 5:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 5:41"/>
    <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ci pulohha saangna, ɓa nikka sumoh na sumoh, ŋ ini Kooh attee ɓa ne ɓa yeyyoo'iɗ ƴissuutɗu sagu tiikiŋ Yeesu. <verse eid="ACT 5:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 5:42"/>Kooh-nu-wiis, ɓa meeɗta kaɗ Kahan Kooh na kahan ca cinooca, ɓa taalndiɗta, ɓa jangɗoheeɗa, ɓa woyeeɗa <char style="w">Yegɗohiŋ Muci</char>, ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ Yeesu, <char style="w">Mucɗohi Gapohse</char>.<verse eid="ACT 5:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ACT 6"/>
  <para style="s">Ɓo' yasna-kanak kooɗuuɗ ne ɓa ɓaatɗoh <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ci</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 6:1"/>Ŋ jamanoocaam, taalubeeca ɓaatkeeɗa ɓaatuk, ŋ ineem Yawuut ca woyee <char style="w">gerek</char> lahtukeeɗa ŋ ɓa woyee heber. Ɓa lahtukee ne, ɓitiɓ ca ƴaar caŋ ɓa kaan te ɓa ɓaahha nga ɓa, meeɗ meeɗ sagankohu ŋ paysoh ca meeɗ paysohu Kooh-nu-wiis. <verse eid="ACT 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 6:2"/>Wa <char style="w"><char style="tl">Apootar</char></char> ci ndaŋkiyaah na kanak ci (12) keraha, ɓa cohɗohha taalubeeca jen, ɓa woosa ɓa ne : « Wa moɗɗi ɓoo faɗ jangɗohiŋ woo kiŋ Kooh, ɓoo taambkohee paysoh kañam. <verse eid="ACT 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 6:3"/>Kon, ɓaah ciŋ ɓoo, kooɗaat ŋ ɗooƴ ɗu ƴaar yasna-kanak ɓi raak seede moɗiɗ, riiffa na <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani</char> te ɓa raakka liiɓohaaɗ moɗiɗ, ɓoo dengkoh ɓa pangkeem. <verse eid="ACT 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 6:4"/>Ini kaɗ ŋ ɓoo, ɓoo min taalndiɗ yurhiɗkoh kiimiŋ Kooh na pangkiŋ jangɗohiŋ woo kiŋ ɗe. »<verse eid="ACT 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 6:5"/>Ɓooɓa jen hunnda teyɗukka woo keem. Weɗ ɓa tanoh Ecen, ƴaar kosiɗ lool, te a riiffa na Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani. Ɓa tannda a yi na Filip, Porokor, Nikanoor, Timoon, Parmenaas, na Nikola ƴaariŋ Añcos ci aasee ŋ waasiŋ Yawuut ci. <verse eid="ACT 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 6:6"/>Ɓa ɓayya ɓooɓeem ŋ <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ci, ɓeem degga ɓa yaah ciŋ ɓa, kiimiɗta ɓa Kooh. <verse eid="ACT 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 6:7"/>Woo kiŋ Kooh uupeeɗa nga uup pasarkoh, taalubeeca uupeeɗa nga uup laay lool ŋ Yerusalem. Te <char style="w">seeƴkiɗoh</char> Yawuut laayiɗ teyɗukka kos Yeesu.<verse eid="ACT 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ecen ambuuɗ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 6:8"/>Kooh baahohha Ecen, a onnda ɗe hatil po a tumeeɗa keemaan, a teeɓoheeɗa firnde yakak ŋ ɗooƴ ɓooɓa. <verse eid="ACT 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 6:9"/>Waaye raakka ɓi ɓo' ɓaah ŋ <char style="w" lemma="sinaagog"><char style="tl">sinaagoga</char></char> teeksee "<char style="tl">Sinaagogiŋ</char> <char style="w">Ñaam</char> ci faɗsuuɗ ci", ɓa taastiɗoheeɗa na Ecen. Ɓooɓeem nikee Yawuut, ɓa pulohee Sireen na Aleksandiri, ɓum pulohha Silisi na Asi. <verse eid="ACT 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 6:10"/>Waaye ɓa mineeɗi ɗe ɓur, laam Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani oneen ɗe liiɓohaaɗ moɗiɗ po a minnda woo baahiɗ.<verse eid="ACT 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 6:11"/>Ŋ ndeem, ɓa wirinnda ɓi ɓo' ne ɓa woo ne : « Ɓoo kerhiɗ Ecen woyeeɗa in moɗaaɗi ŋ <char style="w">Musaa</char> na Kooh. » <verse eid="ACT 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 6:12"/>Ɓa yopoh ɓooɓa na yakak ca na jangɗohoh caŋ <char style="w">waasiŋ Musaa</char> ɗaa ; ɓeem keennda Ecen, ɓa ammba ɗe, ɓa ɓayya ɗe ŋ <char style="w" lemma="saangniŋ yakak ciŋ Israayel">saangnaŋ yakak caŋ Israayel</char>. <verse eid="ACT 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 6:13"/>Ɓa ɓayya ɓi seede leyoh, ɓeem woyeeɗa ne : « Ƴaarii na kurkeeɗi ŋ woo woo moɗaaɗi ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ <char style="w">Kahan Kooh</char> na waasiŋ Musaa. <verse eid="ACT 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 6:14"/>Ɓoo kerhiɗ ɗe woyeeɗa ne Yeesu yiŋ Nasareet yeem hey fole Kahniŋ Kooh wii, a ɓoƴsoh mbaah ci Musaa faɗiɗ ɓoo. »<verse eid="ACT 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 6:15"/>Ɓooɓaŋ saangnaŋ yakak ca jen junnga ŋ Ecen, markeeɗa ɗe, ɓa hotta fikiiriŋ ɗe melciɗeeɗa findi fiki malaaka.<verse eid="ACT 6:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ACT 7"/>
  <para style="s">Woo kiŋ Ecen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 7:1"/>Weɗ <char style="w" lemma="seeƴkiɗoh">seeƴkiɗoha</char> yakka meeksoh Ecen ne : « In ci fu na yambse ca keeh e ? » <verse eid="ACT 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 7:2"/>Ecen loffa ne : « Ɓaah ciŋ ngo na baab ciŋ ngo, sikɗukaat to. Kooh yi Heɗ ndam, teeɓkiɗ caac ɓoo Ibrahiima, waam raak ɗe ŋ Mesopotami bala a hayan gene ŋ Haaraan ɗah.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:7">Camba 15:7</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 9:7">Nehemi 9:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 7:3"/>Kooh woosa ɗe ne : “ Faɗa kur ki fu genoh, fu faɗ ɓaah ciŋ ɗa ; fu kaɗ ŋ kur ki maa hee ɗa teeɓe.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:1">Camba 12:1</ref> </char></note> ” <verse eid="ACT 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 7:4"/>Ŋ ineem, Ibrahiima pulohha kur kaŋ Kaldeeca, a kaɗta, a gennda ŋ Haaraan.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 7:4">Ŋ finho kakaan kaŋ baab ɓa, Kooh haytohha ɗe ŋ kur ki ɗu genoh wii woti-woti. <verse eid="ACT 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 7:5"/>Kooh onɗi ɗe ali keheƴ, a onɗi ɗe sah in hend na ɗiski a min deg kot. Waaye a gappa ɗe ne a hey ɗe one kur ki, a yi na ɓi na hee rimkohe nga ɗe ŋ finhooce, te moona waam raak ɗe raakɗi kuɓu ndoom.<verse eid="ACT 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 7:6"/>Inii weɗ Kooh woo ɗe :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:6">“ Set ciŋ ɗa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:6">hey nike jaambur</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:6">ŋ kur ka ɓa raakɗi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:6">ɓa tumu <char style="w">ñaam</char> nga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:6">ɓa torhiɗu kiis teemet-nikiis (400). ”<verse eid="ACT 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 7:7"/>Waaye Kooh degga nga ne :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:7">“ Ŋ hey atte'e</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:7">ɓi kur ka ɓa tumohu ñaam</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:7">ŋ finho ineem,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:7">ɓa hey pulohe nga,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:13-14">Camba 15:13-14</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:7">ɓa hay yo ñaamke ŋ ndii. ”<verse eid="ACT 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 7:8"/>Ƴutta Kooh ambtiɗohha na Ibrahiima, a eɗta ɗe <char style="w">nguɗuk</char> ne wa teeɓohee ambtiɗoheem.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:10-14">Camba 17:10-14</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 7:8">Ibrahiima raakka kuɓu ƴaar Isaahha, a nguɗta ɗe ŋ mbeha yasna-kaahayɗoh.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:4">Camba 21:4</ref></char></note> Isaahha nammba tum kuɓkiŋ ɗe Yaŋhooɓa ɗaa, yeem nammba tum kuɓuuciŋ ɗe ndaŋkiyaah na kanak ci (12) ɗaa, ɓeɗ ɓi caac ciŋ cuuɓ ciŋ ɓoo.<verse eid="ACT 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 7:9"/>Siisa ɓeem siisee taambɗoh ɓa Yuusufa<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 37:11">Camba 37:11</ref></char></note> tahha po ɓa toonnda ɗe ne a tumsa ñaam ŋ <char style="w">Misra</char>.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 37:28">Camba 37:28</ref></char></note> Waaye Kooh nikee na ɗe, <verse eid="ACT 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 7:10"/>a pulɗohha ɗe ŋ miskiɗ ciŋ ɗe jen. Kooh tummba po a neɓpa Firawnaana, buuraŋ Misra, a nammba ɗe on liiɓohaaɗ moɗiɗ ŋ fiki buura po yeem tummba ɗe goornooraŋ <char style="w">Misra</char> na kilifaanaŋ kahan ce jen.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 41:39-41">Camba 41:39-41</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 7:11"/>Weɗ aɗ raakoh ŋ kur kaŋ Misra jen na Kanaan. Wa misikka nga ɓa lool, po caac ciŋ ɓoo raakisɗi ñamaah. <verse eid="ACT 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 7:12"/>Wa Yaŋhooɓa kerah ne bele raakiɗ ŋ Misra, a woossa caac ciŋ ɓoo nga, wa nikka kaɗaŋ ɓa koc. <verse eid="ACT 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 7:13"/>Wi ɓa kaɗ kotaŋ ɓa kanakɗoh, Yuusufa tummba po taambɗoh ciŋ ɗe inhissa ɗe, ŋ ndeem Firawnaana inahha ɓi kahan Yuusufa. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 41:54-45:16">Camba 41:54–45:16</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 7:14"/>Yuusufa woosohha ne baab ɓa Yaŋhooɓa kaɗaat ɓaysa, a yi na ɓi kahan ɓa jen : ɓa nikeen ɓo' ndaŋkiyaah-yasna-kanak na ɓo' yatuus (75). <verse eid="ACT 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 7:15"/>Yaŋhooɓa kaɗoh Misra ɗaa<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 45:9-46:30">Camba 45:9–46:30</ref></char></note> ; a kaanoh nga,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 49:33">Camba 49:33</ref></char></note> a yi na caac ciŋ ɓoo. <verse eid="ACT 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 7:16"/>Fiɗaaf caŋ ɓa ɓayuusa Sisem, ɓa ɗasɗuusa ŋ ruy-ruya Ibrahiima romee na koporiŋ ɗe ŋ ɓi rimkoh Hamor ngaŋ Sisem.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 23:3-20">Camba 23:3-20</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 33:19">33:19</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 50:7-13">50:7-13</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 24:32">Yosuwe 24:32</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 7:17"/>Jamanoona Kooh hee mitɗohe ina a gapee Ibrahiima nikee reɓeeɗa ; raak cuuɓiŋ ɓoo ɓaatkiɗ, wa uupeeɗa uup laay ŋ <char style="w">Misra</char>, <verse eid="ACT 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 7:18"/>po findi buur wiiriis adgohoh kur ka, buureem inheeɗi Yuusufa. <verse eid="ACT 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 7:19"/>A ñaañohha cuuɓiŋ ɓoo, a tummba caac ciŋ ɓoo miskiɗ po a mbetɗukoheeɗa ɓa gooy caŋ ɓa ne ɓeem kaan.<verse eid="ACT 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 7:20"/>Jamanooneem weɗ <char style="w">Musaa</char> raakohu, a nikka komaaki moɗiɗ ŋ Kooh ; a taambkohseeɗa ŋ kahan baab ɓa po a raakka caɓin kaahay ; <verse eid="ACT 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 7:21"/>wi a mbetu, kuɓki ɓitɓiŋ Firawnaana parahha ɗe, a koɗta ɗe findi kuɓuuce. <verse eid="ACT 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 7:22"/>Wa kaɗoh ɗaa, Musaa jangɗuusa ki'inhiŋ ɓi Misra jen, a nikka ɓo' raakiɗ hatil ŋ woo na tum.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 1:1-2:10">Pula 1:1–2:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 7:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 7:23"/>Wi a raak kiis ndaŋkiyaah-nikiis (40) weɗ a liiɓoh kaɗ marka ɓaah ciŋ ɗe, Israayel ci. <verse eid="ACT 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 7:24"/>A hotta ƴaar gen Misra torhiɗeeɗa yino nga ɓa, a langɗoheeɗa ƴaara torhiɗasse, a wirndukɗeeɗa ɗe, a appa ƴaaraŋ Misraaca. <verse eid="ACT 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 7:25"/>A liiɓee ne ɓaah ciŋ ɗe hey inhe ne Kooh waaɗ taamboh nga ɗe ne a muciɗ ɓa, waaye ɓa inheeɗaa.<verse eid="ACT 7:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 7:26"/>Wa Kooh wiis, a hotta kanak ŋ ɓaah ciŋ ɗe hiñoheeɗa. A waaɗta ɓa kerhiɗohiɗ, a woosa ɓa ne : “ Ƴaaɓi, e ɗu ɓaah, wa ye tah ɗu hiñohe ? ” <verse eid="ACT 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 7:27"/>Waaye ƴaara torhiɗohee teyɗukɗi Musaa, a yennja ɗe, a woosa ɗe ne : “ Ya ɓa tum ɗa kilifaaniŋ ɓoo na atte'ohiŋ ɓoo ? <verse eid="ACT 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 7:28"/>Fu waaɗ to nam ap findi fu apoh ƴaariŋ Misraaci wotɓa e ? ” <verse eid="ACT 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 7:29"/>Wa Musaa kerah woo keem, a saandohha, a raayya ŋ kur kaŋ Majaan.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 2:11-15">Pula 2:11-15</ref> </char></note> A nikka ŋ ndaam, po a raakka kuɓu ƴaar kanak nga.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 18:3">Pula 18:3</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 18:4">4</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 7:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 7:30"/>Wa degga kiis ndaŋkiyaah-nikiis (40), malaaka teeɓukka Musaa ŋ kehƴa hulangaŋ tangooraŋ Sinaay, ŋ jaalaŋ yongkaahaŋ kidga ƴina gile. <verse eid="ACT 7:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 7:31"/>Wa Musaa hot ineem, a feyuusa. A reɓpa ne a maraka baahiɗ, weɗ a kerhoh hoosooriŋ Heɗ ɓoo an : <verse eid="ACT 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 7:32"/>“ A ñam Koohiŋ caac ciŋ ɗa, Koohiŋ Ibrahiima na Isaahha na Yaŋhooɓa ! ” Musaa tiitta po saakɗoheeɗa, a kaañisɗi marak. <verse eid="ACT 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 7:33"/>Heɗ ɓoo woosa ɗe ne : “ Wolsa ñafaɗ ciŋ ɗa ; ɗiski fu tufuk wa keheƴ hooliɗ. <verse eid="ACT 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 7:34"/>Ŋ hotiɗ torhiɗi cuuɓiŋ ngo na torhiɗasse ŋ Misra. Ŋ kerhiɗ iin ciŋ ɓa te ŋ ruhsiɗ ne ŋ naaf ɓa. Ɗiski wa nik, haya ŋ woos ɗa Misra.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:1-10">Pula 3:1-10</ref></char></note> ”<verse eid="ACT 7:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 7:35"/>Musaa yeem, a yi ɓaah ciŋ ɗe taaske, ɓa woyeeɗa ɗe ne : “ Ya ɓa tum ɗa kilifa na atte'oh ? ” Musaa a yi Kooh woos ne a nik kilifaani na yi na hee naafe cuuɓiŋ ɗe, taamboh ŋ ɓaatɗohiŋ malaakaani teeɓkee ɗe ŋ kidga ƴina. <verse eid="ACT 7:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 7:36"/>A Musaa puliɗ Israayel ci <char style="w">Misra</char>. A tumiɗ in feyohiɗ na keemaan laayiɗ ŋ kur keem,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 7-12">Pula 7–12</ref></char></note> na wa ɓa huusee Cookma-Ruumnda<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 14:21-15:20">Pula 14:21–15:20</ref></char></note> na wa ɓa nik ŋ kehƴa hulanga kiis ndaŋkiyaah-nikiis (40).<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 15:22-34:12">Pula 15:22–Rohƴiɗi 34:12</ref> </char></note><verse eid="ACT 7:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 7:37"/>A Musaa namee woo Israayel ci ne : “ Kooh hey ɗu woosohe Woosuuɗ findiiso, a pulohan ŋ cuuɓiŋ ɗu.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 18:15">Rohƴiɗi 18:15</ref></char></note> ” <verse eid="ACT 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 7:38"/>Wa ɓooɓa coh ŋ kehƴa hulanga, a Musaa namee nik ŋ harmban caac ciŋ ɓoo na malaakaana woyee na ɗe ŋ tangooraŋ Sinaay. A rahassa woo ciŋ kipes ki, ne a eɗ ɓoo ca.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:1-20:21">Pula 19:1–20:21</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5">Rohƴiɗi 5</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 7:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 7:39"/>Waaye caac ciŋ ɓoo waaɗeeɗi kerhiɗ Musaa, ɓa sannga ɗe teyɗuk, keeñ ciŋ ɓa jen nikee ŋ dokuk Misra. <verse eid="ACT 7:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 7:40"/>Ɓa kaɗta ŋ <char style="w">Aaruna</char>, ɓa woosa ɗe ne : “ Musaa ƴaari pulɗoh ɓoo Misra yii, ɓoo inahɗi ini rahas ɗe. Mbaa, haɓɗiɗa ɓoo kooh ci adgohan ɓoo. ” <verse eid="ACT 7:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 7:41"/>Ɓa tiɓɗukka ɗoon, ɓa tummbaa koohiŋ ɓa, ɓa seeƴkeeɗa nataaleem. Ɓa neɓuusa ŋ ina ɓa tiɓoot na yaah ciŋ ɓa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:1-6">Pula 32:1-6</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 7:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 7:42"/>Ŋ ndeem, Kooh suungɗukka ɓa, a faɗta ɓa ɓa ñaamkeeɗa caɓni na nohi na hor ciŋ eel ci findi wa fiisohu ŋ Fiis ciŋ woosuuɗ ci an : “ Cey cuuɓiŋ Israayel ci, ɗoopaat ca ɗu seeƴkee na sarah ca cinooca ɗu haɓɗee ini ree kiis ndaŋkiyaah-nikiis (40) ŋ kehƴa hulanga, ɗu haɓɗee ca wuu so e ? <verse eid="ACT 7:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 7:43"/>Muk ! Ɗu haɓɗee ca wuu so haa ! Ɗu ɓayndohee <char style="w" lemma="ɗiip">ɗiipaŋ</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:43 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ɗiipaŋ Molok </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: ɗiipii, wa nikee ndut haɓɗohu piis wala und. Ɓooɓa ñaamkohee koohi nikaaɗiini na woyse Molok nga.</char></note> Molok na horaŋ Romfa yi ɗu tum koohiŋ ɗu, ceɗ nataal ci ɗu haɓiɗ ne ɗu ñaamuk ca. Ineem weɗ tah po ŋ hey ɗu toore ŋ ɗiska uup us<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 5:25-27">Amos 5:25-27</ref></char></note> Babilon. ” »<verse eid="ACT 7:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 7:44"/>Ecen taalndiɗta an : « Ŋ kehƴa hulanga, caac ciŋ ɓoo nikee na Ɗiipa ɗaakohsee in ca teeɓohee Ambtiɗohi. Ɗiipaam haɓɗohsee findi Kooh nakohee Musaa, laam a woyee Musaa ne a haɓɗaata jok findi a teeɓohee ɗe wa ŋ nataal.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25-31">Pula 25–31</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 35-40">35–40</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 7:45"/>Ɗiipeem caac ciŋ ɓoo taamb nga nameena lam. Ɓa ɓayndoheena, wa Yosuwe adgoh ɓa, ŋ jamanoona ɓa degoh kur ka yaah ; kur kaŋ cuuɓ ca Kooh aañee ŋ fikiiɓa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 18:1">Yosuwe 18:1</ref></char></note> Wa rissa nga po ŋ jamanoonaŋ Dawuuda. <verse eid="ACT 7:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 7:46"/>Kooh baahoheen Dawuuda, Dawuuda kiimmba ɗe ne a min taɓah genoha ne ɓi kahan Yaŋhooɓa ñaamkee ɗe nga.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:1-17">2 Samuwel 7:1-17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 7:47"/>Waaye a kuɓkiŋ ɗe Suleymaan mirndoha taɓah.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:47 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 6">1 Buur ci 6</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 7:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 7:48"/>Waaye kinaat liiɓ keeh-keeh ne Kooh yi ŋ ɗafka ɗafka gen ŋ in ci yaah ɓo' haɓiɗ. Kerhaat ini woosuuɗi woo, an : <verse eid="ACT 7:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 7:49"/>“ Heɗ ɓoo woo ne : ‘Asamaan weɗ ɓoofohaaniŋ ngo, kehƴi nikka degoha kot ciŋ ngo. Kon ɗu taɓahɗan ndo kahan mand na ? Wala winde ɗisik weɗ ŋ iɗsiɗkohan ? <verse eid="ACT 7:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 7:50"/>A ñam fer in cii jen haa e<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:50 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 66:1-2">Esayi 66:1-2</ref></char></note> ?’ ” »<verse eid="ACT 7:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 7:51"/>Ecen marakka ɓa woosa ɓa ne : « Ɗu ndeng ndeng haf ! Ɗu rannga keeñ ciŋ ɗu na nof ciŋ ɗu ŋ ɓeeɗkohiŋ Kooh findi ɓi ɓaahɗi ŋ Ambtiɗohiŋ ɗe. Ɗu ris hiñoh na <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani</char>, ɗu mand na caac ciŋ ɗu ! <verse eid="ACT 7:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 7:52"/>A yinde woosuuɗ a yi caac ciŋ ɗu tolfiɗɗi ? Caac ciŋ ɗu apiɗ ɓi yegɗohee ne Yurhiɗi hey haye. Te ɗu ɓi woti-woti, ɗu woriɗ ɗe, ɗu boommba ɗe. <verse eid="ACT 7:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="ACT 7:53"/>Ɗu rahsiɗ waasiŋ Kooh taamboh ŋ malaakaaci, waaye ɗu taambiɗɗaa. »<verse eid="ACT 7:53"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kakaan kaŋ Ecen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="ACT 7:54"/>Wa atte'oh ca kerah woo ciŋ Ecen ceem, ɓa ayrukka ɗe po ɓa heeɗa pooke. <verse eid="ACT 7:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="ACT 7:55"/>Waaye Ecen riiffa na Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, a marakka ŋ Eel ci, a hotta siñaariŋ Kooh, a hotta Yeesu tufkiɗ ŋ ñaahmiŋ ɗe. <verse eid="ACT 7:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="ACT 7:56"/>A woosa ne : « Ŋ hotiɗ Eel ci rangsukiɗ, <char style="w">Kuɓkiŋ ɓoyi</char> tufukka ŋ ñaahmiŋ Kooh. »<verse eid="ACT 7:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="ACT 7:57"/>Wa ɓa kerah woo keem, ɓa leehukka ŋ ɗafka, ɓa rannga nof ciŋ ɓa. Ɓa jen ɓa faɗsukka Ecen. <verse eid="ACT 7:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="ACT 7:58"/>Ɓa faseeɗa ɗe po ɓa puliɗta ɗe kur-taaha, ɓa tapeeɗa ɗe atoh ne ɓa ap ɗe. Seede'oh ca faɗee kulɓaacaŋ ɓa ŋ kot ciŋ komaaki mitiɗ fiir na woyse Sool.<verse eid="ACT 7:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="ACT 7:59"/>Wa ɓa tapee Ecen atoh, a kiimeeɗa Kooh an : « Heɗ ɓoo Yeesu, teya ruuhiŋ ngo. » <verse eid="ACT 7:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="ACT 7:60"/>Weɗ a ƴekoh gik, a leehukka ŋ ɗafka an : « Heɗi, kina ɓa amboh bakaaɗii ! » Wi a woo ineem, a nguɗta.<verse eid="ACT 7:60"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ACT 8"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 8:1"/>Sool huneen ŋ ini Ecen apu.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 8:1">Kosiɗ ci cambiɗ tolfiɗu</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 8:1">Ini kooɗoh mbaɗi kosiɗ ca nikee ŋ Yerusalem tolfiɗasseeɗa. Wa nikee tolfiɗ miskiɗ. Ɓa jen, ɗal <char style="w"><char style="tl">Apootar</char></char> ci, ɓa pasarkohha ŋ kur caŋ Yudee na caŋ Samari. <verse eid="ACT 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 8:2"/>Raak ɓi ƴaar kosiɗ Kooh lool uumbiɗ Ecen, ɓa rooyya ɗe rooy miskiɗ. <verse eid="ACT 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 8:3"/>Waaye Sool ŋ haf ce, a heeɗa reehɗe ɓi Janguuna. A aaseeɗa ŋ kahan nu kahan, a pulɗeeɗa kosiɗ ca, ƴaar na ɓitiɓ, a taƴeeɗa ŋ kaso. <verse eid="ACT 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 8:4"/>Ɓi pasarkohee nak, kaɗeeɗa ŋ ɗisik nu ɗisik, ɓa woyeeɗa <char style="w">Yegɗohiŋ Muci</char>.<verse eid="ACT 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Filip woyiɗ Yegɗohiŋ Muci ŋ kur caŋ Samari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 8:5"/>Ŋ pasarkoheem, weɗ Filip kaɗoh kur-taah ngaŋ Samari, a yegɗohha <char style="w">Mucɗohi Gapohse</char> ŋ ndaam. <verse eid="ACT 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 8:6"/>Wa ɓa kerah ɗe te ɓa hotta firndeeca a tume, mboolnda jen hunnda, tummba tek, ɓa sikɗukeeɗa ɗe baahiɗ. <verse eid="ACT 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 8:7"/>Laam <char style="w">jiini</char> laayiɗ nikee puleeɗa na leehuk ŋ kosaayiɗ ca te lafañ laayiɗ na ɓeendkiɗ laayiɗ wirra. <verse eid="ACT 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 8:8"/>Ŋ ineem sum keeh-keeh raakka ŋ kur-taaheem.<verse eid="ACT 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 8:9"/>Raakeen ƴaar ɓaatsiɗiɗ gen nga teeku Simong. A nikee luhusoh te a feyeen ɓi Samari lool. A tumee haf ce ɓo' yakak. <verse eid="ACT 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 8:10"/>Ɓooɓa jen, yakak na komaaki meeɗ meeɗ sikɗuk woo ciŋ ɗe baahiɗ, ɓa woyee ne : « Ƴaarii, a yi hatiliŋ Kooh, hatili na woyse "yakki" ! » <verse eid="ACT 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 8:11"/>Simong maañiɗ feyeeɗa ɓa na luhusiŋ ɗe, weɗ tah ɓa sikɗukeeɗa ɗe baahiɗ.<verse eid="ACT 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 8:12"/>Waaye wa ɓa kos Filip yi woo ɓa Yegɗohiŋ Muci, wi kaɗ ŋ Nguuriŋ-Kooh na tiikiŋ Yeesu <char style="w">Kiristaa</char>, ɓa ɓoktuusa jen, ƴaar na ɓitiɓ. <verse eid="ACT 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 8:13"/>Simong sah kossa, a ɓoktuusa. A waaɗisɗi saɓsukoh na Filip, a feysee feyu jameet ŋ firndeeca na keemaan ca raake.<verse eid="ACT 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 8:14"/>Wa <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ci nikee ŋ Yerusalem kerah ne ɓi Samari teyɗukiɗ woo kiŋ Kooh, ɓa tuuƴca Piyeer na Saaŋ nga ɓa. <verse eid="ACT 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 8:15"/>Wa ɓa ree, ɓa kiimiɗta ɓa Kooh ne ɓeem rahas <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani</char>. <verse eid="ACT 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 8:16"/>Raak Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani ruhseeɗi ŋ ali ɓo' nga ɓa paaɗ ; ɓa ɓoktassee ŋ tiikiŋ Heɗ ɓoo Yeesu dong. <verse eid="ACT 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 8:17"/>Ŋ ndeem Piyeer na Saaŋ degga ɓa yaah ciŋ ɓa, ɓeem rahassa Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani.<verse eid="ACT 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 8:18"/>Simong hotta ne kosiɗ ca rahas Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani wa <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ci deg ɓa yaah ciŋ ɓa, ŋ ineem a kommba Piyeer na Saaŋ kopor. <verse eid="ACT 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 8:19"/>A woosa ɓa ne : « Namaat to eɗ hatilii po ɓo' nu ŋ nam deg yaah ciŋ ngo ŋ haf ɗah, a rahas Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani. »<verse eid="ACT 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 8:20"/>Waaye Piyeer loffa ɗe ne : « Koporiŋ ɗa sooƴaat na ɗa ! Ini Kooh na onohe, fu liiɓ ne fu mina min romoh koporiŋ ɗa e ? <verse eid="ACT 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 8:21"/>Fu ɓaahɗi, fu ɓaahlaanɗi ŋ inii laam liiɓohaaɗ ciŋ ɗa yurahɗi ŋ fiki Kooh. <verse eid="ACT 8:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 8:22"/>Mbaa ɓoƴsoha liiɓohaaɗ ciŋ ɗa moɗaaɗiiceem te fu kiim Heɗi, wa miniɗ nik ne a hey ɗa ɗaase liiɓohaaɗ ciŋ ɗa. <verse eid="ACT 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 8:23"/>Ŋ hotiɗ ne fu riifiɗ na aay-keeñ te bakaaɗ tumiɗ ɗa ñaam. » <verse eid="ACT 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 8:24"/>Simong loffa Piyeer na Saaŋ ne : « Ɗu ŋ haf ɗu, kiimɗaat to Heɗi po ali in, ŋ in ci ɗu woo rahsuu so. »<verse eid="ACT 8:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 8:25"/>Wa Piyeer na Saaŋ ƴut seede na yegɗoh woo kiŋ Heɗi, ɓa dokukka Yerusalem. Ŋ waasi, ɓa yegɗohha Yegɗohiŋ Muci ŋ kur laayiɗ ŋ Samari.<verse eid="ACT 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Filip na ƴaara genee Ecopi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 8:26"/>Wa Piyeer na Saaŋ coot, malaaka Heɗ ɓoo woosa Filip ne : « Kurka, fu kaɗ ŋ ɓak yaah-ñaahum ne fu yurhiɗkoh na pulohaaɗ-noh ɗah, ŋ waasa puloh Yerusalem kaɗta Gasaa, wa waas hulang. » <verse eid="ACT 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 8:27"/>Filip jaarra kuruk, a kaɗta. Weɗ a cohoh na ƴaar gen Ecopi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 8:27">Ƴaareem ɓucsee ɓucu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ŋ jamanoocaam buur ci raakeen dag ci meeɗ ɓucu.</char></note>. A nikee kilifa yakak, a yi meeɗ taambkoh raak-raakaŋ Kandaas, buura ɓitɓaŋ Ecopi. Ƴaareem hayee Yerusalem ne a ñaamuk Kooh. <verse eid="ACT 8:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 8:28"/>Wa raak ɗe hayiɗ po wiirkeeɗa, a ɓooffa ŋ wotiiriŋ ɗe, a jangeeɗa Fiis ciŋ woosuuɗi Esayi.<verse eid="ACT 8:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 8:29"/>Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani woosa Filip ne : « Daba wotiireen. » <verse eid="ACT 8:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 8:30"/>Filip nuppa dabbaa, a kerahha ƴaaraŋ Ecopiica jangeeɗa Fiis ciŋ Esayi, a meekissa ɗe ne : « Ini fu na jange, fu inhiɗ ini wa tokis e ? » <verse eid="ACT 8:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 8:31"/>Ƴaara woosa ɗe ne : « Ŋ min na inhoh ini wa tokis te ŋ raakɗi ali ɓo' ne a teeɓ po ! » Weɗ a woyoh Filip ne a rapaat, a ɓoof ŋ serooce. <verse eid="ACT 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 8:32"/>Raak inii weɗ a jangee ŋ Fiis ci :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:32">« A mandee na mbaali</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:32">na kee hoossa ;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:32">a ɗekka teɗ findi kuyi ƴini na hufse,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:32">a wooɗi ali in.<verse eid="ACT 8:32"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 8:33"/>A ƴissuutɗuusa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:33">a ñakɗukohuusa keeh.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:33">Ya ɓa woyan ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ ɓi rimkoh nga ɗe ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:33">Kipes kiŋ ɗe ŋ kehƴi reehɗuuɗ !<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:7-8">Esayi 53:7-8</ref> </char></note> »<verse eid="ACT 8:33"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 8:34"/>Ƴaara meekissa Filip ne : « Ne wa neɓ ɗa ɗah, woo so, woosuuɗi na woye ŋ ya ɓa ndii ? A na woye haf ce wala ɓo' wiiriis ? » <verse eid="ACT 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 8:35"/>Weɗ Filip camboh ŋ ini Fiis ci woo weem, a woosa ɗe Yegɗohiŋ Muci, ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ Yeesu.<verse eid="ACT 8:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 8:36"/>Ɓeɗ kaɗoh kaɗoh po ɓa hotta masuɓ ; ƴaara woosa ne : « Masuɓ weɗɗi, wa ye hondohan ndo ɓoktu ? » [<verse eid="ACT 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 8:37"/>Filip woosa ɗe ne : « Fu miniɗ ɓoktu, ne fu kosiɗ ŋ keeñiŋ ɗa jen ɗah. » Ƴaara woosa ne : « Ŋ kosiɗ ne Yeesu Kiristaa a yi <char style="w">Kuɓkiŋ Kooh</char>. »] <verse eid="ACT 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 8:38"/>A nakohha ne wotiira tufkiɗu. A na Filip ruhussa, ɓa kanak jen, ɓa aassa ŋ ɗooƴ masma, Filip ɓokitta ɗe.<verse eid="ACT 8:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 8:39"/>Wa ɓa pul masma, <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsiŋ Heɗ ɓoo</char> ginnda Filip, ƴaara hotisɗi ɗe ; ƴaara taalndiɗta waasaŋ ɗe, a kaɗeeɗa na keeñ soosiɗ. <verse eid="ACT 8:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 8:40"/>Ini kaɗ ŋ Filip, a hotkoh kur-taahaŋ Asoot, a woyeeɗa Yegɗohiŋ Muci ŋ kur nu a taamboh ɗah, po a reesa Seesare.<verse eid="ACT 8:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ACT 9"/>
  <para style="s">Sool kosiɗ Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 9:1"/>Ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ Sool, a genee dabgiɗ ap taalubeeciŋ Heɗ ɓoo. A kaɗta ŋ <char style="w" lemma="seeƴkiɗoh">seeƴkiɗoha</char> yakka, <verse eid="ACT 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 9:2"/>a meekissa ɗe kayit ca a ɓayan wuu <char style="w"><char style="tl">sinaagog</char></char> caŋ Damas ; ne a raak ɓi ƴaar mbaa ɓitiɓ nga taambɗee waasiŋ Yeesu ɗah, a amb ɓa, a ɓay ɓa Yerusalem.<verse eid="ACT 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 9:3"/>Wa a kaɗ po a heeɗa ree Damas, ɗekka po ñiin puloh Eel ci willa ɗe, siñaarɗeeɗa. <verse eid="ACT 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 9:4"/>A keennda ŋ kehƴi, a kerahha hooso woyeeɗa ɗe ne : « Sool, Sool, waaye tah fu tolfiɗee so ? » <verse eid="ACT 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 9:5"/>A loffa ne : « A fu ɓa Heɗi ? » Hoosoora woosa ɗe ne : « E ñam Yeesu yi fu na tolfiɗe. <verse eid="ACT 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 9:6"/>Waaye kurka, aasa ŋ kur ki, fu hey woyse nga ini fu joy tum. »<verse eid="ACT 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 9:7"/>Ƴaaɓa hunee na ɗe tufukka, ɓa feyuusa po ɓa minɗi woo. Ɓa kerheen hoosoora waaye ɓa hoteeɗi ɓo'.<verse eid="ACT 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 9:8"/>Sool kurukka, a marakka waaye a minisseeɗi hot. A ambuusa ŋ yaah, a nookuusa ne a reytinu Damas. <verse eid="ACT 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 9:9"/>A rissa fuuliɗ neeh kaahay, a ñamɗi, a anɗi.<verse eid="ACT 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 9:10"/>Waam, ŋ Damas, wa raakeen taalube nga teeku Anañaas. Heɗ ɓoo teeɓukka ɗe findi heeƴ, woosa ɗe ne : « Anañaas ! » Yeem loffa ne : « Yoo, Heɗi, ñam yii. » <verse eid="ACT 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 9:11"/>Heɗi woosa ɗe ne : « Kurka, fu kaɗ kahan Yudaa, ŋ mbeeddaana na woyse Mbeeddaani Yurhiɗi, fu meeksoh ƴaari na woyse Sool gen Tarsa. A yaa kiim Kooh. <verse eid="ACT 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 9:12"/>In hayɗohiɗ ɗe findi heeƴ, an ƴaar teeku Anañaas aasiɗ, degga ɗe yaah ciŋ ɗe ne a hotis. »<verse eid="ACT 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 9:13"/>Anañaas loffa ne : « Heɗi, ŋ kerhiɗ ŋ ɓo' laayiɗ moɗaaɗiici ƴaareem tum ɓooɓiŋ ɗa ŋ Yerusalem. <verse eid="ACT 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 9:14"/>Te ɓaat nga, ndii sah kilifaaciŋ seeƴkiɗoh ciŋ <char style="w" lemma="waasiŋ Musaa">waasiŋ</char> <char style="w">Musaa</char> oniɗ ɗe ne a min amb ɓooɓi na kiime ŋ tiikiŋ ɗa jen. »<verse eid="ACT 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 9:15"/>Waaye Heɗ ɓoo woosa Anañaas ne : « Kaɗa, laam ƴaareem, ñam kooɗ ɗe ne ŋ njirñiɗkoh ɗe. A hey inhiɗohe tiikiŋ ngo ŋ heet ci nikɗi Yawuut, na buur ciŋ ɓa na Israayel ci. <verse eid="ACT 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 9:16"/>Mi ŋ haf fo, ŋ hey ɗe teeɓe juukiŋ miskiɗ ci a raakan sagu tiikiŋ ngo. »<verse eid="ACT 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 9:17"/>Wa a kerah woo keem, Anañaas kaɗta. A aassa ŋ kahna, a degga Sool yaah ciŋ ɗe, a woosa ɗe ne : « Sool taambɗoh ho, Heɗi a yi tuuƴ co, Yeesu, yi teeɓuk ɗa ŋ waasi wi fu na haye ; a yi tuuƴ co ne fu hotis te fu riif na <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani</char>. » <verse eid="ACT 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 9:18"/>Ŋ ɗiska ɗiska, in haa waasintoor pulohha ŋ has ciŋ ɗe, keennda, a hotisseeɗa. A kurukka, a ɓoktuusa. <verse eid="ACT 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 9:19"/>Ƴutta, a ñammba, a raakissa hatil.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 9:19">Sool cambiɗ yegɗoh Yegɗohiŋ Muci</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:19">Wa a ɓoktu po ƴutta, a tummba ɓi neeh ŋ ndaam na taalubeeca gen Damas.<verse eid="ACT 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 9:20"/>Ŋ ɗiska ɗiska, a cammba yegɗoh ŋ <char style="tl">sinaagog</char> ca ne Yeesu a yi <char style="w">Kuɓkiŋ Kooh</char>. <verse eid="ACT 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 9:21"/>Ɓooɓa kerhee ɗe jen feyuusa, ɓa woyeeɗa ne : « Ca' ! Ƴaarii a yi meeɗ tumoh miskiɗ ŋ Yerusalem, a torhiɗee ɓooɓi na kiime ŋ tiikiŋ ƴaareem haa e ? Te a hay ndii ne a amb ɓooɓeem, a ɓay ɓa ŋ fiki kilifaacaŋ seeƴkiɗoh ca. »<verse eid="ACT 9:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 9:22"/>Waaye Sool uupeeɗa nga uup ndeng ŋ ini a yegɗohe. Yawuut ca genee Damas raakɗi lofaah, laam a nikee teeɓeeɗa ɓa ne Yeesu a yi <char style="w">Mucɗohi Gapohse</char> !<verse eid="ACT 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 9:23"/>Wa tummba in maañiɗ, Yawuut ci kerhiɗohha ne ɓa ap ɗe. <verse eid="ACT 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 9:24"/>Sool yeggaa, raak ɓa niiɗeeɗa yahndeer caŋ kur-taaha noh na wek ne ɓa min ɗe ap. <verse eid="ACT 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 9:25"/>Waaye taalubeeciŋ ɗe ɓayya ɗe na wek, ɓa ɓekka ɗe ŋ dammba yakiɗ, ɓa yoorra ɗe huntiɗkohiɗ na miira.<verse eid="ACT 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sool kaɗiɗ Yerusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 9:26"/>Wa Sool puloh ndaam, a kaɗta Yerusalem, a jeemmba hun na taalubeeci waaye ɓa jen ɓa neƴƴohha ɗe, ɓa koseeɗi kitaalubeekiŋ ɗe. <verse eid="ACT 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 9:27"/>Weɗ Barnabaas ɓayoh ɗe, kaɗta na ɗe ŋ <char style="w"><char style="tl">Apootar</char></char> ca, a naandsukka ɓa findi Sool hotoh Heɗ ɓoo ŋ waas Damas na findi Heɗi woyoh na ɗe, na oolki a oolkee woo ŋ tiikiŋ Yeesu ŋ ndaam. <verse eid="ACT 9:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 9:28"/>Ŋ ineem, a nikka na ɓa ŋ ɗooƴ Yerusalem, a hunnda na ɓa, a woyeeɗa ŋ tiikiŋ Heɗi te a neƴƴohɗi. <verse eid="ACT 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 9:29"/>A woyeeɗa, a taastiɗoheeɗa na Yawuut ci na jombe <char style="w">gerek</char>, waaye ɓeem jeemeeɗa ɗe ap. <verse eid="ACT 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 9:30"/>Wa ɓaah caŋ ɓoo kosiɗ ca keraha, ɓa ɓayya ɗe po ŋ Seesare, ɓa cootiɗta ɗe Tarsa.<verse eid="ACT 9:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 9:31"/>Waam raak, kosiɗ caŋ Yudee jen na Galile na Samari, raakiɗ jam. Kosiŋ ɓa ɓaatkeeɗa, ɓa peseeɗa ŋ nup Kooh Heɗ ɓoo, te ɓa uupeeɗa nga uup laay, taamboh ŋ ɓaatɗohiŋ Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani.<verse eid="ACT 9:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Piyeer ŋ Lidda, wirɗukaŋ Enee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 9:32"/>Piyeer kaɗeeɗa ŋ ɗisik nu nik ŋ kur ka. Wa raakka mbeh, a kaɗta marka <char style="w" lemma="ɓo'-Kooh ci">ɓo'-Kooh ca</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:32 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ɓo'-Kooh ci </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: ini ɓoo na tokse "ɓo'-Kooh ci", namiɗ min toksu "hoolɗuuɗ ci wuu Kooh". Ngaŋ Fiis ciŋ Ambtiɗohi Asi, e kosiɗ ci jen na ɓeeɗkohse ɗaa.</char></note> genee Lidda. <verse eid="ACT 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 9:33"/>A cohha na ƴaar nga teeku Enee. Ƴaareem tumiɗ kiis yasna-kaahay ŋ fiƴaang, a lafñee lafañ. <verse eid="ACT 9:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 9:34"/>Piyeer woosa ɗe ne : « Enee, Yeesu <char style="w">Kiristaa</char> a yii wiriɗ ɗa, kurka fu raɗoot fiƴaangiŋ ɗa. » Jaarra, Enee kurukka. <verse eid="ACT 9:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 9:35"/>Wa ɓooɓa gen Lidda na kur caŋ Saroon hot ɗe, ɓa ɓoƴsohha pesohaaɗ, ɓa kossa Heɗ ɓoo.<verse eid="ACT 9:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">Piyeer hultiɗiɗ Tabita ŋ Yope</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 9:36"/>Wa raakeen ŋ Yope taalube Yeesu ɓitiɓ teeku Tabita, wa tokis "Dorkas" ŋ gerek, weɗ "Ngaay". A meeɗ gen ŋ tum in baahiɗ na ɓaatɗoh ñakiɗ ci. <verse eid="ACT 9:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 9:37"/>Ŋ neeh caam, a keennda kosaay, a kaannda. Ɓa ɓookka fiɗaafa, wa deguusa ŋ tuuƴ, ŋ ɗafuk kahna.<verse eid="ACT 9:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 9:38"/>Taalubeecaŋ Yope kerheen ne Piyeer yaa ŋ Lidda. Lidda usoheeɗi na Yope. Ɓa woossa ƴaar kanak ne ɓa kaɗ ŋ Piyeer, ɓa kiim ɗe ne a hay nga ɓa win-win. <verse eid="ACT 9:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 9:39"/>Piyeer kurukka, a hunnda na ɓa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:39">Wa a ree, ɓa ɓayya ɗe ŋ tuuƴa ŋ ɗafka. Ɓitiɓ ca fu inah ne ƴaar caŋ ɓa kaaniɗ, hayya cohe na ɗe. Ɓitiɓ ceem, Dorkas meeɗeen ɓa haɓɗiɗ kulɓa wa a na pese. Ɓa taambkohha Piyeer na fuɗ, ɓa teeɓeeɗa ɗe kulɓaaceem. <verse eid="ACT 9:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 9:40"/>Piyeer puliɗta ɓa jen, a ƴekka, a kiimeeɗa Kooh, ƴutta, a yurhiɗkohha na fiɗaafi, a woosa ne : « Tabita kurka ! » Tabita marakka, a hotta Piyeer, a ɓooffa. <verse eid="ACT 9:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 9:41"/>Piyeer onnda ɗe yaah, ɓaatɗohha ɗe ne a kuruk ; ƴutta a ɓeeɗukka ɓo'-Kooh ca na ɓitiɓ ca ƴaar caŋ ɓa kaane, a teeɓpa ɓa ɗe pesiɗ.<verse eid="ACT 9:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 9:42"/>Ineem yeguusa ŋ Yope jen, ɓo' laayiɗ kossa Heɗ ɓoo. <verse eid="ACT 9:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 9:43"/>Ŋ finho ineem, Piyeer tassa ŋ Yope ɓi neeh, a dale ŋ kahan ƴaar teeku Simong. Simong yeem nikee fortoh und.<verse eid="ACT 9:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ACT 10"/>
  <para style="s">Piyeer ŋ ɗiskaŋ Koorney</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 10:1"/>Wa raakeen ŋ Seesare ƴaar teeku Koorney. A adgohee soldaar teemet, ɓa ɓaahee ŋ soldaar caŋ <char style="w">Rom</char>, ɓi na woysee soldaar caŋ Itaali. <verse eid="ACT 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 10:2"/>Ƴaareem nikee ɓo' waaɗiɗ Kooh, ye nupan Kooh, a yi na ɓi kahan ce jen. A meeɗeen on keeh-keeh Yawuut ci raakaaɗiici te a meeɗ gen kiim Kooh.<verse eid="ACT 10:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 10:3"/>Wa raakka mbeh, wi kaɗ po nohi cammba soos, in hayɗohha Koorney findi heeƴ, a hotta hooliɗ malaaka Kooh aasiɗ, raakka ɗe ŋ ɗiska a nikee, woosa ɗe ne : « Koorney ! » <verse eid="ACT 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 10:4"/>A tiitta, a iiƴca malaakaani hew, a woosa ne : « Wa ye kilifaani ? » Malaakaani loffa ɗe ne : « Kooh teyɗukiɗ kiim ciŋ ɗa, a alkohɗi ɓaatɗohi fu na ɓaatɗohe ñakiɗ ci. <verse eid="ACT 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 10:5"/>Ɗiski wa nik, woosa ɓi ƴaar Yope, ɓa ɓeeɗkiɗ ɗa ƴaara teeku Simong te a woysee Piyeer. <verse eid="ACT 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 10:6"/>A dal ŋ kahan fortoh und nam teeku Simong, kahan ce nik ŋ sero cookma. »<verse eid="ACT 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 10:7"/>Wa malaakaana woyee na ɗe coot, Koorney ɓeeɗukka surga kanak ŋ surgaaciŋ ɗe na soldaar yino nupiɗ Kooh ŋ ɓi a adgoh in maañiɗ. <verse eid="ACT 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 10:8"/>Koorney naandsukka ɓa ini raak jen, ƴutta a woossa ɓa Yope.<verse eid="ACT 10:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 10:9"/>Ŋ Kooh-wiisiina, ɓa nikka ŋ waas po ɓa reɓeeɗa Yope, raak Piyeer rapiɗ ŋ ɗafuk kahna ne a kiim Kooh ŋ leero noh. <verse eid="ACT 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 10:10"/>A aɗukka, a waaɗta ñam. Wa a tikɗassee kañam, in puloh ŋ Kooh hayɗohha ɗe findi heeƴ. <verse eid="ACT 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 10:11"/>A hotta Eel ci rangsukiɗ, inaa haa piis yakak ambuuɗ ŋ koñ ciŋ wa nikiis ci ruhseeɗa po ŋ kehƴi. <verse eid="ACT 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 10:12"/>Heet ciŋ ɗoopaat ci jen nikka nga : ɗoopaat ci na kot ci nikiis ci na faskoh ci ŋ kehƴi na pundoh ci ŋ ɗafki.<verse eid="ACT 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 10:13"/>Raakka hoosoori woo ɗe ne : « Kurka Piyeer ! Apa fu ñam ! » <verse eid="ACT 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 10:14"/>Waaye Piyeer loffa ne : « Muk Heɗi, ŋ moosɗi ñamoh in araamiɗ wala in hoolaaɗi'iɗ ! » <verse eid="ACT 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 10:15"/>Hoosoora woyissa ɗe ne : « Ini Kooh hooliɗ, fu, kinaa araamiɗ ! » <verse eid="ACT 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 10:16"/>Ɗaa, hoosoora woyeeɗa, Piyeer lofeeɗa po wa nikka waas kaahay, jaarra ina mand na piis rapɗuusa ŋ Eel ci.<verse eid="ACT 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 10:17"/>Piyeer muuƴca ŋ ini hayɗohee ɗe findi heeƴ, an wa joy ye tokis ? Waam raak ɓooɓa Koorney woosee meeksohiɗ kahan Simong po ɓa reyiɗ nguɓu kahna. <verse eid="ACT 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 10:18"/>Ɓa ɓeeɗkohha, ɓa meeksohha an : « Simong yi na woyse Piyeer a dal ŋ ndii e ? »<verse eid="ACT 10:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 10:19"/>Piyeer rissa liiɓsiɗoh ŋ ini hayɗohee ɗe findi heeƴ, <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani</char> woosa ɗe ne : « Ƴaar kaahay ɓii waak ɗa ŋ ndii. <verse eid="ACT 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 10:20"/>Kurka fu ruhus, huna na ɓa ; kina raak hel kanak nga, ñam woos ɓa. »<verse eid="ACT 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 10:21"/>Piyeer ruhussa, a woosa ƴaaɓa ne : « Ñam ɓoyi ɗu na waake, wa ye kot ciŋ ɗu ? » <verse eid="ACT 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 10:22"/>Ɓa loffa ɗe ne : « A Koorney, ƴaar ŋ ɓi adgoh soldaar ciŋ Rom, a yi woos ɓoo. A ƴaar yurhiɗ, a nupiɗ Kooh te Yawuut ci jen seede'iɗ ɗe seede baahiɗ. A malaaka Kooh nak ɗe ne a ɓeeɗkaat ɗa ŋ kahan ce, a sikɗuk ini fu raak woyaah ɗe. » <verse eid="ACT 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 10:23"/>Jaarra Piyeer woosa ɓa ne ɓa aasaat, ɓa neeh po kim.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:23">Wa Kooh wiis, a ɗoffa, a cooteeɗa na ɓa ; ɓi ɓo', ŋ ɓaah caŋ ɓoo kosiɗ ca ŋ kur kaŋ Yope ɓennda ɗe. <verse eid="ACT 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 10:24"/>Ŋ Kooh-wiisiina weɗ a reyoh Seesare. Raak Koorney ɓeeɗkiɗ ɓaah ciŋ ɗe, a nammba ɓeeɗuk nawleeciŋ ɗe keeh-keeh ci, a sekeeɗa Piyeer. <verse eid="ACT 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 10:25"/>Wa Piyeer na aase, Koorney kaɗta coha na ɗe, a ƴekiɗta ɗe po a reesa kehƴi, a ñaamukka ɗe. <verse eid="ACT 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 10:26"/>Waaye Piyeer kurkiɗta ɗe, woosa ɗe ne : « Kurka ! Ŋ nam nik ɓo' dong. » <verse eid="ACT 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 10:27"/>A taalndiɗta, a woyeeɗa na Koorney po a aassa kahna. A raakka ɓo' laayiɗ nangɗukohiɗ nga.<verse eid="ACT 10:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 10:28"/>A woosa ɓa ne : « Ɗu inhiɗ ne wa sangohuuɗ ne Yawuut ambsukoh na yi nikɗi Yawuut wala a aas kahan ce. Waaye Kooh teeɓiɗ to ne ŋ joyɗi woo ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ ɓo' ne a araamiɗ wala a hoolɗi. <verse eid="ACT 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 10:29"/>Weɗ tah, wi ɗu nakoh ho ɓeeɗkiɗu, ŋ degɗi ali woo nga, ŋ hayiɗ. Ŋ waaɗiɗ inah ini tah ɗu ɓeeɗukka so. »<verse eid="ACT 10:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 10:30"/>Koorney loffa ɗe ne : « Wa degiɗ neeh kaahay woti, ŋ wahtuunii, wahtuuni nohi na cambohe soos, ŋ kiimeeɗa Kooh ŋ kahan ndo. Ɗekka po ƴaar ɓekuk kulɓa melciɗ nikka jalañ ŋ fikiiso, <verse eid="ACT 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 10:31"/>a woosa so ne : “ Koorney, Kooh teyɗukiɗ kiimiŋ ɗa te a alkohɗi ɓaatɗohi fu na ɓaatɗohe ñakiɗ ci. <verse eid="ACT 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 10:32"/>Mbaa woosa ɓi ɓo', ɓa kaɗ Yope, ɓa ɓeeɗkiɗ ɗa Simong yi na woyse Piyeer. A dal ŋ Simong wiiriis fortoh und te kahan ce nik ŋ sero cookma. ” <verse eid="ACT 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 10:33"/>Ŋ jaarra woosoh nga ɗa te corka ŋ ini fu teyɗuk hay. Ɗiski wa nik ndii, ɓoo jen, ɓoo ɓii ŋ fiki Kooh ne ɓoo kerah ini Heɗi nak ɗa woyu jen. »<verse eid="ACT 10:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Woo kiŋ Piyeer ŋ kahan Koorney</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 10:34"/>Piyeer kooɗta woo ka, woosa ne : « Ŋ inhiɗ keeh-keeh kotii ne Kooh raakɗi talsoh ŋ ɓooɓi, <verse eid="ACT 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 10:35"/>laam ɓo' nu nup ɗe te a genee tum in yurhiɗ ɗah, ŋ cuuɓ nu a min ɓaahoh ɗah, a neɓiɗ ɗe.<verse eid="ACT 10:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 10:36"/>A woosohiɗ woo kiŋ ɗe ŋ Israayel ci, a woosa ɓa <char style="w">Yegɗohiŋ Muci</char>, wiŋ jami taamboh ŋ Yeesu <char style="w">Kiristaa</char> yi Heɗ ɓo' ci jen. <verse eid="ACT 10:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 10:37"/>Wa camb wa <char style="w">Yahya</char> woo ne “ Ɓoktukaat ! ” Ɗu inhiɗ ini raak cambohha Galile po ŋ kur caŋ Yudee jen. <verse eid="ACT 10:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 10:38"/>Ɗu inhiɗ findi Kooh yiifoh hatiliŋ Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani ŋ Yeesu yiŋ Nasareet te ɗisik nu a taambeen ɗah, a tumeeɗa in baahiɗ nga, a wirɗeeɗa ɓi Seytaani ambe, laam Kooh nikee na ɗe.<verse eid="ACT 10:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 10:39"/>Ɓoo nak, e ɓoo seedeeciŋ in ci Yeesu tum jen ŋ Yerusalem na kur ciŋ Yawuut ci cinooci. A apuuɗ ŋ daaƴi ɓa daaƴ ɗe ŋ kurwaa, <verse eid="ACT 10:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 10:40"/>waaye Kooh hultiɗiɗ ɗe ŋ mbeha kaahayɗoh. A onnda ɗe ne a teeɓ haf ce ɓooɓi, <verse eid="ACT 10:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 10:41"/>ɓooɓi jen haa, waaye seedeeci Kooh kooɗee bala ineem, weɗ ne ɓoo, ɓi ñamee aneeɗa na ɗe wa a hulit ŋ kakaan ka.<verse eid="ACT 10:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 10:42"/>A nakiɗ ɓoo ne ɓoo yegiɗ cuuɓi ne a yi Kooh tufkiɗ ne a atte pesiɗ ci na kaaniɗ ci. <verse eid="ACT 10:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 10:43"/>Woosuuɗ ci jen seede'ɗiɗ ɗe ne : Yaa nu kos ɗe ɗah, Kooh hey ɗa ɗaase bakaaɗ ciŋ ɗa ŋ tiikiŋ ɗe. »<verse eid="ACT 10:43"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani ruhsiɗ ŋ ɓi nikɗi Yawuut</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 10:44"/>Wa Piyeer na woye, Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani ruhussa ŋ ɓooɓa sikɗukee Yegɗohi jen. <verse eid="ACT 10:44"/><verse number="45-46" style="v" sid="ACT 10:45-46"/>Yawuut ca kosiɗ ca nikee na Piyeer kerheeɗa ɓeem jombeeɗa ŋ peɗeem ci nikɗi peɗeem ciŋ ɓa, yakɗeeɗa Kooh. Yawuut ca jen feyuusa ŋ ini Kooh nam soɗ Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani ŋ ɓi nikɗi Yawuut.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:45-46">Piyeer woosa ne : <verse eid="ACT 10:45-46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 10:47"/>« Ɓi rahas Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani findi ɓoo, ɓa miniɗ sangohu ɓoktu ŋ masuɓ e ? » <verse eid="ACT 10:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 10:48"/>Ŋ ineem, a nakohha ne ɓa ɓoktu ŋ tiikiŋ Yeesu Kiristaa. Ƴutta, ɓa kiimmba ɗe ne a nik na ɓa ɓi neeh.<verse eid="ACT 10:48"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ACT 11"/>
  <para style="s">Piyeer woyiɗ na kosiɗ caŋ Yerusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 11:1"/>Ŋ ineem, <char style="w"><char style="tl">Apootar</char></char> ci na ɓaah ciŋ ɓoo kosiɗ ci nikee ŋ Yudee kerahha ne ɓi nikɗi Yawuut namiɗ teyɗuk woo kiŋ Kooh. <verse eid="ACT 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 11:2"/>Wa Piyeer dokuk Yerusalem, Yawuut ca kosiɗ ca ngaseeɗa ɗe <verse eid="ACT 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 11:3"/>an : « Wa ye tah fu aassa kahan <char style="w" lemma="nguɗuk">nguɗkaaɗiici</char> po fu ñameeɗa na ɓa ? » <verse eid="ACT 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 11:4"/>Ŋ ineem Piyeer naandsukka ɓa ina raak jen, ambohhaa ŋ cambohaana kaɗeeɗa po ŋ reehɗohaana.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 11:4">A woo ɓa ne : <verse eid="ACT 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 11:5"/>« Ŋ nikee ŋ kur-taahaŋ Yope, ŋ kiimeeɗa Kooh nga. In hayɗohha so haa heeƴ : Ŋ hotta inaa haa piis yakak ambuuɗ ŋ koñ ciŋ wa nikiis ci. Wa ruhsoheeɗa Eel ci po wa reesa ŋ serooso. <verse eid="ACT 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 11:6"/>Ŋ marakka baahiɗ ŋ ɗooƴi, ŋ hotta ɗoopaat ci na kot ci nikiis ci ŋ kehƴi na ci ŋ nduufi na faskoh ci na pundoh ci ŋ ɗafki.<verse eid="ACT 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 11:7"/>Ŋ kerahha hooso woyiɗ to ne : “ Kurka Piyeer, apa fu ñam ! ” <verse eid="ACT 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 11:8"/>Waaye ŋ loffa ne : “ Muk Heɗi, ŋ moosɗi ñamoh in araamiɗ wala in hoolaaɗi'iɗ. ” <verse eid="ACT 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 11:9"/>Hoosoori puloh Eel ci kanakɗukissa woo an : “ Ini Kooh hooliɗ, fu, kinaa araamiɗ ! ” <verse eid="ACT 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 11:10"/>Ɗaa, hoosoora woyeeɗa, ŋ lofeeɗa po wa nikka waas kaahay, ƴutta ina jen dokukka ŋ Eel ca.<verse eid="ACT 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 11:11"/>Jaarra ɓo' kaahay reyeeɗa kahna ɓoo dalohe. Ɓa pulohee Seesare nikka haa ne ɓa woossee nga so. <verse eid="ACT 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 11:12"/><char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani</char> woosa so ne ŋ hunaat na ɓa te ŋ kanaat liiɓsiɗoh nga. Ɓaah ciŋ ɓoo kosiɗ ci yasna-yinooci ɗu na hote ɓii, ɓennda so Seesare, ɓoo aassa kahan Koorney. <verse eid="ACT 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 11:13"/>A woosa ɓoo ne, a hot malaaka tufkiɗ ŋ ɗooƴ kahan ce woosa ɗe inii : “ Woosa ɓo' Yope, a ɓeeɗkiɗ ɗa Simong yi na woyse Piyeer. <verse eid="ACT 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 11:14"/>A hey ɗa woye woo ci mucɗan ɗa, fu na ɓi kahan fu jen. ”<verse eid="ACT 11:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 11:15"/>Wi ŋ camb woo, Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani ruhussa nga ɓa findi a ruhsohee nga ɓoo ŋ cambohaana. <verse eid="ACT 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 11:16"/>Ŋ jaarra naandsuk woo kiŋ Heɗi wii : “ <char style="w">Yahya</char> ɓoktohee na masuɓ waaye ɗu, ɗu ɓoktohsan Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani. ” <verse eid="ACT 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 11:17"/>Ini Kooh on ɓoo wi ɓoo kos Yeesu <char style="w">Kiristaa</char>, Kooh oniɗ ɓa wa ɗah, a mi ɓa po ŋ nookohee na Kooh ? »<verse eid="ACT 11:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 11:18"/>Wa ɓa kerah woo keem, ɓa raakisɗi woyaah, ɓa yakɗeeɗa Kooh an : « Wa keeh kat ne Kooh namiɗ on ɓi nikɗi Yawuut ne ɓa ɓoƴsoh kipes, ɓa raak kipes ki keeh-keehi. »<verse eid="ACT 11:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Janguuniŋ Añcos</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 11:19"/>Ŋ finho kakaan kaŋ Ecen, kosiɗ ci cammba torhiɗu po ɓa pasarkohha ŋ Feniis na Siipar na Añcos. Ɓa topee na yegɗohiŋ woo kiŋ Kooh ŋ Yawuut ci dong.<verse eid="ACT 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 11:20"/>Moona raakeen nga ɓa ɓi ɓo' Siipar na Sireen, ɓeem kaɗta Añcos nameeɗa woo ɓi nikɗi Yawuut <char style="w">Yegɗohiŋ Muci</char> kaɗ ŋ Yeesu Heɗi. <verse eid="ACT 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 11:21"/>Hatiliŋ Heɗi hunnda na ɓa, po ɓo' laayiɗ kossa, ɓoƴsohha pesohaaɗ, ɓa hayya ŋ Heɗi.<verse eid="ACT 11:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 11:22"/>Ɓi Janguuniŋ Yerusalem kerahha ineem, ɓa woossa Barnabaas Añcos. <verse eid="ACT 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 11:23"/>Wa a ree, a hotta findi Kooh baahohoh kosiɗ ca, a neɓuusa nga, a ñaahha ɓa jen ne ɓa risaat ndengɗuk keeh-keeh ŋ ñaakɗi ɓa na ñaakɗe Heɗi. <verse eid="ACT 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 11:24"/>Barnabaas nikee ɓo' baahiɗ, riifiɗ na Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani na kos. Ŋ ineem mboolo keeh-keeh lannga na Heɗi.<verse eid="ACT 11:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 11:25"/>Ƴutta Barnabaas kaɗta waaka Sool ŋ Tarsa. <verse eid="ACT 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 11:26"/>Wa a hot ɗe, a ɓayya ɗe Añcos. Ɓa tummba kiis mulnguus na ɓi Janguuna, ɓa jangiɗta mboolo keeh-keeh nga. Ŋ ndaam, ngaŋ Añcos, weɗ taalubeeci camboh ɓeeɗku "<char style="tl">Kerceen</char>".<verse eid="ACT 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Barnabaas na Sool ŋ Yerusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 11:27"/>Ŋ mbeh ceem, raakka woosuuɗ ci puloh Yerusalem, hayya Añcos. <verse eid="ACT 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 11:28"/>Yino nga ɓa teeku Agabus, Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani inhiɗta ɗe ne aɗ miskiɗ hey raake ŋ kehƴi jen, a kurukka, a woosaa. Wa raakangannga ŋ jamanoona Kolod nikohee buura yakkaŋ <char style="w">Rom</char>. <verse eid="ACT 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 11:29"/>Wa taalubeeca keraha, ɓa kerhiɗohha ne yaa nu nga ɗah, eɗoh ini a min eɗoh ne ca woosohu ɓaatɗohoha ɓaah caŋ ɓa kosiɗ ca nik ŋ Yudee. <verse eid="ACT 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 11:30"/>Ɓa tummba ineem, ɓa degga onoh ca ŋ yaah Barnabaas na Sool, ɓeem kommba ca adgohoh caŋ Janguunaŋ Yudee.<verse eid="ACT 11:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ACT 12"/>
  <para style="s">Saak apuuɗ, Piyeer ambuuɗ ŋ kasoona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 12:1"/>Ŋ jamanoonaam Herod buura, ammba ɓi ɓo' ɓaah ŋ Janguuna, a tumeeɗa ɓa miskiɗ. <verse eid="ACT 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 12:2"/>A apɗukka Saak na ndang, taambɗoh Saaŋ. <verse eid="ACT 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 12:3"/>Wa a hot ne ineem neɓiɗ Yawuut ci, a nammba ambɗuk Piyeer. Wa nikee mbeh ciŋ feetiŋ Mbuuruuci raakaaɗi lawiir ci. <verse eid="ACT 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 12:4"/>Wa a amb Piyeer, a taƴca ɗe ŋ kasoona. A nakka lang soldaar nikiis ne ɓa niiɗee ɗe, lang nu nga ɗah raakee soldaar nikiis. A waaɗta ɗe ɓay ŋ fiki ɓooɓa, a atte'u ne feetiŋ <char style="tl"><char style="w">Paak</char></char> reeh ɗah. <verse eid="ACT 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 12:5"/>Ŋ ineem Piyeer niiɗasseeɗa ŋ kasoona, waaye ɓi Janguuna kiimɗeeɗa ɗe Kooh na keeñ ciŋ ɓa jen.<verse eid="ACT 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Piyeer pulɗuuɗ kasoona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 12:6"/>Herod nikee ŋ kot ɓay Piyeer ŋ fiki ɓooɓa ne a atte'u. Ŋ weka bala a atte'san ɗah, Piyeer toksee na ceen kanak, a neeheeɗa ŋ harmban soldaar kanak, te ŋ fiki yahndeeraŋ kasoona ɓi soldaar tufkeen nga, niiɗeeɗa.<verse eid="ACT 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 12:7"/>Ɗekka po malaaka Heɗ ɓoo hayya, ɗiski siñaariɗta nañ. A laɓiɗta Piyeer ŋ hambuus ne a yun ɗe, a woosa ɗe ne : « Kurka gaaw ! » Ceen ci nihsukka ŋ yaah ciŋ ɗe, ca keennda. <verse eid="ACT 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 12:8"/>Malaakaani woyissa ɗe ne : « Tokka seenturiŋ ɗa, fu ɓekuk ñafaɗ ciŋ ɗa ! » A tummbaa. Malaakaani degissa nga ne : « Degga paltooniŋ ɗa te fu ñaakiɗ to. » <verse eid="ACT 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 12:9"/>Piyeer ñaakiɗta malaakaana, a pulla. A ambeeɗi ne ini malaakaani na haɓɗe, wa keeh, a liiɓee ne e in hayɗohee ɗe findi heeƴ.<verse eid="ACT 12:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 12:10"/>Wa raakeen ɓi lang soldaar nga, tufkiɗ niiɗeeɗa. Piyeer na malaakaana taammba yino, ɓa taambissa yino, ɓa reesa buntaana tiwña pul ŋ kur-taaha, wa rangsukootta, ɓa pulla. Ɓa kooɗta mbeedda, ɓa kaɗeeɗa, ɗekka po malaakaana faɗta ɗe. <verse eid="ACT 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 12:11"/>Piyeer dokukka ŋ sagooniŋ ɗe, a woosa ne : « Ŋ inhiɗ kotii ne wa keeh, Heɗi woosiɗ malaakaaniŋ ɗe ne a pulɗoh ho ŋ yaah Herod na ini Yawuut ci waaɗee ne wa rahas so jen. »<verse eid="ACT 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 12:12"/>Wa Piyeer inhiskoh, a kaɗta kahan Mari yaayiŋ Saaŋ, Saaŋ yi na ɓeeɗkohse Maarko. Raak ɓo' laayiɗ cohiɗ nga, kiimeeɗa Kooh. <verse eid="ACT 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 12:13"/>Piyeer laɓiɗta buntaanaŋ kahna, wa raakeen cafaƴ nga, teeku Rood, a nikee <char style="w">ñaam</char>, a hayya marke ɓoyi na laɓɗe. <verse eid="ACT 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 12:14"/>A inhissa hoosooriŋ Piyeer, a summba lool ; joyya ne a rangis, a nuppa a kaɗtaa yegɗoha ŋ ɗooƴa an : « A Piyeer, a yii ŋ buntaani, ŋ hari ! » <verse eid="ACT 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 12:15"/>Ɓa woosa ɗe ne : « Hanaa fu na dofe ! » Waaye a ndennga nga ne wa keeh. Ŋ ineem, ɓa woosa ɗe ne : « Kon a malaakaaniŋ ɗe ! »<verse eid="ACT 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 12:16"/>Piyeer rissa laɓiɗ ŋ buntaana. Wa ɓa rangis, ɓa hotta ne a yi, ɓa feyuusa jameet. <verse eid="ACT 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 12:17"/>A woosa na ɓa na yaah ne ɓa ɗek, a naandsukka ɓa findi Heɗi pulɗoh ɗe ŋ kasoona. A ɓaatta nga ne : « Woyaata Saak na ɓaah ciŋ ɓoo kosiɗ ci ɓinooɓi. » Ƴutta a pulla, a cootta ɗisik wiiriis.<verse eid="ACT 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 12:18"/>Wa Kooh wiis, soldaar ca jahaskohha keeh-keeh, ɓa woyeeɗa ne : « Ƴaari taamb nde ? » <verse eid="ACT 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 12:19"/>Herod nakohha ɗe waakɗu, waaye a hotuuɗi. A nakohha ne soldaar ca niiɗee ɗe meeksassaat, ƴutta a nakohha ne ɓa apu. Wa ineem coot, Herod pulohha Yudee a kaɗta Seesare, a nikka nga ɓi neeh.<verse eid="ACT 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kakaan kaŋ buur Herod</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 12:20"/>Waam, Herod ayrukohee ayrukoh na ɓi Tiir na ɓi Sidoon. Ɓeem hunnda ŋ woo ne ɓa kaɗ nga ɗe. Ɓa kiimtiɗohee na Balastus dagi meeɗ taambkoh tuuƴ buur ne a ɓaatɗoh ɓa. Ɓa kiimmba Herod ne jam raak ŋ harmban ɓa, laam kur ceem, kañam kiŋ ɓa, meeɗ puloh kur kaŋ Herod.<verse eid="ACT 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 12:21"/>Wa mbeha ɓa ambee ree, Herod ɓayya kulɓa-buur, a ɓekukkaa, a ɓooffa ŋ ɓoofohaanaŋ ɗe, a woyeeɗa na ɓooɓa. <verse eid="ACT 12:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 12:22"/>Ɓooɓa leehkeeɗa an : « A ɓo' na woye haa, a kooh ŋ kooh ci ! » <verse eid="ACT 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 12:23"/>Ŋ ɗiska ɗiska, malaaka Heɗ ɓoo tippa Herod ngonjom a kosaayya ŋ ini a wikɗi Kooh ciriŋ ɗe. Cangind ci ñamsohha ɗe, a kaannda.<verse eid="ACT 12:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 12:24"/>Woo kiŋ Kooh nak, wa ɓaatkeeɗa ɓaatuk, wa kaɗeeɗa kaɗ ! <verse eid="ACT 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 12:25"/>Ini kaɗ ŋ Barnabaas na Sool, wa ɓa reehiɗ pangka ɓayee ɓa Yerusalem, ɓa dokkeeɗa ; ɓa ɓayndohha Saaŋ yi na ɓeeɗkohse Maarko.<verse eid="ACT 12:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ACT 13"/>
  <para style="s">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani taniɗ Barnabaas na Sool</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 13:1"/>Ŋ Janguunaŋ Añcos, wa raakeen ɓi woosuuɗ na ɓi jangɗohoh. Ɓa nikee Barnabaas na Simeyong yi na ɓeeɗkohse Suusus, Lusiyus yi genee Sireen, Manahen yi koɗu yino na Herod goornoori, na Sool. <verse eid="ACT 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 13:2"/>Wa raakka mbeh, ɓa ñaamkeeɗa Heɗi, ɓa oreeɗa, <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani</char> woosa ɓa ne : « Ɗiski wa nik, faɗɗaat to Barnabaas na Sool wuu pangki tah ho ɓeeɗuk ɓa. »<verse eid="ACT 13:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 13:3"/>Ŋ ineem, wa ɓa ƴut or na kiim Kooh, ɓa degga ɓa yaah ciŋ ɓa, ɓa faɗta ɓa, ɓa cootta.<verse eid="ACT 13:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Barnabaas na Sool kaɗiɗ Siipar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 13:4"/>Wa Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani woos Barnabaas na Sool, ɓa kaɗta kur kaŋ Selesi, ɓa aassa <char style="tl">bato</char> ndaam ne ɓa kaɗ Siipar, kur ŋ ɗooƴ cookmi.<figure style="fig" alt="Paul's first missionary journey" file="WD_Paul1-3D-BW-Saafi.jpg" size="span" loc="Somewhere between ACT 13:4 and 14:28, preferably so that when one sees the map, one can already see or has already seen ACT 13:4" ref="13:4–14:28"/> <verse eid="ACT 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 13:5"/>Wa ɓa ree Salamin, ɓa yegɗoheeɗa woo kiŋ Kooh ngaŋ <char style="w"><char style="tl">sinaagog</char></char> caŋ Yawuut ca. Saaŋ Maarko hunee na ɓa ne a ɓaatɗoh ɓa. <verse eid="ACT 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 13:6"/>Ɓa huussa Siipar jen, ɓa kaɗta po Pafos. Ŋ ndaam, ɓa cohha na luhusoh teeku Bar-Yeesu, a nikee Yawuut, a tumee haf ce woosuuɗ te a nikɗaa. <verse eid="ACT 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 13:7"/>A ɓaahee ŋ ɓooɓa wilee goornoora na woyse Seersiyus Polus. Goornooreem nikee ɓo' ñaañiɗ, a nakohha ɓeeɗkiɗu Barnabaas na Sool, raak ɗe waaɗee kerah woo kiŋ Kooh.<verse eid="ACT 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 13:8"/>Waaye luhusohi, yi nam teeku Elimaas (wa tokis ineem ŋ <char style="w">gerek</char>) hiñoheeɗa ɓa, a jeemeeɗa hondoh goornoora kos. <verse eid="ACT 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 13:9"/>Ŋ ineem, Sool yi na name woyu Pool, riiffa na Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, a marakka ɗe ŋ ɗooƴ has in maañiɗ, <verse eid="ACT 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 13:10"/>a woosa ne : « Leyohi yakki, fu riif na liiɓohaaɗ moɗaaɗi, fu kuɓu Seytaani rek, fu sangiɗiŋ in nu baah ɗah ! Fu heyɗi faɗe nduuɗ waasiŋ Heɗ ɓoo yurhiɗi e ? <verse eid="ACT 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 13:11"/>Weɗɗi, yaahiŋ Heɗi deggiɗ ɗa, fu hey fuule, fu hotissanɗi nohi ɓi neeh. »</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:11">Ŋ ɗiska ɗiska has ciŋ Elimaas ñuussa, a nikka ŋ ñuus tuɗ, a saaɓɗeeɗa ne a waak ɓoyi nookan ɗe. <verse eid="ACT 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 13:12"/>Wa goornoora hot ina raak, a kossa ; ini a jangɗassee ŋ Heɗi aaseen ɗe lool.<verse eid="ACT 13:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Woo kaŋ Pool ŋ Añcos-Pisidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 13:13"/>Ŋ ineem Pool na huntoh caŋ ɗe aassa <char style="tl">bato</char>, ɓa pulohha Pafos, ɓa kaɗta Perge ŋ kur kaŋ Pamfili. Saaŋ Maarko faɗta ɓa ndaam, a dokukka Yerusalem. <verse eid="ACT 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 13:14"/>Waaye ɓeɗ, ɓa kurkohha Perge, ɓa taalndiɗta po ɓa reesa Añcos-Pisidi. Ŋ <char style="w">mbehi na iɗsiɗkohse</char>, ɓa aassa ŋ <char style="tl">sinaagoga</char>, ɓa ɓooffa. <verse eid="ACT 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 13:15"/>Wa jangaŋ teerndiŋ <char style="w" lemma="waasiŋ Musaa">waasiŋ</char> <char style="w">Musaa</char> na woo ciŋ woosuuɗ ci ƴut, kilifaacaŋ <char style="tl">sinaagoga</char> nakohha ɓa woyɗu ne : « Ɓaah ci, ɗu raak ini ɗu woyan ɓooɓi ne ɗu ñaah ɓa ɗah, ɗu miniɗ woo. »<verse eid="ACT 13:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 13:16"/>Wa ɓa woyu ineem, Pool kurukka, a raɗissa yaah a woosa ne : « Ɗu, Israayel ci na ɗu ɓi nup Kooh, sikɗukaat to ! <verse eid="ACT 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 13:17"/>Koohiŋ cuuɓiŋ ɓoo Israayel taniɗ caac ciŋ ɓoo. A ɓaatta cuuɓi wa ɓa genohaah ŋ <char style="w">Misra</char>. Ƴutta, na hatiliŋ yaahiŋ ɗe, a puliɗta ɓa nga.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 46:5-7">Camba 46:5-7</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 1:1-7">Pula 1:1-7</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 12:37-42">12:37-42</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 13:18"/>Wa ɓa nik ŋ kehƴa hulanga, a muñɗeeɗa ɓa ini ree kiis ndaŋkiyaah-nikiis (40).<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 29:1-7">Rohƴiɗi 29:1-7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 13:19"/>Ƴutta, a ɗummba cuuɓ yasna-kanak ŋ Kanaan, a eɗta cuuɓiŋ ɗe kur keem ne ɓa kooɗa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 24:11">Yosuwe 24:11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 13:20"/>In ceem jen, a tumiɗ ca ŋ ɗooƴ kiis teemet-nikiis na kiis ndaŋkiyaah-yatuus (450). Ƴutta a eɗeeɗa caac ciŋ ɓoo ɓi kilifa<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 1">Kilifaaci</ref></char></note> po wi woosuuɗi Samuwel<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 1:20-25:1">1 Samuwel 1:20–25:1</ref></char></note> hay.<verse eid="ACT 13:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 13:21"/>Ŋ jamanoonaŋ Samuwel, ɓa waaɗta waakɗu buur. Kooh eɗta ɓa Sawul kuɓkiŋ Kis yi ɓaah ŋ cuuɓiŋ Benyaamin.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 9:1-10:25">1 Samuwel 9:1–10:25</ref></char></note> A nikka buur kiis ndaŋkiyaah-nikiis (40). <verse eid="ACT 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 13:22"/>Kooh ruhsiɗta ɗe, a eɗta ɓa Dawuuda findi buur. Kooh seede'iɗta ɗe inii : “ Ŋ hotiɗ ŋ Dawuuda kuɓkiŋ Yesay, ƴaari neɓ po ŋ keeñ, yi tuman ini ŋ waaɗ jen.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 13:14">1 Samuwel 13:14</ref></char></note> ”<verse eid="ACT 13:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 13:23"/>Ŋ ineem, Kooh ɓayiɗta Israayel ci Mucɗoh ngaŋ ɓi rimkoh ŋ Dawuuda findi a gapohee wa,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:11-13">2 Samuwel 7:11-13</ref></char></note> te Mucɗoheem, e Yeesu. <verse eid="ACT 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 13:24"/>Bala Yeesu hayan ɗah, <char style="w">Yahya</char> woyeen na Israayel ci jen, a ɓeeɗukka ɓa ne ɓa ɓoƴsoh pesohaaɗ, te ɓa ɓoktu.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 1">Luk 1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3">3</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 13:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 13:25"/>Wi pangkiŋ Yahya na hee reehe, a meeɗ woo ne : “ Ɗu liiɓ ne ñam ɓa ? Ñam yi ɗu na seke haa ; waaye ɓoyeem, a yi hay ŋ finhooso te ŋ yeyyooɗi sah toksiɗ ɗe ñafaɗ ciŋ ɗe.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:20-27">Saaŋ 1:20-27</ref></char></note> ”<verse eid="ACT 13:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 13:26"/>Ɓaah ciŋ ngo, ɗu ɓi rimkoh ŋ Ibrahiima, na ɗu ɓi nup Kooh te ɗu nikka na ɓoo ndii, Kooh woosoh ɓoo woo kiŋ muci. <verse eid="ACT 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 13:27"/>Ɓi Yerusalem na kilifaacaŋ ɓa, inheeɗi ya ɓa a yi nikee Yeesu, ɓa nameeɗi inah ini woo ciŋ woosuuɗ ci tokis, woo ci meeɗ jangu ŋ mbehi na iɗsiɗkohse nu ree. Te kat, ɓa tumeen po ini woosuuɗ ceem woyee raakka, wa ɓa na atte'ee Yeesu ne a apu. <verse eid="ACT 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 13:28"/>Ɓa hoteeɗi ini joy ɗe tah atte'u kaan, waaye ɓa woosa Pilaat ne a apaat ɗe. <verse eid="ACT 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 13:29"/>Wi ɓa mitiɗ in ci Fiis ci woyee nga ɗe jen, ɓa kooɗohha ɗe ŋ kurwaana, ɓa ɗaakka ɗe ŋ ruy-ruy.<verse eid="ACT 13:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 13:30"/>Waaye Kooh hultiɗta ɗe. <verse eid="ACT 13:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 13:31"/>Ngaŋ ɓi neeh laayiɗ, a teeɓkeeɗa ɓi ɓo', ɓa hoteeɗa ɗe jahran. Ɓooɓeem nikee ɓooɓa pulohee na ɗe Galile, kaɗta Yerusalem, te ɓooɓeem nikka ɓooɓi na seede'ee ɗe woti-woti ŋ fiki cuuɓi.<verse eid="ACT 13:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 13:32"/>Te ɓoo hayiɗ ne ɓoo woo ɗu <char style="w">Yegɗohiŋ Muci</char> : Ini Kooh gapee caac caŋ ɓoo, <verse eid="ACT 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 13:33"/>a mitɗiɗ ineem wuu ɓoo ɓi set ciŋ ɓa, ŋ hultiɗi a hultiɗ Yeesu, findi wa fiisohu ŋ saari kanakɗoh ŋ Sabuur. Wa woo ne :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:33">“ A fu <char style="w" lemma="Kuɓkiŋ Kooh">Kuɓkiŋ ngo</char>,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:33">ini kooɗoh woti, ñam rim ɗa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:7">Sabuur 2:7</ref></char></note> ”<verse eid="ACT 13:33"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 13:34"/>Kooh gapoheen ne a hey ɗe hultiɗe, po a dokissanɗi a kee nopa ŋ ruy-ruy, weɗ Kooh woo, wi a woo ŋ Fiis ci ne : “ Ŋ hey ɗu one in ci hooliɗ ci te ca carra kosu, ci ŋ gapee Dawuuda.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 55:3">Esayi 55:3</ref></char></note> ” <verse eid="ACT 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 13:35"/>Weɗ tah, a woyissa ŋ ɗisik wiiriis ŋ Fiis ci ne : “ Fu faɗanɗi <char style="w" lemma="ñaam">Ñaamiŋ</char> ɗa yi fu min ooluk, a nopee ŋ ruy-ruya.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 16:10">Sabuur 16:10</ref></char></note> ” <verse eid="ACT 13:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 13:36"/>Moona Dawuuda ŋ jamanoonaŋ ɗe, a pangkiɗ ŋ waaɗ-waaɗiŋ Kooh, a kaannda, a dabba caac caŋ ɗe, faaniŋ ɗe noppa ŋ ruy-ruya.<verse eid="ACT 13:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 13:37"/>Waaye yi Kooh hultiɗ, faaniŋ ɗe nopɗi ŋ ruy-ruya. <verse eid="ACT 13:37"/><verse number="38-39" style="v" sid="ACT 13:38-39"/>Kon ɓaah ciŋ ngo, inhaat ne, a yi tah ɗu yegɗassee ne ɗu ɗaasuuɗ bakaaɗ ciŋ ɗu, te ɓo' nu kos ŋ Yeesu ɗah, in ci fu mineeɗi ɗaasu ŋ waasiŋ Musaa jen, Kooh hey ɗa ca ɗaase, a amb ɗa findi ɓo' yurhiɗ.<verse eid="ACT 13:38-39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 13:40"/>Kon wortukaat po ini woosuuɗ ca woyee wii rahsuu ɗu an :<verse eid="ACT 13:40"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 13:41"/>“ Markaat, ɗu ɓi na heefohe !</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:41">Feysaat, sooƴaat !</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:41">Ŋ hey haɓɗe ŋ jamanooniŋ ɗu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:41">ini fu inah ne</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:41">ɗu naandsuksee wa naandsuku ɗah,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:41">ɗu kosuu wa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HAB 1:5">Habakuk 1:5</ref></char></note> ” »<verse eid="ACT 13:41"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 13:42"/>Wa Pool na Barnabaas pul <char style="tl">sinaagoga</char>, ɓooɓa kiimmba ɓa ne mbehi na iɗsiɗkohse na haye, ɓa dokkis ŋ woo ka. <verse eid="ACT 13:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 13:43"/>Wa ɓooɓa pasarkoh, Yawuut laayiɗ, na laayiɗ ŋ ɓa tuuɓee nikka Yawuut, ñaakka ŋ Pool na Barnabaas. Ɓeem ɓeesɗoheeɗa na ɓa, ñaaheeɗa ɓa ne ɓa amb ndengiɗ oolkohi ɓa oolkoh baahohiŋ Kooh.<verse eid="ACT 13:43"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pool na Barnabaas kaɗiɗ ŋ ɓi nikɗi Yawuut</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 13:44"/>Wa mbeha na iɗsiɗkohse dokkis, ɓo' min woo ne kur ka jen ɓeɗ coh ne ɓa sikɗuk woo kiŋ Heɗ ɓoo. <verse eid="ACT 13:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 13:45"/>Wa Yawuut ca hot mboolnda, ɓa siiseeɗa Pool na Barnabaas, ɓa taaseeɗa Pool, ɓa ɓaseeɗa ɗe. <verse eid="ACT 13:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 13:46"/>Ŋ ndeem Pool na Barnabaas neƴƴohɗi nga, woosa ɓa ne : « E ɗu joy koc yegɗu woo kiŋ Kooh, waaye ŋ gantuki ɗu gantuka, ɗu atte haf ɗu ne ɗu yeyyooɗi raak kipes ki reehanɗi. Kon ɓoo ɓii yurah ŋ cuuɓ ci cinooci. <verse eid="ACT 13:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 13:47"/>Laam weɗ ini Heɗi nak ɓoo, wi a woo ne : “ Ŋ tufkiɗiɗ ɗa ne fu nik siñaariŋ cuuɓ ci, fu ɓay muci po ɗisik nu ɗisik ŋ Adina.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:47 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 49:6">Esayi 49:6</ref> </char></note> ” »<verse eid="ACT 13:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 13:48"/>Wa ɓooɓa nikɗi Yawuut kerah woo ceem, ɓa summba keeh-keeh, ɓa laasukka woo kiŋ Heɗi te ɓooɓa Kooh kooɗee ne ɓa rahas kipes ki reehanɗi jen kossa. <verse eid="ACT 13:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 13:49"/>Woo kiŋ Heɗ ɓoo pasarkohha ŋ kur ca nikee ndaam jen. <verse eid="ACT 13:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 13:50"/>Waaye Yawuut ca hiirra yakak caŋ kur-taaha, na ɓi ɓitiɓ ; yakak ceem na ɓitiɓ ceem tolfiɗeeɗa Pool na Barnabaas po ɓa puliɗta ɓa ŋ kur caam jen. Ɓitiɓ ceem meeɗ meeɗ ñaamuk Kooh, ɓa nikee ɓitiɓ raakiɗ tiik.<verse eid="ACT 13:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 13:51"/>Ŋ ineem Pool na Barnabaas farsiɗta ɓa merhey miŋ kot ciŋ ɓa ndeem, kaɗta Ikoñum. <verse eid="ACT 13:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 13:52"/>Waaye ini kaɗ ŋ taalubeeca, ɓa summba keeh-keeh, ɓa riiffa na Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani.<verse eid="ACT 13:52"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ACT 14"/>
  <para style="s">Pool na Barnabaas ŋ Ikoñum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 14:1"/>Wa Pool na Barnabaas nik ŋ Ikoñum wa nikohissa ɗaa : Ɓa aassa ŋ <char style="w" lemma="sinaagog"><char style="tl">sinaagogaŋ</char></char> Yawuut ca. Ɓa woyeeɗa na ɓooɓa ŋ woo kiŋ Kooh po Yawuut na nikaaɗi Yawuut laayiɗ kossa. <verse eid="ACT 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 14:2"/>Waaye Yawuut ca kosaaɗiica tummba po ɓi nikɗi Yawuut raakka liiɓohaaɗ moɗaaɗi ŋ ɓaah caŋ ɓoo kosiɗ ca. <verse eid="ACT 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 14:3"/>Hondohɗi nak Pool na Barnabaas taalndiɗta nikka ŋ kur-taaha. Ɓa woyeeɗa woo kiŋ Kooh na hel daliɗ, laam ɓa oolkeen Heɗ ɓoo te a ndengɗeen ne woo ki teeɓoh baahohiŋ ɗe wa keeh. Ŋ ineem a onnda ɓa, ɓa tumeeɗa ɓi keemaan na ɓi in feyohiɗ. <verse eid="ACT 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 14:4"/>Ɓooɓaŋ kur ka kerhiɗohɗi, ɓa paysukohha kanak : Ɓum lannga na Yawuut ca, ɓinooɓa lannga na <char style="w"><char style="tl">Apootar</char></char> ci. <verse eid="ACT 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 14:5"/>Yawuut ca na nikaaɗi Yawuut ca hunnda na kilifaacaŋ ɓa, ɓa kooɗukka tum Pool na Barnabaas miskiɗ, ɓa tap ɓa atoh po ɓa ap ɓa. <verse eid="ACT 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 14:6"/>Waaye wi ɓa inaha, ɓa kaɗta naafka ŋ kur-taah caŋ Likawni cii : Listar, Derbe na ina wil ca. <verse eid="ACT 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 14:7"/>Ɓa woyeeɗa <char style="w">Yegɗohiŋ Muci</char> ŋ ndaam.<verse eid="ACT 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pool na Barnabaas ŋ Listar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 14:8"/>Ŋ Listar, wa raakeen ƴaar minaaɗi tufuk nga ; a rimuk rimuk na ineem, a moosɗi tiindoh. A nikka ɓoofiɗ, <verse eid="ACT 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 14:9"/>a sikɗukeeɗa woo kiŋ Pool. Pool iiƴca ɗe, hotta ne ƴaara raakiɗ kos ne a min wirɗu, <verse eid="ACT 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 14:10"/>a woosa ɗe ŋ ɗafka ne : « Kurka, fu tufuk koc na kot ciŋ ɗa ! » Ƴaara kurukka japit, a tiindeeɗa.<verse eid="ACT 14:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 14:11"/>Wa mboolnda hot ini Pool haɓiɗ, ɓa leehukka, ɓa woosa ŋ Likawni peɗmaŋ ɓa ne : « Hee, kooh ci ɓayiɗ mandohaaɗ ɓo', ca ruhsiɗ nga ɓoo. » <verse eid="ACT 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 14:12"/>Ɓa teekka Barnabaas Sos, ɓa teekka Pool Hermes<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:12 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Sos na Hermes </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: ca nikee kooh ŋ kooh ciŋ <char style="w">Gerek</char> ci. Sos a yi adgohee kooh ciŋ ɓa. Hermes a yi meeɗ wik woos ci.</char></note>, laam a yi ɓayohee woo ki. <verse eid="ACT 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 14:13"/>Wa raakeen ŋ <char style="w" lemma="aasoha kur">aasohaanaŋ kur ka</char> ɗiska ɓa meeɗ ñaamkoh Sos. <char style="w" lemma="seeƴkiɗoh">Seeƴkiɗoha</char> ɓayya, ŋ fiki buntaanaŋ wa, ɓi naar inoh ɓekɗuuɗ tokkaah haɓɗohuuɗ pos. A waaɗta hun na mboolnda ne a seeƴkoh ca Barnabaas na Pool.<verse eid="ACT 14:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 14:14"/>Wa Barnabaas na Pool kerah ineem, ɓa faarra kulɓaacaŋ ɓa sagu araami wa araam, ɓa faɗsukka mboolnda, ɓa woyeeɗa ŋ ɗafka ne : <verse eid="ACT 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 14:15"/>« Ƴaaɓiŋ ngo, wa ye ɓek ɗu ŋ inii ? Ɓoo nam nik ɓo' njaay findiiɗu. Ɓoo hay ne ɓoo woo ɗu yegɗoh neɓiɗ ne ɗu faɗ in ci raakaaɗi njiriñ ci te ɗu wiiruk ŋ Koohi na pese, yi fer Eel ci na kehƴi na cookmi na in ci nik nga ca jen.<verse eid="ACT 14:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 14:16"/>Wotɓa, a faɗeen cuuɓ ci jen, waa nu nga ɗa taambɗeeɗa waasiŋ ɗe. <verse eid="ACT 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 14:17"/>Hondohɗi a taalndiɗta a teeɓeeɗa ɓa baah kiŋ ɗe : A ruhsiɗeeɗa toɓi ŋ eel ci wuu ɗu, a laaɓɗeeɗa yohon ci ŋ jamanooniŋ wa, a oneeɗa ɗu kañam, a riifɗeeɗa keeñ ciŋ ɗu na sum. » <verse eid="ACT 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 14:18"/>Na woo ceem jen sah, wa yooɓeeɗi ŋ Barnabaas na Pool ne ɓa hondoh mboolnda seeƴuk wuu ɓa.<verse eid="ACT 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 14:19"/>Wa ineem coot, ɓi Yawuut pulohha Añcos-Pisidi na Ikoñum, ɓa tummba po mboolnda lannga na ɓa. Ɓeem tapeeɗa Pool atoh ne ɓa ap ɗe, ƴutta ɓa faseeɗa ɗe po ɓa pulla kur ka, ɓa liiɓee ne a kaaniɗ. <verse eid="ACT 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 14:20"/>Waaye wa taalubeeca hay ndeerra ɗe, Pool kurukka, a aassa kur ka. Ŋ Kooh-wiisiina, a hunnda na Barnabaas, ɓa kaɗta Derbe.<verse eid="ACT 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pool na Barnabaas dokkiɗ Añcos</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 14:21"/>Pool na Barnabaas woosa Yegɗohiŋ Muci ŋ Derbe, ɓi ɓo' laayiɗ ndaam kossa, ɓa nikka taalube. Ŋ ineem, ɓa dokukka Listar, Ikoñum na Añcos-Pisidi, <verse eid="ACT 14:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 14:22"/>ɓa ndengtineeɗa taalubeeca, ɓa ñaaheeɗa ɓa ne ɓa amb ndengiɗ kosi ɓa kos. Ɓa woosa ɓa ne : « Ɓoo joyiɗ taamb ŋ miskiɗ laayiɗ ɓoo han aas ŋ Nguuriŋ-Kooh. » <verse eid="ACT 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 14:23"/>Jangu nu nik ɗah, Pool na Barnabaas tannda ɓi yakak nga ne ɓeem adgoha, ɓa kiimeeɗa Kooh, ɓa oreeɗa, ɓa faɗta ɓa ŋ yaah Heɗ ɓoo yi ɓa kose.<verse eid="ACT 14:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 14:24"/>Ɓa pulohha ndeem, ɓa lahha ŋ ɗooƴ Pisidi, ɓa kaɗta Pamfili. <verse eid="ACT 14:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 14:25"/>Ɓa yegɗohha woo kiŋ Kooh ŋ Perge, ƴutta ɓa kaɗta Attali. <verse eid="ACT 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 14:26"/>Ŋ ndaam, ɓa aassa <char style="tl">bato</char> ne ɓa wiiruk Añcos, ɗiska kosiɗ ca wikohee ɓa Kooh ne a baahohaat ɓa ŋ pangki ɓa mitiɗ wii. <verse eid="ACT 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 14:27"/>Wa Pool na Barnabaas ree Añcos, ɓa cohɗohha ɓi Janguuna, ɓa naandsukka ɓa in ci Kooh haɓiɗ taamboh nga ɓa jen, na findi a rangsiɗoh ɓooɓi nikɗi Yawuut waasiŋ kosi. <verse eid="ACT 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 14:28"/>Ɓa tassa ŋ ndaam in maañiɗ na taalubeeci.<verse eid="ACT 14:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ACT 15"/>
  <para style="s">Cohaŋ Yerusalem ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ kosiɗ ci nikɗi Yawuut</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 15:1"/>Wa raakeen ɓi ɓo', ɓa pulohee Yudee, ɓa hayya Añcos, ɓa jangɗeeɗa ɓaah ciŋ ɓoo kosiɗ ci ne ɓa <char style="w" lemma="nguɗuk">nguɗukɗi</char> findi <char style="w" lemma="waasiŋ Musaa">waasiŋ</char> <char style="w">Musaa</char> nakoha ɗah, ɓa heyɗi mine mucɗu. <verse eid="ACT 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 15:2"/>Pool na Barnabaas muuƴohha na ɓa, taastiɗoheeɗa na ɓa taastiɗoh miskiɗ ŋ ineem. Ŋ mirndaani, kosiɗ caŋ Añcos ammba ne Pool na Barnabaas joyiɗ hun na ɓi ɓo' ɓaah nga ɓa, ɓa kaɗ Yerusalem ŋ <char style="w"><char style="tl">Apootar</char></char> ca na yakak ca ŋ ndaam, ɓa woo ŋ ineem.<verse eid="ACT 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 15:3"/>Ɓi Janguuna eɗta ɓa ini ɓa ɓayan ŋ ɓaaɓiŋ ɓa. Ɓa lahha Feniis na Samari, ɓa naandsukeeɗa findi ɓooɓi nikɗi Yawuut hayoh ŋ Heɗi. Ineem soosiɗta lool keeñ ciŋ ɓaah caŋ ɓoo kosiɗ ca jen.<verse eid="ACT 15:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 15:4"/>Wa ɓa ree Yerusalem, ɓi Janguuna na <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ca, na yakak caŋ Janguuna taambkohha ɓa. Ɓa naandsukka ɓa in ci Kooh tum jen taamboh nga ɓa. <verse eid="ACT 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 15:5"/>Waaye wa raakeen ɓi ɓo' ɓaah ŋ <char style="w"><char style="tl">Farisen</char></char> ca, ɓa koseen, ɓa kurukka, ɓa woyeeɗa ne : « Kosiɗ ci nikɗi Yawuut joy joy nguɗu, ɓa woyu ne ɓa taambɗaat waasiŋ Musaa. »<verse eid="ACT 15:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 15:6"/>
    <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ca na yakak ca cohha ne ɓa marak ineem. <verse eid="ACT 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 15:7"/>Ɓa taastiɗoheeɗa po, Piyeer kurukka, woosa ɓa ne : « Ɓaah ciŋ ngo, ɗu inhiɗ ne Kooh taniɗ to maañiɗ ŋ ɗooƴ ɗu ne ŋ inhiɗ ɓi nikɗi Yawuut <char style="w">Yegɗohiŋ Muci</char> ne ɓa keraha, ɓa kos. <verse eid="ACT 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 15:8"/>Te Kooh yi inah ini nik ŋ ɗooƴ keeñ ci teeɓohiɗ ne a teyɗukiɗ ɓa, ŋ oni a on ɓa ne ɓa rahas <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani</char> findi a onoha ɓoo. <verse eid="ACT 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 15:9"/>Kooh raakɗi ali talsoh ŋ harmban ɓoo na ɓa, a hoolɗiɗ keeñ ciŋ ɓa ŋ kosi ɓa kos. <verse eid="ACT 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 15:10"/>Kon ɗiski wa nik, wa ye tah ɗu waaksiɗke Kooh ŋ waaɗi ɗu waaɗ raan taalubeeci ɗufi ɓoo na caac ciŋ ɓoo moosɗi min raanuk ? <verse eid="ACT 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 15:11"/>Muk ! Ini ɓoo kos weɗ ne Heɗ ɓoo Yeesu mucɗiɗ ɓoo findi a nam ɓa mucɗoh ŋ baahohi a baahoh ɓoo jen. »<verse eid="ACT 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 15:12"/>Wa Piyeer woo woo keem, ɓooɓa jen sikɗukeeɗa Barnabaas na Pool, ɓeem naandsukka ɓa firndeeci na keemaan ci laayiɗ ci Kooh tum taamboh nga ɓa ŋ ɗooƴ ɓooɓi nikɗi Yawuut.<verse eid="ACT 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 15:13"/>Wa ɓa ƴut woo, Saak kooɗta woo ka, a woosa ne : « Ɓaah ciŋ ngo, sikɗukaat to ! <verse eid="ACT 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 15:14"/>Simong naandsukiɗ ɗu wi Kooh camb taambkoh ɓi nikɗi Yawuut ne a tan nga ɓa cuuɓi nikan wiŋ ɗe. <verse eid="ACT 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 15:15"/>Te woo ciŋ woosuuɗ ci huniɗ ŋ ineem, findi wa fiisohu an : <verse eid="ACT 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 15:16"/>“ Kooh woo ne :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:16">Ŋ finho in ceem, ŋ hey hayisse</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:16">te ŋ hey tufkiɗisse kahniŋ Dawuuda keene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:16">ŋ nangɗoh pook-pook ciŋ wa, ŋ taɓahisa.<verse eid="ACT 15:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 15:17"/>Ŋ ineem, ini tas ŋ ɓooɓiŋ adinaani</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:17">hey waake Heɗi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:17">Ee di' ! Cuuɓ ci ŋ tan jen ne ɓa nik wuu so,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:17">hey yo waake.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:17">Ineem weɗ Heɗi woo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:17">yi na tume in ceem,<verse eid="ACT 15:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 15:18"/>te a inhiɗiɗ ɓooɓi wa in maañiɗ.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 9:11-12">Amos 9:11-12</ref></char></note> ”<verse eid="ACT 15:18"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 15:19"/>Weɗ tah, mi yi Saak, ŋ huniɗ nga ne ɓoo kinaat yaaɓiɗ ɓi na haye ŋ Kooh te ɓa nikɗi Yawuut. <verse eid="ACT 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 15:20"/>Waaye ɓoo fiisɗaat ɓa ne ɓa wortukaat ñam kañam ci seeƴkohu wuu kooh ci nikaaɗiici, kañam ceem hoolɗi. Ɓa nam wortuk faankoh sangohuuɗ, na ñam med, na an ñif. <verse eid="ACT 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 15:21"/>Laam ŋ ɗeɓgaan po wi, ɓi ɓo' ɓii yegɗoh waasiŋ Musaa ŋ kur-taah nu nik te ŋ <char style="w" lemma="mbehi na iɗsiɗkohse">mbeh ci na iɗsiɗkohse</char> jen, teereeciŋ waasiŋ Musaa na jangse jangu ŋ <char style="w"><char style="tl">sinaagog</char></char> ci. »<verse eid="ACT 15:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kayit fiisuuɗ, kaɓɗohuusa kosiɗ ca nikɗi Yawuut</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 15:22"/>Wa Saak ƴut woo, <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ca na yakak ca na ɓi Janguuna jen hunnda ne ɓa kooɗ ɓi ɓo' ŋ ɗooƴ ɓa, ɓa tuuƴ ɓa Añcos, ɓa hun na Pool na Barnabaas. Ɓa kooɗta Yuud yi na ɓeeɗkohse Barsabaas, na Silaas. Ɓeɗ ɓi kanak ceem, ɓa nikee ɓo' kerhiɗuuɗ ŋ ɓaah ciŋ ɓoo kosiɗ ci. <verse eid="ACT 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 15:23"/>Ɓa eɗta ɓa kayti fiisu inii :</para>
  <para style="pi1" vid="ACT 15:23">« Ɗu ɓi ɓaah ciŋ ɓoo nikɗi Yawuut te ɗu gennda Añcos, Siri na Silisi, ɓoo ɓii kañiɗ ɗu, ɓoo ɓi ɓaah ciŋ ɗu <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ci na yakak ci. <verse eid="ACT 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 15:24"/>Ɓoo kerhiɗ ne raakiɗ ɓooɓi puloh nga ɓoo ndii ɓa hayya nga ɗu, ɓa ambsohha haf ciŋ ɗu, ɓa yahrohha hel ciŋ ɗu na woo ciŋ ɓa, te ɓoo nakɗi ɓa wa.<verse eid="ACT 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 15:25"/>Ineem weɗ tah ɓoo hunnda ɓoo kooɗta ɓi ɓo', ɓoo woossa ɓa nga ɗu. Ɓoo ambsohha ɓa na Barnabaas na Pool, ɓaah ciŋ ɓoo ɓoo keeñkoh, <verse eid="ACT 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 15:26"/>ɓi eɗoh kipes ciŋ ɓa wuu Yeesu <char style="w">Kiristaa</char>, Heɗ ɓoo. <verse eid="ACT 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 15:27"/>Kon ɓoo ɓii tuuƴ Yuud na Silaas ne ɓa woo ɗu na nguɓ ini ɓoo fiis ŋ kaytii.<verse eid="ACT 15:27"/></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 15:28"/>Ini neɓ Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani te wa neɓpa ɓoo weɗ ne ɓoo heyɗi ɗu raane nakoh wiiriis ɗal ci minɗi faɗu cii : <verse eid="ACT 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 15:29"/>Kinaat ñam kañam ci seeƴkohu wuu kooh nikaaɗi, kinaat an ñif, kinaat ñam med, wortukaat njaaloo. Ɗu penduk in ceem ɗah, wa hey baahe. Nikaat ŋ jam ! »<verse eid="ACT 15:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 15:30"/>Wa kayta fiisu po ƴutta, ɓooɓa tuuƴsee kurkohha ndaam, ɓa kaɗta Añcos. Wa ɓa ree, ɓa cohɗohha ɓooɓa, ɓa eɗta ɓa kayta fiisuuɗa. <verse eid="ACT 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 15:31"/>Wa janguusa, ɓooɓa summba ŋ ini wa woo, wa ɓaatta ndengiɗ kosi ɓa kos.<verse eid="ACT 15:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 15:32"/>Yuud na Silaas ɓeɗ ŋ haf ɓa, ɓa nikee woosuuɗ. Ŋ ineem ɓa woyeeɗa na ɓaah caŋ ɓoo kosiɗ ca in maañiɗ, ɓa ñaaheeɗa ɓa, ɓa ndengɗeeɗa kosi ɓa kos. <verse eid="ACT 15:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 15:33"/>Ɓa nikka ŋ ndaam in samiɗ maañ, ƴutta ɓaah caŋ ɓoo kosiɗ ca faɗta ɓa ne ɓa dokuk moɗoɗ ŋ ɓooɓa woosee ɓa. [<verse eid="ACT 15:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 15:34"/>Waaye Silaas tassa ŋ Añcos, Yuud dokukka Yerusalem kiik ce.]<verse eid="ACT 15:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 15:35"/>Pool na Barnabaas tassa ŋ Añcos, ɓa taalndiɗta na ɓi ɓo' laayiɗ ɓa jangɗoheeɗa, ɓa yegɗoheeɗa woo kiŋ muci, wi kaɗ ŋ Heɗi.<verse eid="ACT 15:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pool na Barnabaas hunisɗi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 15:36"/>Wa degga ɓi neeh, Pool woosa Barnabaas ne : « Ɓoo dokkaat marka ɓaah ciŋ ɓoo kosiɗ ci ŋ kur-taah ci ɓoo taamboh jen yegɗoheeɗa woo kiŋ Heɗi, ɓoo marak findi ɓa nikoh. » <verse eid="ACT 15:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 15:37"/>Barnabaas waaɗta ɓayndoh Saaŋ yi na woyse Maarko, <verse eid="ACT 15:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 15:38"/>waaye Pool hotta ne ɓa joyɗi ɗe ɓayndoh, sagu faɗa a faɗee ɓa ŋ Pamfili a hunisɗi na ɓa ŋ pangkaŋ ɓa. <verse eid="ACT 15:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 15:39"/>Ɓa nookohha nookoh miskiɗ po ɓa mirndohha saɓsukoh. Barnabaas ɓayndohha Maarko, ɓa aassa <char style="tl">batoona</char> na kaɗe Siipar. <verse eid="ACT 15:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 15:40"/>Pool nak, a tannda Silaas ne a kaɗ na ɗe. Ɓaah caŋ ɓoo kosiɗ ca dengkohha ɓa Heɗi, ŋ baahohiŋ ɗe, ɓa cootta.<figure style="fig" alt="Paul's second missionary journey" file="WD_Paul2-3D-BW-Saafi.jpg" size="span" loc="Somewhere in 15:40–18:22, preferably so that when one sees the map, one can already see or has already seen 15:40." ref="15:40–18:22"/> <verse eid="ACT 15:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 15:41"/>Ɓa taammba Siri na Silisi ɓa ñaaheeɗa ɓooɓa ɓaahee ŋ Janguuca ne ɓa ndengɗuk ŋ kosiŋ ɓa.<verse eid="ACT 15:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ACT 16"/>
  <para style="s">Timoote huniɗ na Pool na Silaas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 16:1"/>Wa Pool taamb ŋ Siri na Silisi, a kaɗta Derbe, ƴutta a kaɗta Listar. Raakeen ŋ ndaam taalube teeku Timoote, yaay ɓa nikee Yawuut kosiɗ, waaye baab ɓa nikee <char style="w">Gerek</char>. <verse eid="ACT 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 16:2"/>Ɓaah caŋ ɓoo kosiɗ ca nikee ŋ Listar na Ikoñum seede'een baah kiŋ Timoote. <verse eid="ACT 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 16:3"/>Pool waaɗta ne a hun na ɗe ; ŋ ineem a ɓayya ɗe, a <char style="w" lemma="nguɗuk">nguɗta</char> ɗe sagu Yawuut ca genee ŋ ɓak caam. Laam ɓa inheen jen ne baab ɓa Gerek.<verse eid="ACT 16:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 16:4"/>Pool na Silaas hunnda na Timoote, ɓa taambeeɗa kur na kur, ɓa woyeeɗa kosiɗ ca ini <char style="w"><char style="tl">Apootar</char></char> ci na yakak caŋ Janguunaŋ Yerusalem woo ŋ cohaŋ ɓa, ɓa nakka ɓa ne, ɓa taambɗaat ineem. <verse eid="ACT 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 16:5"/>Ŋ ineem, kosiɗ ca uupeeɗa ndeng ŋ kosiŋ ɓa, ɓa ɓaateeɗa laay Kooh-nu-wiis.<verse eid="ACT 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani ɓeeɗkiɗ Pool ne a kaɗ Maseduwaan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 16:6"/>
    <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani</char> hondohha Pool na Silaas yegɗoh <char style="w">Yegɗohiŋ Muci</char> ŋ kur caŋ Asi. Weɗ ɓa taamboh ŋ ɓakiŋ Firisi wi ɓaah ŋ Galaat. <verse eid="ACT 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 16:7"/>Wa ɓa ree ŋ sero kur caŋ Misi, ɓa jeemmba kaɗ caŋ Bitini waaye <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsiŋ Yeesu</char> onɗi ɓa ne ɓa kaɗ ndaam. <verse eid="ACT 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 16:8"/>Weɗ ɓa taamboh ŋ Misi, ɓa kaɗta Torowaas, ŋ sero cookma. <verse eid="ACT 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 16:9"/>Na weka, in hayɗohha Pool findi heeƴ : An a hot ɓo' gen Maseduwaan tufkiɗ kiimeeɗa ɗe keeh-keeh ne : « Aasa <char style="tl">bato</char>, fu hay Maseduwaan, fu ɓaatɗoh ɓoo ! »<verse eid="ACT 16:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 16:10"/>Wa Pool heeƴ heeƴeem, wa hooleen ɓoo ne e Kooh na ɓeeɗke ɓoo ne ɓoo kaɗ woya Yegɗohiŋ Muci ŋ ndaam. Jaarra ɓoo markeeɗa findi ɓoo kaɗohan Maseduwaan.<verse eid="ACT 16:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Liidi kosiɗ Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 16:11"/>Weɗ ɓoo kooɗoh <char style="tl">bato</char> ŋ Torowaas, ɓoo yurhiɗta kur ka na woyse Samotaraas, a masuɓ wila. Ŋ Kooh-wiisiina, ɓoo kurkohha ndaam, ɓoo kaɗta Neyapoli. <verse eid="ACT 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 16:12"/>Ɓoo pulohha ndeem, ɓoo kaɗta Filippi. Filippi, wa ɓaahee ŋ kur-taah ca ɓi kur kaŋ <char style="w">Rom</char> raakootee, te ngaŋ Maseduwaan jen, weɗ uupɗee njiriñ ŋ kur-taah caam. Ɓoo nikka ŋ kur keem ɓi neeh.<verse eid="ACT 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 16:13"/>Wa mbehi na iɗsiɗkohse ree, ɓoo pulla ŋ bilaf faŋ kur-taaha, ŋ sero huluɓ, ɗiska ɓoo liiɓee ne wa ɗisik kiimoha Kooh. Ɓi ɓitiɓ coheen ndaam, ɓoo ɓooffa, ɓoo ɓeesɗoheeɗa na ɓa.<verse eid="ACT 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 16:14"/>Wa raakeen ɓitiɓ nga ɓa teeku Liidi, a nikee toonoh cuup ruumind, a genee kur-taahaŋ Tiyatiir, a nikee ɓo' nupiɗ Kooh. A sikɗukeeɗa ɓoo baahiɗ. Heɗ ɓoo rangissa keeñiŋ Liidi yeem po a teyɗukka ini Pool woye. <verse eid="ACT 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 16:15"/>A ɓoktuusa a yi na ɓi kahan ce, ƴutta a kiimmba ɓoo ne : « Nik ne ɗu hotiɗ ne ŋ kosiɗ Heɗ ɓoo ɗah, hayaat ɗu dal ŋ kahan ndo. » A tummba po ɓoo teyɗukka.<verse eid="ACT 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pool na Silaas taƴuuɗ ŋ Filippi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 16:16"/>Wa raakka mbeh, ɓoo kaɗeeɗa ɗiska na kiimohse Kooh, ɓoo cohha na cafaƴ, a nikee <char style="w">ñaam</char>. Ñaameem hunee na <char style="w">jiini</char>, jiinndi ɓekee ɗe ŋ markis. Markisiŋ ɗe meeɗ meeɗ kom ɓooɓi raakee ɗe kopor laayiɗ. <verse eid="ACT 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 16:17"/>A ñaakɗeeɗa Pool, raak ɓoo hun na Pool, a woyeeɗa ŋ ɗafka ne : « Ɓooɓii, ɓa surgaaciŋ Koohi uup yak, ɓa hay ne ɓa teeɓ ɗu waasiŋ muci. » <verse eid="ACT 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 16:18"/>A gennda gen a woyeeɗa ineem ɓi neeh laayiɗ, waaye wi wa kaɗ po wa yaaɓiɗta Pool, Pool gurdukka jiinnda nikee ŋ kuɓka cafƴa, a woosa ɗe ne : « Ñam woo ɗa wa, ŋ tiikiŋ Yeesu <char style="w">Kiristaa</char>, pula ŋ ɓoyii ! » Ŋ ɗiska ɗiska jiinnda pulla ŋ kuɓka cafƴa.<verse eid="ACT 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 16:19"/>Wa ɓi heɗ ñaama hot ne ɓa malkisɗi ina ɓa meeɗ maluk nga ɗe, ɓa ammba Pool na Silaas, ɓa faseeɗa ɓa po ŋ ɗiska na toonohse, ŋ fiki kilifaaca. <verse eid="ACT 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 16:20"/>Ɓa kommba ɓa kilifaaca adgohee kur ka, ɓa woosa ɓa ne : « Ƴaaɓii ɓa na yoonde kur kiŋ ɓoo te ɓa Yawuut. <verse eid="ACT 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 16:21"/>Ɓa na jangɗohe mbaah ci fu inah ne waas onɗi ɓoo ne ɓoo teyɗuk ca wala taambiɗ ca, ɓoo ɓi ɓaah ŋ Rom. »<verse eid="ACT 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 16:22"/>Mboolnda nammba hun nga, ɓa keennda Pool na Silaas. Weɗ kilifaaca nakohoh ne ɓa wolsassaat, ɓa laɓu ndooɗ. <verse eid="ACT 16:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 16:23"/>Wa ɓa laɓ ɓa laɓ miskiɗ po ƴutta, ɓa rannga ɓa ŋ kasoona. Kilifaaca woosa ƴaara niiɗee kasoona ne a niiɗaat ɓa baahiɗ. <verse eid="ACT 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 16:24"/>Denga ƴaara niiɗee kasoona dengse, tahha po, a ɓayya ɓa ŋ ɗooƴ ɗooƴ kasoona, a jatannga kot ciŋ ɓa jatang miskiɗ na hang.<verse eid="ACT 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 16:25"/>Ŋ ndengelnde weka, Pool na Silaas kiimeeɗa Kooh, ɓa ƴeekeeɗa yakkiŋ Kooh, ambuuɗ ca ɓinooɓa sikɗukeeɗa ɓa. <verse eid="ACT 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 16:26"/>Ɗekka po kehƴi yoondɗukka keeh-keeh po <char style="tl">fondamaanaŋ</char> kasoona yoondɗukka, jaarra buntaaca jen rangsukka, jatang caŋ ɓooɓa ambsee jen toksukka. <verse eid="ACT 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 16:27"/>Weɗ ƴaara niiɗee kasoona yunkoh, a hotta buntaaca rangsukiɗ, a fuurra ndangaŋ ɗe ne a ap haf ce. A liiɓee ne ambuuɗ ca fusiɗ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ŋ waasiŋ Rom, ɓo' ambseen kaso ɗah, a fus soldaari na niiɗee ɗe ɗah, e soldaari na degse in ci ambuuɗeem joyee degu. Nik ne a nikee apaah apu ɗah, kon soldaari hey apse.</char></note>.<verse eid="ACT 16:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 16:28"/>Waaye Pool woosa ŋ ɗafka ne : « Kina tum haf fu miskiɗ, ɓoo jen ɓoo ɓii nga. » <verse eid="ACT 16:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 16:29"/>Ƴaara meeksohha niitoha, a arra aas, a tiitta po a saakɗoheeɗa, a ƴekka ŋ fiki Pool na Silaas. <verse eid="ACT 16:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 16:30"/>Ƴutta a puliɗta ɓa ŋ hara, a meekissa ɓa ne : « Kilifaaci, ŋ joy tum na po ŋ min muc ? » <verse eid="ACT 16:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 16:31"/>Ɓa loffa ɗe ne : « Kosa Yeesu Heɗi, fu hey muce, fu na ɓi kahan fu. »<verse eid="ACT 16:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 16:32"/>Ŋ ineem, ɓa woosa ɗe woo kiŋ Heɗi, a yi na ɓi gen kahan ce jen. <verse eid="ACT 16:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 16:33"/>Ŋ wahtuuneem ŋ ɗooƴ weka, ƴaara niiɗee kasoona ɓayya Pool na Silaas, a ɓookiɗta ɓa gaañ caŋ ɓa ; a ɓoktuusa ŋ ɗiska ɗiska, a yi na ɓi kahan ce jen. <verse eid="ACT 16:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 16:34"/>Ƴutta, a ɓayya ɓa ŋ kahan ce, a degiɗta ɓa kañam, a summba lool ŋ ini a kos Kooh, a yi na ɓi kahan ce jen.<verse eid="ACT 16:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pool na Silaas faɗsuuɗ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 16:35"/>Wa Kooh wiis, kilifaaca kanak ca adgohee kur ka tuuƴca ɓi alkaate ne ɓa woya ƴaara niiɗee kasoona ne a faɗis ƴaaɓaam. <verse eid="ACT 16:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 16:36"/>Yeem woosa Pool ne : « Kilifaaci woosohiɗ nga so ne ɗu faɗsu ; kon pulaat ɗu kaɗ na jam. »<verse eid="ACT 16:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 16:37"/>Waaye Pool woosa alkaateeca ne : « Ɓa atteeɗi ɓoo, ɓa laɓɗukka ɓoo ŋ fiki ɓooɓi, ƴutta ɓa taƴca ɓoo ŋ kasooni, te moona ɓoo ɓaah ŋ Rom. Kotii ɓa waaɗ ɓoo faɗis te wa yegsuu e ? Muk ! Ɓa hayaat ɓeɗ ŋ haf ɓa, ɓa puliɗ ɓoo ! »<verse eid="ACT 16:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 16:38"/>Alkaateeca woosa kilifaaca kanak ca ineem, ɓeem tiitta lool wa ɓa kerah ne Pool na Silaas ɓaah ŋ Rom. <verse eid="ACT 16:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 16:39"/>Ɓa hayya ɓa ɗaasnuke, ɓa puliɗta ɓa ŋ kasoona, ɓa kiimmba ɓa ne ɓa pul kur-taaha.<verse eid="ACT 16:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 16:40"/>Wa ɓa pul kasoona, Pool na Silaas kaɗta kahan Liidi. Ɓa hotohha na ɓaah caŋ ɓoo kosiɗ ca, ɓa ñaahha ɓa ŋ kosa ɓa kos. Ƴutta ɓa cootta.<verse eid="ACT 16:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="ACT 17"/>
  <para style="s">Pool na Silaas kaɗiɗ Tessalonik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 17:1"/>Wa ɓa kurkoh Filippi, Pool na Silaas taammba Amfipolis na Apoloni, ɓa kaɗta Tessalonik. Ŋ ndaam, Yawuut ca raakeen <char style="w"><char style="tl">sinaagog</char></char> nga. <verse eid="ACT 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 17:2"/>Pool kaɗta nga, findi a na tumohee wa. <char style="w">Mbehi na iɗsiɗkohse</char> reesa ɗah, a woyee na ɓa ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ Fiis ci, po ca nikka mbeh iɗsiɗkoha kaahay. <verse eid="ACT 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 17:3"/>A toksiɗeeɗa ɓa Fiis ci, a teeɓeeɗa ɓa ne <char style="w">Mucɗohi Gapohse</char> joyee joy kaan, a hulit. A woosa ne : « Yeesu yi mi na woyee ɗu yeem, a yi Mucɗohi Gapohse. »<verse eid="ACT 17:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 17:4"/>Woo ceem aassa ɓi Yawuut, ɓa hunnda na Pool na Silaas. Ɓo' laayiɗ ŋ <char style="w">Gerek</char> ci nup Kooh, na ɓitiɓ laayiɗ ɓaah ŋ raakiɗ tiik ca nammba hun na ɓa.<verse eid="ACT 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 17:5"/>Waaye Yawuut ca ɓinooɓa, siis ammba ɓa, ɓa parahha ɓi ɓo' mbalay mbalay ŋ mbeeddaaca, ɓa nangɗohha ɓa po ɓa ɗuuɗiɗta kur-taaha. Ɓa kaɗta kahan Yasoon waaka Pool na Silaas ne ɓa ɓay ɓa ŋ fiki ɓooɓa. <verse eid="ACT 17:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 17:6"/>Waaye ɓa raakɗi ɓa nga, ɓa ɓayya Yasoon na ɓi ɓo' wiiriis ŋ ɓaah caŋ ɓoo kosiɗ ca, ɓa faseeɗa ɓa po ŋ fiki kilifaacaŋ kur ka. Ɓa woyeeɗa ŋ ɗafka ne : « Ƴaaɓii yoondɗiɗ adinaani jen te ɓa reyiɗ naa ndii kotii ! <verse eid="ACT 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 17:7"/>Yasoon dalɗiɗ ɓa ŋ kahan ce. Ɓa jen ɓa na haɓɗe ini ɗaloh na nakoh ciŋ buuri yakkiŋ <char style="w">Rom</char>, ɓa woo ne buur wiiriis raakiɗ, teeku Yeesu ! »<verse eid="ACT 17:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 17:8"/>Woo ceem jaahiɗta mboolnda na kilifaaca. <verse eid="ACT 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 17:9"/>Kilifaaca sannga faɗis Yasoon na ɓinooɓa, po ɓeem <char style="tl">tayle</char> kopor, ɓa hannda faɗsu.<verse eid="ACT 17:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pool na Silaas kaɗiɗ Beree</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 17:10"/>Ɓaah caŋ ɓoo kosiɗ ca jaarra ɓay Pool na Silaas ŋ ɗooƴ weka, ɓa cootiɗta ɓa Beree. Wa ɓa ree, ɓa kaɗta <char style="tl">sinaagogaŋ</char> Yawuut ca. <verse eid="ACT 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 17:11"/>Yawuut ca genee nga ɓeɗ uupee rangsuk ɓaŋ Tessalonik, ɓa teyɗukeen woo kiŋ Kooh te ɓa sawarra nga lool. Kooh-nu-wiis ɗah, ɓa jangee Fiis ci ne ɓa marak andi ini ɓa na jangɗasse wa keeh wala. <verse eid="ACT 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 17:12"/>Laayiɗ nga ɓa kossa. Ɓitiɓ raakiɗ tiik na ɓi ƴaar laayiɗ ŋ Gerek ca nammba kos.<verse eid="ACT 17:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 17:13"/>Waaye wa Yawuut ca genee Tessalonik kerah ne Pool yaa nam yegɗoh woo kiŋ Kooh ŋ Beree, ɓa nammba kaɗ ndaam, ɓa yopeeɗa mboolnda, ɓa ɓekeeɗa ɓa ŋ ɗuuɗ. <verse eid="ACT 17:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 17:14"/>Ŋ ineem ɓaah caŋ ɓoo kosiɗ ca arra cootiɗ Pool po ŋ cookma, waaye Silaas na Timoote tassa ŋ Beree.<verse eid="ACT 17:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 17:15"/>Ɓi ɓendee Pool ɓayya ɗe po Ateen. Ƴutta ɓa dokukka Beree na nakohiŋ Pool ne Silaas na Timoote raakaat ɗe ndaam findi wa uup gaawoh ɗah.<verse eid="ACT 17:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pool ŋ Ateen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 17:16"/>Wa Pool nik ŋ Ateen, a sekeeɗa Silaas na Timoote, a hotta findi kur ka riifoh na nataal ciŋ kooh ci nikaaɗiici, a raakka aay-keeñ miskiɗ. <verse eid="ACT 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 17:17"/>A jombeeɗa na Yawuut ca na ɓa nikeeɗi Yawuut te ɓa ñaamkeeɗa Kooh ŋ <char style="tl">sinaagoga</char>. Kooh-nu-wiis a meeɗ meeɗ woo na ɓooɓa a raakee ŋ ɗiska na toonohse jen.<verse eid="ACT 17:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 17:18"/>Ŋ ineem, wa raakeen ɓi ɓo', ɓa ɓaahee ŋ liiɓoh ci na woyse <char style="tl">Epikireen</char> na ɓi na woyse <char style="tl">Istowiseen</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:18 </char><char style="fq" closed="false"><char style="tl">Epikireen</char> na <char style="tl">Istowiseen</char> </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: <char style="tl">Epikireen</char> ci na <char style="tl">Istowiseen</char> ci, ɓa nikee liiɓoh. Ɓa meeɗ jang in ciŋ kipes ki, findi ca nikoh na findi ca na tiindohe. Waaye, ŋ harmban ɓa, ɓa ɗaloheen hot-hot. <char style="tl">Epikireen</char> ci, liiɓohaaɗiŋ ɓa kaɗeeɗi ŋ kooh ci, ini uupee ɓa nikiɗ, weɗ neɓiɗ ci nik ŋ kipes ki na findi fu min tum po fu raakuu miskiɗ. <char style="tl">Istowiseen</char> ci nak, ɓa teyɗukeen ne kooh ciŋ Gerek ci raakiɗ, waaye, ɓa raakiɗ hotohaaɗ wiiriis nga ca. Ɓa huneeɗi na <char style="tl">Epikireen</char> ci ŋ ini ɓa ambee ne e neɓiɗ ci uup raak etoh ŋ kipes.</char></note>, ɓa taastiɗoheeɗa na ɗe. Ɓum woyeeɗa ne : « Jombohii waaɗ woo ye ? » Ɓinooɓa, wa ɓa kerah Pool woyeeɗa <char style="w">Yegɗohiŋ Muci</char>, wi kaɗ ŋ Yeesu na hultiŋ kaaniɗ ci, ɓa woyeeɗa ne : « Wa mand haa ne a na yegɗohe kooh ci ɓoo inahɗi. »<verse eid="ACT 17:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19-20" style="v" sid="ACT 17:19-20"/>Weɗ ɓa hunoh na Pool, ɓa ɓayya ɗe cohohaanaŋ ɓa na woyse Aryopaas, ɓa woosa ɗe ne : « Fu yii ɓek ɓoo nof na in ci ɓoo inahɗi te ɓoo waaɗiɗ inah ini ca tokis. Kon teeɓa ɓoo in ci fu na jangɗohe. » <verse eid="ACT 17:19-20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 17:21"/>(Ɓi Ateen jen na hanheeca genee na ɓa nikohee naandsuk na sikɗuk in as.)<verse eid="ACT 17:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 17:22"/>Wa Pool tufuk ŋ fiki ɓooɓa cohee ŋ Aryopaasa, a woosa ne : « Ɗu ɓi gen Ateen, ŋ hotiɗ ne nik kos ɗah, ɗu ndengɗukootiɗ nga. <verse eid="ACT 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 17:23"/>Laam wi maa tiindsuke, ŋ markeeɗa in ci ɗu na ñaamkohe, raakiɗ seeƴkohaani ŋ hot nga sah, wa fiisu inii : “ Wuu koohi inhassaaɗiini. ” Ini ɗu na ñaamke te ɗu inahɗaa, ineem weɗ ŋ hay ne ŋ inhiɗ ɗu wa.<verse eid="ACT 17:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 17:24"/>Kooh yi fer adinaani na in ci nik ŋ ɗooƴi jen, te a yi Heɗ Eel ci na kehƴi, a genɗi ŋ ɗisik ci na kiimohse ci yaah ɓo' haɓiɗ. <verse eid="ACT 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 17:25"/>A namɗi etoh ne yaah ɓo' taambkohee ɗe po haa a etoh etoh in, a yi kay na one ɓo' ci jen kipes na iik na in ci jen. <verse eid="ACT 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 17:26"/>A taamboh ŋ ɓo' yino, a ferra cuuɓ nu nik, ne ca gen kehƴi jen ; waa nu nga na jamanooniŋ wa na kikiƴ ciŋ wa.<verse eid="ACT 17:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 17:27"/>Kooh tumiɗ ineem ne ɓooɓi min ɗe waak, ɓa saaɓɗee po ɓa hend nga ɗe. Moona a usɗi ali ɓo' nga ɓoo. <verse eid="ACT 17:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 17:28"/>Laam a yi tah ɓoo pese, kaɗee haye, nikka ; findi yino ngaŋ jangtukoh ciŋ ɗu woyoha an : “ Ɓoo nam nik set ciŋ ɗe. ” <verse eid="ACT 17:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 17:29"/>Kon nik ne ɓoo set ciŋ Kooh ɗah, mbaa ɓoo joyɗi amb ne Kooh mand na in pesuuɗ moɗiɗ, findi nataal urus, haalis wala atoh ci ɓo' haɓiɗ ŋ liiɓoha ɓo'.<verse eid="ACT 17:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 17:30"/>Kooh marakɗi ŋ in ca haɓɗassee ɗeɓgaan jen, wa ɓooɓa inahɗi, kotii a yii ɓeeɗuk ɓooɓi jen, ŋ ɗisik nu ɓa min nik ɗah, ne ɓa ɓoƴsoh pesohaaɗ. <verse eid="ACT 17:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 17:31"/>A gapiɗ mbehi a atte'ohan adinaani jen atte yurhiɗ, te a kooɗiɗ ɓo' wuu ineem. Ŋ hultiɗi a hultiɗ ɓoyeem, a teeɓiɗ ɓooɓi jen wooriɗ ne a yi atte'ohi a kooɗ. »<verse eid="ACT 17:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 17:32"/>Wa ɓa kerah Pool woyeeɗa ŋ hultiŋ kaaniɗ ci, ɓum njembteeɗa ɗe, ɓinooɓi woosa ɗe ne : « Ɓoo hey ɗa sikɗukisse ŋ ineem mbeh wiiriis. » <verse eid="ACT 17:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 17:33"/>Ŋ ineem Pool pulla, cootta. <verse eid="ACT 17:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 17:34"/>Raakka ɓooɓi kos, ɓa taambiɗta ɗe ; Denis ya ɓaahee ŋ ɓooɓaŋ Aryopaasa ɓaah nga, na ɓitiɓ teeku Damaris, na ɓi ɓo' wiiriis.<verse eid="ACT 17:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="ACT 18"/>
  <para style="s">Pool kaɗiɗ Korenta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 18:1"/>Wa inaam coot, Pool pulla Ateen, a kaɗta Korenta. <verse eid="ACT 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 18:2"/>A cohha na Yawuut nga na woyse Akilaas rimohu kur kaŋ Pontos. Raak yeem han ree, puloh Itaali na ɓitiice Pirisil. Waam raak Kolod, buura yakka ŋ <char style="w">Rom</char> nakoheen ne, Yawuut ca jen pulaat Rom.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 18:2">Pool kaɗta ɗiskaŋ ɓi Akilaas, <verse eid="ACT 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 18:3"/>sagu ina ɓa ɓaahee panguk, ɓa nikee haɓɗoh ɗiip baas ; a gennda na ɓa, ɓa hunnda, ɓa pangkeeɗa. <verse eid="ACT 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 18:4"/><char style="w">Mbehi na iɗsiɗkohse</char> nu ree ɗah, Pool kooɗ woo ŋ <char style="w" lemma="sinaagog"><char style="tl">sinaagoga</char></char> ne a woo na Yawuut ca na ɓi nikɗi Yawuut, ne ɓa min kos.<verse eid="ACT 18:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 18:5"/>Mbeh, Silaas na Timoote pulohha Maseduwaan ɓa hayya raake Pool ŋ Korenta. Ina kooɗoh waam, Pool faɗta pangka, a toppa ŋ yegɗohiŋ Woo ki kotii ; a teeɓeeɗa Yawuut ca ne a Yeesu a yi <char style="w">Mucɗohi Gapohse</char>.<verse eid="ACT 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 18:6"/>Waaye Yawuut ca hiñoheeɗa ɗe, ɓa ɓaseeɗa ɗe. Wa raakka mbeh, a irippa kulɓaacaŋ ɗe, a woosa ɓa ne : « Ɗu sooƴ ɗah, e ɗu ɓeka haf ɗu ! Mi nak, ŋ hooliɗ nga. Ini kooɗoh woti mi yii kaɗ ŋ ɓi nikɗi Yawuut. »<verse eid="ACT 18:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 18:7"/>A pulla ndaam, a kaɗta kahan ƴaar teeku Ticiyus Yustus, ƴaareem nikee ñaamkoh Kooh te kahan ce nikee ŋ sero <char style="tl">sinaagoga</char>. <verse eid="ACT 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 18:8"/>Ƴaara adgohee <char style="tl">sinaagoga</char> teeksee Kirispus, a yi na ɓi kahan ce jen, kossa Heɗi, laayiɗ ŋ ɓi Korenta ɓi sikɗukee Pool nameeɗa kos, ɓa ɓoktasseeɗa.<verse eid="ACT 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 18:9"/>Wa raakka wek, Heɗi teeɓukka Pool findi heeƴ, a woosa ɗe ne : « Kana neƴƴoh, kana ɗek, woya, <verse eid="ACT 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 18:10"/>laam mi yii na ɗa. Ali ɓo' deganɗi ɗa yaah, ali ɓo' tumanɗi ɗa miskiɗ, laam ɓooɓiŋ ngo laayiɗ ŋ kur kii, ɓi joy kerah woo kiŋ ɗa ne ɓa kos. » <verse eid="ACT 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 18:11"/>Ŋ ineem, Pool nikka ŋ Korenta kiis na camban, a jangɗeeɗa ɓooɓa woo kiŋ Kooh.<verse eid="ACT 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pool ŋ fiki Galiyoŋ, goornoora</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 18:12"/>Ŋ jamanoonaam, Galiyoŋ tumuusa goornooraŋ Rom ngaŋ Akaay, jaarra Yawuut ca hunnda, ɓa hiñoheeɗa Pool, ɓa ɓayya ɗe ŋ atte'ohaana, <verse eid="ACT 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 18:13"/>ɓa woosa ne : « Ƴaarii na ɓeke ɓooɓi ŋ ñaamuk Kooh ñaamuk ɗalohiɗ na wi waasi nakoh. »<verse eid="ACT 18:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 18:14"/>Pool heeɗa woye, hennda Galiyoŋ woosa Yawuut ca ne : « Sikɗukaat to ɗu ɓi Yawuut ci, nikee ne a tum njaahum wala ro' yakak ɗah, ŋ heen ɗu ɓoofɗe ŋ sikɗuk ɗu ; <verse eid="ACT 18:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 18:15"/>waaye wii, wa taastiɗoh ŋ woo na tiik ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ waasiŋ ɗu. Weem wa wuu ɗu, ŋ waaɗɗi nik atte'oh ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ in ceem. » <verse eid="ACT 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 18:16"/>Ŋ ineem, a aannja ɓa ŋ atte'ohaana.<verse eid="ACT 18:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 18:17"/>Weɗ ɓa hunoh jen, ɓa ammba Sosten ya adgohee <char style="tl">sinaagoga</char>, ɓa laɓeeɗa ɗe ŋ fiki atte'ohaana, waaye Galiyoŋ faaleeɗi ɓa.<verse eid="ACT 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pool dokkiɗ Añcos</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 18:18"/>Pool tassa ŋ Korenta in samiɗ maañ, ƴutta a askohha na kosiɗ ca, a aassa ŋ <char style="tl">batoona</char> na kaɗe Siri, a hunnda na Pirisil na Akilaas. Waaye bala a aasan <char style="tl">batoona</char> ɗah, a nenukka<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 6:9-12">Kind ci 6:9-12</ref></char></note> ŋ Señsare, laam a tumeen ina a giñee po ƴutta<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ŋ Yawuut ci, ɓo' giñeen tum in nga ɓa ɗah, a meeɗɗi nenuk feeh a tumɗi ini a giñ ɗah.</char></note>.<verse eid="ACT 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 18:19"/>Wa ɓa kaɗ po ɓa reesa Efes, a saɓsukohha na ɓa ndaam ; a yi ŋ haf ce, a kaɗta ŋ <char style="tl">sinaagoga</char>, a ɓeesɗoheeɗa na Yawuut ca, <verse eid="ACT 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 18:20"/>ɓeem kiimeeɗa ɗe ne a ɓaat nik nga ƴissuut, waaye a teyɗukɗi. <verse eid="ACT 18:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 18:21"/>A askohha na ɓa, a woosa ɓa ne : « Ŋ hey ɗu hayisse marke, ne wa neɓ Kooh ɗah. » A aassa <char style="tl">bato</char>, a kurkohha Efes, a taalndiɗta ɓaaɓaŋ ɗe.<verse eid="ACT 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 18:22"/>Wa ɓa ree Seesare, Pool ruhussa, a kaɗta Yerusalem ne a kañɗa ɓi Janguuna, ƴutta a nammba kaɗ Añcos. <verse eid="ACT 18:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 18:23"/>A nikka nga in samiɗ maañ, ƴutta a kaɗeeɗa kur na kur ŋ ɓakaŋ Galaat na Firisi, a ndengɗeeɗa taalubeeca jen ŋ kosi ɓa kos.<figure style="fig" alt="Paul's third missionary journey" file="WD_Paul3-3D-BW-Saafi.jpg" size="span" loc="Somewhere in 18:23–21:17, preferably so that when you see the map, you can already see or have already seen 18:23" ref="18:23–21:17"/><verse eid="ACT 18:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Apolos ŋ Efes na Akaay</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 18:24"/>Raakeen Yawuut na woyse Apolos a genee Aleksandiri, a hayya Efes. A nikee ɓo' miniɗ woo, te a inheen Fiis ci baahiɗ. <verse eid="ACT 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 18:25"/>A jangɗasseen waasiŋ Heɗi te a sawareen lool. A woyeeɗa, a jangɗoheeɗa hooliɗ ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ Yeesu. Waaye a inhee ɓoktiŋ <char style="w">Yahya</char> dong. <verse eid="ACT 18:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 18:26"/>A cammba woo na ooluk ŋ <char style="tl">sinaagoga</char>.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 18:26">Wa Pirisil na Akilaas sikɗuk jangɗohiŋ ɗe, ɓa hotta ɗe ŋ pet, ɓa ɓaatta ɗe pooksohiɗ hooliɗ waasiŋ Kooh. <verse eid="ACT 18:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 18:27"/>Ƴutta, a waaɗta kaɗ Akaay, ɓaah caŋ ɓoo kosiɗ ca ñaahha ɗe nga. Ɓa fiissa kayit wuu taalubeeca nikee ŋ Akaay ne ɓa taambkoh ɗe baahiɗ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 18:27">Wa a ree, Kooh baahohha ɗe po a raakiɗta kosiɗ ca njiriñ keeh-keeh. <verse eid="ACT 18:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 18:28"/>Laam a ɓuree Yawuut ca ɓur keeh-keeh ŋ fiki ɓooɓa jen, te a taambohee ŋ Fiis ci, a teeɓoheeɗa ne Yeesu a yi Mucɗohi Gapohse.<verse eid="ACT 18:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="ACT 19"/>
  <para style="s">Pool kaɗiɗ Efes</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 19:1"/>Wa Apolos nik ŋ Korenta, raak Pool ŋ ɓaaɓaŋ ɗe ŋ kur caŋ tangooca, ƴutta a kaɗta Efes, a raakka ɓi taalube nga, <verse eid="ACT 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 19:2"/>a meekissa ɓa ne : « Wi ɗu kos, ɗu rahsiɗ <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani</char> e ? » Ɓa woosa ɗe ne : « Ɓoo moosɗi kerhoh ne Fuuɗis Hoolohngaan raakiɗ. » <verse eid="ACT 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 19:3"/>Pool woosa ɓa ne : « Ɗu ɓoktu winde ɓokit ? » Ɓa loffa ɗe ne : « Ɓoktiŋ <char style="w">Yahya</char>. » <verse eid="ACT 19:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 19:4"/>A woosa ɓa ne : « Yahya ɓoktee ɓi waaɗee ɓoƴsoh pesohaaɗ. A woyeeɗa ɓooɓa ne ɓa kosaat yi na haye ŋ finhooce, Yeesu ! »<verse eid="ACT 19:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 19:5"/>Wa ɓa kerah ineem, ɓa ɓoktuusa ŋ tiikiŋ Yeesu Heɗi. <verse eid="ACT 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 19:6"/>Pool degga ɓa yaah ciŋ ɗe, Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani ruhussa nga ɓa, ɓa cammba jomb ŋ ɓi peɗeem wiiriis, ɓa woyeeɗa woo-woosuuɗ. <verse eid="ACT 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 19:7"/>Ini ree ƴaar ndaŋkiyaah na kanak (12) nikee nga.<verse eid="ACT 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 19:8"/>Ŋ finho ineem, Pool kaɗta <char style="w" lemma="sinaagog"><char style="tl">sinaagoga</char></char>, a woyeeɗa na ɓa na ooluk ini ree caɓin kaahay. A woyeeɗa na ɓa ŋ Nguuriŋ-Kooh, a ndengɗukeeɗa nga, ne ɓi a woyee na ɓa min kos. <verse eid="ACT 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 19:9"/>Waaye laayiɗ nga ɓa ndennga haf, ɓa sannga kos, ɓa woyeeɗa woo moɗaaɗi ŋ waasiŋ Heɗi ŋ fiki ɓooɓa cohee ŋ ɗiska.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 19:9">Ineem tahha po a saɓsukohha na ɓa, a hunnda na taalubeeca, a taalndiɗta a woyeeɗa na ɓa Kooh-nu-wiis ŋ jangohaaraŋ ƴaara woysee Tirannus. <verse eid="ACT 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 19:10"/>Ineem kaɗeeɗa po wa tummba kiis kanak, ɓooɓa genee Asi jen, Yawuut na nikaaɗi Yawuut, kerahha woo kiŋ Heɗi.<verse eid="ACT 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kuɓuuciŋ Sewaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 19:11"/>Waam, Kooh tumeeɗa ɓi keemaan feyohiɗ taamboh ŋ Pool. <verse eid="ACT 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 19:12"/>Kaɗta po ɓooɓa meeɗta ɓay seeket ca wala kulɓaaca laalee faaniŋ ɗe, ɓa degeeɗa ca kosaayiɗ ca, ɓeem wireeɗa, <char style="w" lemma="jiini">jiiniica</char> puleeɗa nga ɓa.<verse eid="ACT 19:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 19:13"/>Wa raakeen Yawuut ca meeɗ wil, aañeeɗa jiiniici, ɓa jeemeeɗa aañoh jiiniica ambee ɓooɓa tiikiŋ Yeesu Heɗi an : « Ŋ tiikiŋ Yeesu yi Pool na yegɗohe, mi yii woo ɗu ne pulaat ! » <verse eid="ACT 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 19:14"/>Ɓooɓa tumee ineem nikee kuɓuuci ƴaar ci yasna-kanak ciŋ ƴaara woysee Sewaa, a ɓaahee ŋ <char style="w">seeƴkiɗoh</char> ca yakak caŋ Yawuut ca.<verse eid="ACT 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 19:15"/>Waaye jiinnda loffa ɓa ne : « Ŋ inhiɗ Yeesu te ŋ inhiɗ ya ɓa a yi Pool, waaye ɗu, e ɗu ɓa ? » <verse eid="ACT 19:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 19:16"/>Ŋ ineem ƴaara jiinndeem ambee faɗsukka ɓa, a uupiɗta ɓa hatil, a tumeeɗa ɓa miskiɗ po ɓa jen ɓa pulla kahna na mbup, tas ɓarang, gaañsukohiɗ. <verse eid="ACT 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 19:17"/>Ɓooɓa genee Efes, Yawuut na nikaaɗi Yawuut kerahhaa ; ɓa jen ɓa tiitta, ɓa eɗta tiikiŋ Yeesu Heɗi cir.<verse eid="ACT 19:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 19:18"/>Laayiɗ ŋ ɓa hanee kos hayya, ɓa woyeeɗa bakaaɗ ciŋ ɓa, ɓa teeɓoheeɗa ŋ fiki ɓooɓa in ca moɗaaɗiica ɓa meeɗ tum. <verse eid="ACT 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 19:19"/>Laayiɗ ŋ ɓa meeɗ luhus hayeeɗa na kayit ca ɓa meeɗ jangoh luhus, ɓa doheeɗa ca ŋ fiki ɓooɓa jen. Candoomaŋ kayit ca kinduusa, wa nikka <char style="tl">darakma</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:19 </char><char style="fq" closed="false"><char style="tl">darakma</char> </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: hanjar ŋ <char style="w">Gerek</char> ci, wa hendeen na ini ɓoyi na pangke bumit wirndassee ŋ noh yino. Wa meeɗeen tumu findi libidoor.</char></note> junni-ndaŋkiyaah-yatuus (50.000) ŋ koporaŋ ɓa.<verse eid="ACT 19:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 19:20"/>Wa taambohha ɗaa, ŋ hatiliŋ Heɗi, woo kiŋ Kooh uupeeɗa nga uup kerhuk te hatiliŋ wa uupeeɗa nga uup hotuk.<verse eid="ACT 19:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ɗuuɗa raakee ŋ Efes</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 19:21"/>Wa in ceem coot, Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani hiirra Pool ŋ kaɗ Yerusalem, a waaɗee taamboh ŋ Maseduwaan na Akaay. A woosa ne : « Ŋ ree nga ɗah, ŋ joyiɗ nam kaɗ <char style="w">Rom</char>. » <verse eid="ACT 19:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 19:22"/>A kooɗta huntoh kanak ŋ huntoh caŋ ɗe, Timoote na Erasta, a tuuƴca ɓa Maseduwaan, waaye a yi ŋ haf ce a tasohaahha ŋ Asi.<verse eid="ACT 19:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 19:23"/>Wa Pool nik ŋ Asi sekeeɗa, ɗuuɗ yakak raakka ŋ Efes, sagu waasiŋ Heɗi. <verse eid="ACT 19:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 19:24"/>Raakeen tiɓoh-tokkaah nga na woyse Demetiriyus, a meeɗ tiɓ nataal ƴin. Nataal ceem nikee nataalaŋ kahan koohaŋ ɓa ɓitɓa teeku Artemis, ca nikee haalis. Pangkeem tahha po a yi na tiɓoh caŋ ɗe raakeeɗa wirind baahiɗ.<verse eid="ACT 19:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 19:25"/>A cohɗohha ɓa na ɓinooɓa pesohee pangkeem jen, a woosa ɓa ne : « Ƴaaɓiŋ ngo, ɗu inhiɗ ne raak-raakiŋ ɓoo gaƴuk ŋ pangkii. <verse eid="ACT 19:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 19:26"/>Te ɗu hotiɗ, ɗu kerhiɗ, ŋ wooɗi Efes dong waaye ini uup ŋ Asi jen, Pool yeem ɓoƴsohiɗ ɓo' laayiɗ, a kosɗukohha ɓa ne kooh ci haɓɗohu yaah ɓo', ca kooh haa. <verse eid="ACT 19:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 19:27"/>Ŋ wooɗi yahi wa na hee yahe tiikiŋ pangkiŋ ɓoo, waaye wa hey name yah ciri kahniŋ Artemis eɗu, wa yah yaki Artemis yak, Artemis, koohi ɓitɓi yakki, yi ɓi Asi na adinaani jen na ñaamke ! »<verse eid="ACT 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 19:28"/>Wa ɓooɓa kerah ineem, ɓa ayrukka, ɓa leehkeeɗa an : « Artemis yiŋ ɓi Efes yakiɗ ! » <verse eid="ACT 19:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 19:29"/>Jaarra kur-taaha jen yoonnda, ɓooɓa jen faɗsukka ɗiska na tiyaatarohse, ɓa ammba Gayus na Aristarka, ƴaaɓaŋ Maseduwaan ca kanak ca ɓendee Pool, ɓa ɓayndohha ɓa. <verse eid="ACT 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 19:30"/>Pool waaɗta kaɗ ŋ fiki ɓooɓa cohee ŋ ɗiska waaye taalubeeca sangohha ɗe wa. <verse eid="ACT 19:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 19:31"/>A raakeen ɓi nawle kilifa yakak, ɓaah ŋ ɓa adgohee Asi, ɓeem nammba woosoh nga ɗe ne a kanaat kaɗ ŋ ɗiska na tiyaatarohse.<verse eid="ACT 19:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 19:32"/>Waam raak ɗuuɗa laayiɗ ŋ ɗiska : Ɓii leehkeeɗa an, ɓum leehkeeɗa an ! Ɓi uup laay nga ɓa inheeɗi sah ina tah ɓa kaɗ ndaam. <verse eid="ACT 19:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 19:33"/>Ɓi ɓo' ŋ mboolnda woosa ƴaar teeku Aleksaandar ini raak, Yawuut ca adgiɗta ɗe ŋ fikiira ne a woo. A meeɓpa yaah ne a woo na mboolnda. <verse eid="ACT 19:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 19:34"/>Waaye wa ɓa inah ne a Yawuut, ɓa jen ɓa hunnda ɓa leehkeeɗa ini ree wahtu kanak an : « Artemis yiŋ ɓi Efes yakiɗ ! »<verse eid="ACT 19:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 19:35"/>Ŋ mirndaani, ƴaara adgohee coh caŋ kur-taaha tummba po ɓa yeeɓukka, a woosa ɓa ne : « Ɗu ɓi Efes, a ya ɓa inahɗi ne, a Efes na niiɗe kahniŋ Artemis, koohi yakki, na nataaliŋ ɗe keenoh Eel ci ? <verse eid="ACT 19:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 19:36"/>Ali ɓo' minɗi taas ineem, weɗ tah ɗu joyiɗ yeeɓuk, ɗu marak baahiɗ bala ɗu tuman in ɗah.<verse eid="ACT 19:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 19:37"/>Weɗɗi, ɗu ɓayiɗ ƴaaɓii ndii te ɓa ɓasɗi koohiŋ ɓoo, ɓa tumɗi ali in araamiɗ ŋ kahniŋ ɗe. <verse eid="ACT 19:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 19:38"/>Kon Demetiriyus na pangkoh ci hun na ɗe leer na ɓo' ɗah, ɓa ɓayaat ɗe waas, raakiɗ mbeh ci na atte'ohse na ɓooɓi na atte'e ! <verse eid="ACT 19:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 19:39"/>Te nik ne ɗu na meeksohe in wiiriis ɗah, wa hey markasse ŋ mbehi ɓoo ɓeeɗkohissan coh lakiɗ waas.<verse eid="ACT 19:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 19:40"/>Ini raak ndii woti, miniɗ tah po ɓoo yambu ne ɓoo na yoonde, laam ali ɓo' minɗi woo ini tah ɗuuɗii. » Wa a ƴut woo, a woosa mboolnda ne ɓa pasarkohaat.<verse eid="ACT 19:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="ACT 20"/>
  <para style="s">Pool kaɗiɗ Maseduwaan na Geres na Torowaas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 20:1"/>Wa ɗuuɗa seem, Pool cohɗohha taalubeeca, a ñaahha ɓa, ƴutta a askohha na ɓa, a kaɗta Maseduwaan. <verse eid="ACT 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 20:2"/>Wa a ree, a wileeɗaa, a woyeeɗa na kosiɗ ca woo laayiɗ, a ñaaheeɗa ɓa, po findi a reyoh Geres. <verse eid="ACT 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 20:3"/>A nikka nga caɓin kaahay. Wa a kaɗ po a heeɗa aase <char style="tl">bato</char> ne a kaɗ Siri, a kerahha ne Yawuut ca ɓa ɗaa hotoh ŋ ɗooƴ ɓa ne ɓa ap ɗe, a hotta ne a joy wiiruk Maseduwaan, a lahoh nga.<verse eid="ACT 20:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 20:4"/>Ɓi hunee na ɗe nikee Sopateer kuɓkiŋ Pirrus ya genee Beree, na Aristarka na Sekundus ɓa genee Tessalonik, na Gayus ya genee Derbe, na Timoote, na Tisikos na Torofiim ɓa genee Asi. <verse eid="ACT 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 20:5"/>Ɓeɗ ɓii, ɓeɗ adgee ɓoo Torowaas, ɓa sekeeɗa ɓoo nga.<verse eid="ACT 20:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 20:6"/>Ɓoo nak, wi feetiŋ Mbuuruuci raakaaɗi lawiir ci reeh, ɓoo aasohha <char style="tl">bato</char> ŋ Filippi, ɓoo tummba neeh yatuus ŋ waas. Ɓoo raakka ɓa ŋ Torowaas, ɓoo nikka nga neeh yasna-kanak.<verse eid="ACT 20:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pool hultiɗiɗ Etikus ŋ Torowaas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 20:7"/>Ŋ <char style="w">mbehi na iɗsiɗkohse</char> na niina, ɓoo cohha ne ɓoo hun ñam mbuurndi, Pool woyeeɗa na ɓooɓa nikee ŋ ɗiska. A joyee coot ŋ Kooh-wiisiina, tahha po a taalndiɗta a woyeeɗa po ŋ ndengelnde weka.<verse eid="ACT 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 20:8"/>Ɓoo cohee ŋ tuuƴ ŋ ɗafkaŋ kahna, laampa laayiɗ fuuɗseen nga. <verse eid="ACT 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 20:9"/>Komaaki ƴaar teeku Etikus nikee ɓoofiɗ ŋ palaŋteera, a pani'uusa keeh-keeh, raak Pool taalndiɗiɗ woyeeɗa in maañiɗ. Wi a neeh neeh nooɗiɗ, a eltukohha ndaam, ŋ tuuƴa kaahayɗoh ŋ ɗafkaŋ kahna, a keennda. A meeɓseeɗa, waaye raak ɗe kaaniɗ. <verse eid="ACT 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 20:10"/>Weɗ Pool ruhsoh, a raɗukka nga ɗe, a morgiɗukka ɗe, a woosa ne : « Kinaat jaahiɗ ! A yi pes ! »<verse eid="ACT 20:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 20:11"/>Ƴutta, Pool rapissa ŋ ɗafka, a poɓtohha mbuurnda, ɓa ñammba. Ŋ finho ineem, a taalndiɗta a woyeeɗa in maañiɗ po findi nohi puloh, a cootta.<verse eid="ACT 20:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 20:12"/>Ini kaɗ ŋ kuɓka ƴaara, a ɓayu kahan ɓa peseeɗa moɗoɗ, ɓooɓa jen giiffa keeh-keeh.<verse eid="ACT 20:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pool pulohiɗ Torowaas, a kaɗta Mileet</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 20:13"/>Ɓoo nak, e ɓoo adug coot ne ɓoo aas <char style="tl">bato</char> kaɗ Assos, ɗiska ɓoo cohan na Pool, ɓoo ɓay ɗe. A woyee ne a heyɗi taambe ŋ cookmi, a na hee taambe ŋ kehƴi po nga. <verse eid="ACT 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 20:14"/>Wa a raak ɓoo ŋ Assos, ɓoo hunnda na ɗe ŋ <char style="tl">bato</char>, ɓoo taalndiɗta Mitileen. <verse eid="ACT 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 20:15"/>Ɓoo kurkohissa ndaam, ɓoo taalndiɗta ŋ cookmi, ŋ Kooh-wiisiina ɓoo teemmba ŋ Kiwo. Kooh wiisissa, ɓoo reesa Samos, wa taambis nga, ɓoo hannda ree Mileet.<verse eid="ACT 20:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 20:16"/>Pool woyee ne a sereendkan sereenduk Efes, a tufkanɗi nga po a kee maaña ŋ Asi. A seeskee seesuk ne <char style="w"><char style="tl">Paantakot</char></char> min ɗe raak ŋ Yerusalem.<verse eid="ACT 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pool askiɗ yakak caŋ Janguunaŋ Efes</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 20:17"/>Wa ɓoo ree Mileet, Pool woosohha ɓa adgohee Janguunaŋ Efes. <verse eid="ACT 20:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 20:18"/>Wi ɓa hay, a woosa ɓa ne : « Ɗu inhiɗ findi ŋ nikohee na ɗu ŋ jamanooni ŋ nik na ɗu jen, ina kooɗoh mbehi ŋ kocoh ɓek kot ciŋ ngo ŋ Asi. <verse eid="ACT 20:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 20:19"/>Ŋ pangkiɗiɗ Heɗi, ŋ ƴissuutiɗta haf fo keeh-keeh, wa hunnda na ɓi muhun, ŋ raakiɗ miskiɗ sagu Yawuut ci hotohee ŋ ɗooƴ ɓa ne ɓa tum mbo in.<verse eid="ACT 20:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 20:20"/>Ɗu inhiɗ ne ŋ moosɗi ɗu ɗasɗoh ali in, ŋ in ci min ɗu njiriñ. Ŋ yegɗiɗ ɗu woo kiŋ Kooh, ŋ jangiɗta ɗu ŋ fiki ɓooɓi jen na ŋ ɗooƴ kahan ci. <verse eid="ACT 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 20:21"/>Ŋ moosɗi faɗoh woytoh Yawuut ci na ɓi nikɗi Yawuut ne ɓa ɓoƴsohaat tumohaaɗ, ɓa hay ŋ Kooh te ɓa kos Heɗ ɓoo Yeesu.<verse eid="ACT 20:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 20:22"/>Ɗiski wa nik, mi yii kaɗ Yerusalem, e <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani</char> hiir ro nga ; ŋ inahɗi ini rahsan ndo ŋ ndaam. <verse eid="ACT 20:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 20:23"/>Waaye ŋ inhiɗ daal ne ŋ kur-taah nu ŋ aasoh ɗah, Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani woo so ne kaso na ɓi miskiɗ laayiɗ ca ɗaa sek ko nga. <verse eid="ACT 20:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 20:24"/>Mi nak, kipes kiŋ ngo ɓitɗi so ; nga so, wa raakɗi njiriñ. Ini nikiɗ to weɗ ne ŋ waaɗ kaɗ po ŋ reehɗohaana, ŋ mitiɗ pangki Yeesu Heɗi dengkoh ho, weɗ ne ŋ woo <char style="w">Yegɗohiŋ Muci</char> na teeɓohe baahohiŋ Kooh.<verse eid="ACT 20:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 20:25"/>Ɗiski wa nik, ŋ inhiɗ ne ɗu hotissanɗi so, ɗu jen, ɗu ɓi inah ne ŋ lahiɗ nga ɗu, ŋ woyeeɗa ɗu Nguuriŋ-Kooh. <verse eid="ACT 20:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 20:26"/>Weɗ tah mi yii woo ɗu wa woti : Ŋ hooliɗ nga, ɓo' nu muuƴ nga ɗu ɗah, a ñam haa. <verse eid="ACT 20:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 20:27"/>Laam ŋ woyiɗ ɗu ini Kooh kooɗuk tum, ŋ ɗasɗohɗi ɗu ali in nga.<verse eid="ACT 20:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 20:28"/>Tufkaat ŋ haf ɗu, ɗu tufuk gati Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani dengkoh ɗu, ne ɗu niiɗa. Findi niiɗoh, taambkohaat Janguuniŋ Kooh, Janguuni a raakoot taamboh ŋ ñif miŋ <char style="w" lemma="Kuɓkiŋ Kooh">Kuɓkiŋ ɗe</char>.<verse eid="ACT 20:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 20:29"/>Ŋ inhiɗ ne ŋ eɗee ɗu finho ɗah, ɓi ɓo' haa ngumu saahiɗ hey aase ŋ ɗooƴ ɗu te ɓa faɗanɗi gati. <verse eid="ACT 20:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 20:30"/>Te ŋ ɗooƴ ɗu ɓi ɓo' hey name kuruk, ɓa woyee woo raakaaɗi ne ɓa ñaakiɗ taalubeeci ŋ finhooɓa. <verse eid="ACT 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 20:31"/>Kon wortukaat te kinaat alkoh ne kiis kaahay, wek na noh, ŋ meeɗ ɗu meeɗ deng, na muhun sah, yaa nu nga ɗah.<verse eid="ACT 20:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 20:32"/>Ɗiski wa nik, mi yii wik ɗu ŋ yaah Kooh, mi yii wik ɗu ŋ woo kiŋ ɗe na teeɓohe baahohiŋ ɗe, wi min ɗu ɓaatɗoh po ɗu ndeng, te ɗu min lam in ci a ɗaakiɗ hoolɗuuɗ ciŋ ɗe jen.<verse eid="ACT 20:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 20:33"/>Ŋ moosɗi waaɗɗoh haf fo ali haalis wala urus wala kulɓa ɓo' nga ɗu. <verse eid="ACT 20:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 20:34"/>Ɗu inhiɗ in nga sah, e yaah ciŋ ngo cii ceɗ eɗ to ini ŋ etohe, mi, na huntoh ciŋ ngo. <verse eid="ACT 20:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 20:35"/>Ŋ teeɓiɗ ɗu ŋ in ci jen ne ɓo' joy pangkoh ɗaa ne a min ɓaatɗoh ɓi raakɗi hatil. Ɓoo naandsukaat woo kiŋ Yeesu Heɗi a yi ŋ haf ce wi a woo ne : “ Neɓiɗi nik ŋ onoh weɗ uup wi nik ŋ onu. ” »<verse eid="ACT 20:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 20:36"/>Wi Pool ƴut woo ineem, a ƴekka, a hunnda na ɓa jen ne ɓa kiim Kooh. <verse eid="ACT 20:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 20:37"/>Ŋ ineem, ɓa jen, ɓa fuɗeeɗa keeh-keeh, ɓa morgiɗukka ɗe ne ɓa foon ɗe. <verse eid="ACT 20:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 20:38"/>Ini uupee reehiɗ keeñ ciŋ ɓa, weɗ ini a woo ne ɓa hotissanɗi ɗe. Ƴutta ɓa ɓennda ɗe po ŋ <char style="tl">batoona</char>.<verse eid="ACT 20:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="ACT 21"/>
  <para style="s">Pool pulohiɗ Mileet kaɗta Tiir na Seesare</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 21:1"/>Wi ɓoo saɓsukoh na ɓi ɓendee ɓoo, ɓoo aassa <char style="tl">bato</char>, ɓoo yurahha Kos. Wa Kooh wiis, ɓoo taalndiɗta Rodes, kooɗohha ndeem, ɓoo kaɗta Patara. <verse eid="ACT 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 21:2"/>Ɓoo raakka <char style="tl">bato</char> ndaam na kee Feniis, ɓoo aassa nga, ɓoo cootta. <verse eid="ACT 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 21:3"/>Wa ɓoo kaɗ po ɓoo ƴokeeɗa Siipar, ɓoo faɗtaa ŋ yaah-sing, ɓoo taalndiɗta ŋ ɓak Siri ne ɓoo ruhus ŋ Tiir ŋ ɗiska <char style="tl">batoona</char> ruhsiɗan in ca wa ɓaye.<verse eid="ACT 21:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 21:4"/>Ŋ ndaam, ɓoo waakeeɗa po ɓoo hotta ɓi taalube nga, ɓoo nikka na ɓa neeh yasna-kanak. <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani</char> hiirra ɓa ne ɓa woyaat Pool ne a kinaat kaɗ Yerusalem. <verse eid="ACT 21:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 21:5"/>Wi neeh ci yasna-kanak ci reeh, ɓoo kurkissa ne taalndiɗ waasiŋ ɓoo. Ɓa ɓennda ɓoo po ɓoo pulla kur-taaha, ɓeɗ jen na ɓitiɓ ciŋ ɓa na kuɓuuciŋ ɓa. Ŋ ndaam, ɓoo ƴekka ŋ yaah-cookma ne ɓoo kiim Kooh. <verse eid="ACT 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 21:6"/>Ƴutta, ɓoo saɓsukohha na ɓa, ɓoo aassa <char style="tl">batoona</char>, ɓa wiirukka.<verse eid="ACT 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 21:7"/>Ɓoo nak, ne ɓoo taalndiɗ ɓaaɓiŋ ɓoo ŋ cookmi, ɓoo puloh Tiir, kaɗta Potolemayis. Ŋ ndaam ɓoo kañiɗta ɓaah caŋ ɓoo kosiɗ ca, ɓoo nikka na ɓa neeh yino. <verse eid="ACT 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 21:8"/>Wa Kooh wiis, ɓoo kurkohha ndaam, kaɗta Seesare, aassa kahan Filip, dalla nga. Filip nikee woyoh <char style="w">Yegɗohiŋ Muci</char>, a ɓaahee ŋ yasna-kanak ca kooɗsee ŋ Yerusalem.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 6:1-6">Tum ci 6:1-6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 21:9"/>A raakeen kuɓu ɓitiɓ nikiis, ɓa nikee cafaƴ. Kooh meeɗ meeɗ woo taamboh nga ɓa.<verse eid="ACT 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 21:10"/>Wi ɓoo raak ɓi neeh nga, woosuuɗ na woyse Agabus puloh Yudee, hayya. <verse eid="ACT 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 21:11"/>A hayya nga ɓoo, a ɓayya seenturiŋ Pool, a tokukka naa, ŋ yaah ci na kot ci, a woosa ne : « Inii weɗ Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani woo : “ Heɗ seenturii, Yawuut ci tokohan ɗe an ŋ Yerusalem, ɓa deg ɗe ŋ yaah ciŋ ɓi nikɗi Yawuut. ” » <verse eid="ACT 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 21:12"/>Wi ɓoo kerah ineem, ɓoo na kosiɗ ciŋ Seesare kiimeeɗa Pool keeh-keeh ne a kaɗuu Yerusalem.<verse eid="ACT 21:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 21:13"/>Waaye Pool loffa ɓoo ne : « Ɗu raak ye fuɗaah, ɗu reehɗee keeñiŋ ngo ? Ŋ wooɗi ɗu toki ŋ toksan ŋ Yerusalem dong, waaye mi, ŋ ƴutiɗ ne ŋ kaan sagu tiikiŋ Yeesu Heɗi. » <verse eid="ACT 21:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 21:14"/>Kaɗta po ɓoo miniɗɗi ɗe in, ɓoo ɗekka, ɓoo woosa ne : « Ini Heɗi waaɗ raakaat. »<verse eid="ACT 21:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 21:15"/>Wa degga ɓi neeh, ɓoo kooɗukka, ɓoo degukka ŋ waas Yerusalem. <verse eid="ACT 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 21:16"/>Ɓi taalube gen Seesare hunnda na ɓoo, ɓa ɓayya ɓoo kahan ƴaar teeku Manaason ɗiska ɓoo dalan. Manaason pulohee Siipar, a maañiɗ nik taalube.<verse eid="ACT 21:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pool ŋ Yerusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 21:17"/>Wa ɓoo ree Yerusalem, ɓaah caŋ ɓoo kosiɗ ca taambukka ɓoo na sum. <verse eid="ACT 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 21:18"/>Wa Kooh wiis, Pool hunnda na ɓoo ɗiskaŋ Saak, yakak ca jen nameen hay. <verse eid="ACT 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 21:19"/>Pool kañiɗta ɓa, a naandsukka ɓa yino yino in ci Kooh tum jen taamboh ŋ pangki a pangkiɗ ɗe ngaŋ ɗooƴ ɓi nikɗi Yawuut.<verse eid="ACT 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 21:20"/>Wa ɓa sikɗuk Pool po ƴutta, ɓa yakiɗta Kooh, ɓa woosa Pool ne : « Ɓaah ɓoo, fu hot nga, ɓi Yawuut junni junni kosiɗ Yeesu te ɓa jen ɓa sawariɗ ŋ <char style="w" lemma="waasiŋ Musaa">waasiŋ</char> <char style="w">Musaa</char>. <verse eid="ACT 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 21:21"/>Waaye ɓa kerhiɗ ne fu na jangɗe Yawuut ci nik ŋ ɗooƴ cuuɓ ci cinooci ne ɓa faɗaat waasiŋ Musaa, ɓa nguɗissuu komaakciŋ ɓa, te ɓa taambɗissuu mbaah ci. <verse eid="ACT 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 21:22"/>Kon ɓo' tuman na ? Wa wooriɗ ne ɓa hey yege ne fu yii ŋ ndii.<verse eid="ACT 21:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 21:23"/>Mbaa, tuma ini ɓoo na hee ɗa woye wii : Ƴaar nikiis ɓii ŋ ndii, ɓa giñɗiɗ Kooh in ; <verse eid="ACT 21:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 21:24"/>ɓayaa ɓa, fu farsuk na ɓa, fu wirndiɗ ɓa in ci ɓa joy tum ŋ farsuk kiŋ ɓa jen, ɓa min nenuk<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:24 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">nenuk </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: marka ini fiisu ŋ saar 18, aaya 18.</char></note>.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 6:9-12">Kind ci 6:9-12</ref></char></note> Ŋ ineem, ɓooɓi jen hey inhe ne ini woyu nga ɗa keeh haa, fu na taambɗe taambiɗ nakoh ciŋ waasiŋ Musaa findiiɓa. <verse eid="ACT 21:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 21:25"/>Te ini kaɗ ŋ kosiɗ ci nikɗi Yawuut, ɓoo fiisiɗ ɓa kayit, woosa ɓa nga ini ɓoo tufkiɗ wii : Ɓa kinaat ñam kañam ci seeƴkohu wuu kooh nikaaɗi, ɓa kinaat an ñif, ɓa kinaat ñam med, ɓa kinaat njaaloo. »<verse eid="ACT 21:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 21:26"/>Wa Kooh wiis, Pool ɓayya ƴaaɓa, a farsukka na ɓa. Ƴutta a aassa <char style="w">Kahan Kooh</char>, a woosa mbehi farsukiŋ ɓa reehan, weɗ ne, mbehi yaa nu nga ɓa <char style="w">seeƴkiɗohsan</char>.<verse eid="ACT 21:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pool ambuuɗ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 21:27"/>Wa mbeh ca yasna-kanak caŋ ɓoktuka hee mite, Yawuut ca pulohee Asi hotta Pool ŋ ɗooƴ Kahan Kooh, ɓa yoppa mboolnda jen, ɓa ammba ɗe. <verse eid="ACT 21:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 21:28"/>Ɓa leehkeeɗa ŋ ɗafka ne : « Hayaatoo, Israayel ci, hayaat ! Ƴaari a yi ! A yi na jangɗohe ŋ ɗisik nu nik in moɗaaɗi ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ cuuɓiŋ ɓoo na waasiŋ Musaa na Kahan Kooh wii. A ɓekiɗ sah ƴaaɓi nikaaɗi Yawuut ŋ ɗooƴ Kahan Kooh, ŋ ineem a soɓe'iɗta <char style="w" lemma="Ɗiski Hooliɗi na Ɗiski Hoolohngaani">Ɗiski Hooliɗii</char>. » <verse eid="ACT 21:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 21:29"/>Ini tahee ɓa woo ineem, ɓa hotee hot Pool ŋ Yerusalem na Torofiim yi puloh Efes, ɓa liiɓpa ne a ɓekiɗ ɗe ŋ Kahan Kooh.<verse eid="ACT 21:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 21:30"/>Kur ka jen yoonnda, ɓooɓa puloheeɗa ɗisik nu ɗisik. Ɓa ammba Pool, ɓa faseeɗa ɗe po ɓa puliɗta ɗe Kahan Kooh, ɓa jaarra rang buntaaca. <verse eid="ACT 21:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 21:31"/>Ɓa waaɗta ɗe ap, weɗ kilifaana adgohee soldaar ca kerhoh ne Yerusalem jen yoondiɗ. <verse eid="ACT 21:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 21:32"/>Ŋ ɗiska ɗiska, a nangɗohha ɓi soldaar, na ɓa adgohee ɓa, a faɗsukka ɓa na mbup. Wa Yawuut ca hot ɗe na soldaar ca hunee na ɗe, ɓa faɗta laɓa ɓa laɓee Pool.<verse eid="ACT 21:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 21:33"/>Jaarra, kilifaana reɓpa ŋ Pool, a nakohha ne a ambsaat, a ceenu na ceen kanak, a hannda meekis ɓooɓa ne : « Ƴaarii a yi ɓa, a tum ye ? » <verse eid="ACT 21:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 21:34"/>Waaye ŋ mboolnda, ɓii woyeeɗa an, ɓum woyeeɗa an. Wa a kaɗ po a hotta ne a minɗi raak in wooriɗ nga sagu ɗuuɗaŋ mboolnda, a nakohha ne Pool ɓayu ŋ kahan soldaar ca.<verse eid="ACT 21:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35-36" style="v" sid="ACT 21:35-36"/>Ɓooɓa jen nikee ñaakɗeeɗa Pool, ɓa leehkeeɗa ne : « A apaah apu ! » Wa ɓa kaɗ po ɓa reesa <char style="tl">eskalyeeca</char>, soldaar ca mirndohha meeɓ Pool sagu diirka mboolnda diirke.<verse eid="ACT 21:35-36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pool kiimiɗ ne a woo na mboolnda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 21:37"/>Wa ɓa hee aase kahna, Pool woosa kilifaanaŋ soldaar ca ne : « Ŋ miniɗ ɗa woo in e, ne wa neɓ ɗa ɗah ? » Kilifaana woosa ne : « Fu kerhiɗ <char style="w">gerek</char> e ? <verse eid="ACT 21:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 21:38"/>Kon a fu ƴaariŋ <char style="w" lemma="Misra">Misraaci</char> ɓekee ɗuuɗi miskiɗi mbaɗni haa e ? Ƴaari ɓayee apoh ɓo' junni-nikiis (4000) a cootta na ɓa bilaf fa ? »<verse eid="ACT 21:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 21:39"/>Pool woosa ɗe ne : « Muk, ŋ Yawuut, ŋ ɓo' Tarsa, kur raakiɗ tiik ŋ Silisi. Ŋ kiim ɗa wa kiim, on ndo ŋ woo na ɓooɓii. » <verse eid="ACT 21:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 21:40"/>Kilifaanaŋ soldaar ca onnda ɗe wa. Pool tufukka ŋ <char style="tl">eskalyeeca</char>, a raɗissa mboolnda yaah, ɓooɓa ɗekka teɗ, a woyeeɗa na ɓa ŋ peɗeem Yawuut.<verse eid="ACT 21:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="ACT 22"/>
  <para style="s">Woo kaŋ Pool ŋ fiki Yawuut ca ŋ Yerusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 22:1"/>« Taambɗoh ciŋ ngo na baab ciŋ ngo, sikɗukaat kotii ini maa hee ɗu woye ŋ yambi ɗu na yambee so. » <verse eid="ACT 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 22:2"/>Wa ɓa kerah ɗe woyeeɗa ŋ peɗmiŋ ɓa, ɓa ɓaatta ɗek. Pool taalndiɗta an : <verse eid="ACT 22:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 22:3"/>« Mi, ŋ Yawuut, ŋ raakohu Tarsa ŋ Silisi, waaye ŋ koɗohu ndii, ŋ Yerusalem, te Gamaliyel a yi jangiɗ to waasiŋ caac ciŋ ɓoo, jangiɗ yurhiɗ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:3">Ŋ sawarra lool ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ Kooh findi ɗu mand nga woti-woti, ɗu jen. <verse eid="ACT 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 22:4"/>Ŋ meeɗta tolfiɗ ɓooɓiŋ waasiŋ Yeesu, po raakiɗ ɓi apu nga sah. Ŋ ambeeɗa ƴaar na ɓitiɓ, ŋ taƴeeɗa ŋ kaso. <verse eid="ACT 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 22:5"/><char style="w" lemma="seeƴkiɗoh">Seeƴkiɗohi</char> yakki na <char style="w">saangniŋ atte'oh ci</char> jen miniɗ to seede ngaŋ ineem. Ɓa fiisɗeen ɓaah ciŋ ɓoo Yawuut ci nikee ŋ Damas kayit sah, ɓa teyɗukiɗta so ne ŋ kaɗ nga, ŋ amba ɓi aas ŋ waasiŋ Yeesu nga, ŋ ɓay ɓa Yerusalem, ɓa mbugalu.<verse eid="ACT 22:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 22:6"/>Wi ŋ kooɗ waasi po ŋ heeɗa ree Damas, ŋ leero noh cong, ɗekka po ñiin pulohha Eel ci, wa willa so, wa siñaarɗeeɗa. <verse eid="ACT 22:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 22:7"/>Ŋ keennda ŋ kehƴi, ŋ kerahha hooso woyeeɗa so ne : “ Sool, Sool, wa ye tah fu tolfiɗee so ? ” <verse eid="ACT 22:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 22:8"/>Ŋ woosa ne : “ A fu ɓa Heɗi ? ” Hoosoori loffa so ne : “ E ñam Yeesu yiŋ Nasareet, yi fu na tolfiɗe. ” <verse eid="ACT 22:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 22:9"/>Ɓooɓi hunee na so hoteen siñaari waaye ɓa kerheeɗi hoosoori woyee na so.<verse eid="ACT 22:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 22:10"/>Ŋ meeksohha an : “ Heɗi, kon ŋ joy ye tum kotii ? ” Heɗi loffa so ne : “ Kurka fu kaɗ Damas, ndaam, fu hey woyse ini fu joy haɓiɗ jen. ” <verse eid="ACT 22:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 22:11"/>Ŋ fuulee fuul sagu siñaara, ɓooɓa hunee na so ammba so ŋ yaah, ɓa nookeeɗa so po ŋ reesa Damas.<verse eid="ACT 22:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 22:12"/>Raakeen ƴaar nga teeku Anañaas, a nikee ɓo' kosiɗ Kooh, yi meeɗ taambiɗ <char style="w" lemma="waasiŋ Musaa">waasiŋ</char> <char style="w">Musaa</char> te Yawuut caŋ Damas jen seede'een ɗe seede moɗiɗ. <verse eid="ACT 22:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 22:13"/>A hayya so raake, a reɓpa nga so, a woosa so ne : “ Sool, ɓaahiŋ ngo, hotissa ! ” Ŋ ɗiska ɗiska ŋ hotisseeɗa, ŋ hotta ɗe.<verse eid="ACT 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 22:14"/>Ŋ ineem, a woosa so ne : “ Koohiŋ caaciŋ ɓoo kooɗiɗ ɗa maañ ne fu inah ini a waaɗ, ne fu hot yi Yurhiɗi te fu kerah hoosooriŋ ɗe. <verse eid="ACT 22:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 22:15"/>Laam fu nikan seedeeniŋ ɗe ŋ fiki ɓooɓi jen, ŋ ini fu hot, fu kerahhaa. <verse eid="ACT 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 22:16"/>Ɗiski wa nik ndii, fu na seke ye ? Kurka, fu ɓoktu te fu kiim ŋ tiikiŋ ɗe ne fu hool ŋ bakaaɗ ciŋ ɗa. ”<verse eid="ACT 22:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 22:17"/>Wa ŋ dokuk Yerusalem, wa raakka mbeh, ŋ kiimeeɗa Kooh ŋ <char style="w">Kahan Kooh</char>, in hayɗohha so haa heeƴ. <verse eid="ACT 22:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 22:18"/>Ŋ hotta Heɗi, a woosa ne : “ Arra pul Yerusalem ! Laam ɓooɓi gen nga teyɗukanɗi seedeeniŋ ɗa ŋ ini kaɗ nga so. ”<verse eid="ACT 22:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 22:19"/>Ŋ woosa ne : “ Heɗi, ɓa inhiɗ baahiɗ ne ŋ meeɗ meeɗ taambiɗ <char style="w"><char style="tl">sinaagog</char></char> ci, ŋ taƴɗukee ɓi kos ɗa, ŋ laɓɗukee ɓa. <verse eid="ACT 22:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 22:20"/>Te wi seedeeniŋ ɗa Ecen na apse, ŋ nikee nga, mi ŋ haf fo. Ŋ huneen na ɓa ngaŋ apa ɓa apee ɗe te ñam ambɗee ɓa sah kulɓaacaŋ ɓa. ” <verse eid="ACT 22:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 22:21"/>Ŋ ineem Heɗi woosa so ne : “ Kaɗa, mi, ŋ hey ɗa tuuƴe usiɗ, ŋ ɓooɓi nikɗi Yawuut ! ” »<verse eid="ACT 22:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pool na kilifaanaŋ soldaar ca</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 22:22"/>Mboolnda nikee sikɗukeeɗa Pool po ŋ woo ciŋ ɗe mirndoh ceem, jaarra ɓa jen, ɓa leehkeeɗa an : « Apa ƴaarii ! Ɓo' mand an yeyyooɗi pes ! » <verse eid="ACT 22:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 22:23"/>Ɓa looƴkeeɗa, ɓa wolla kulɓaacaŋ ɓa, ɓa gusñeeɗa merhey mi ŋ ɗafka.<verse eid="ACT 22:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 22:24"/>Ŋ ndeem, kilifaanaŋ soldaar ca nakohha ne Pool ɓeku ŋ kahnaŋ soldaar ca, a laɓu leraw po a woo, ŋ ineem ɓo' inah ini tah Yawuut ci leehkee ɗe mand an. <verse eid="ACT 22:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 22:25"/>Wa ɓa tok ɗe ne ɓa laɓ ɗe, a woosa ƴaara adgohee ɓa ne : « Andi waas oniɗ ɗu ne ɗu laɓ ɓoyi ɓaah ŋ <char style="w">Rom</char> te raak ɗe atte'uuɗi paaɗ ? » <verse eid="ACT 22:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 22:26"/>Wa soldaara kerah ineem a kaɗtaa woya kilifaana an : « Fu na hee haɓɗe ye an ? Ƴaarii ɓo' Rom ! »<verse eid="ACT 22:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 22:27"/>Kilifaanaŋ soldaar ca hayya ŋ Pool, a meekissa ɗe ne : « Woyaa so, wa keeh ne fu ɓo' Rom e ? » Pool loffa ɗe ne : « Ee. » <verse eid="ACT 22:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 22:28"/>Ŋ ndeem, kilifaanaŋ soldaar ca woosa ɗe ne : « Ŋ wirind kopor keeh-keeh ne nik ɓo' Rom. » Pool loffa ɗe : « Mi nak, ŋ rimu naa. »<verse eid="ACT 22:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 22:29"/>Jaarra, soldaar ca hee ɗe laɓe ne a woo, faɗta ɗe ndeem cootta. Kilifaanaŋ soldaar ca nammba tiit, wa a inah ne a tokɗuk ɓo' Rom.<verse eid="ACT 22:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pool ŋ fiki atte'ohaana yakka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 22:30"/>Kilifaanaŋ soldaar ca waaɗta inah wooriɗ ina Yawuut ca yambee Pool. Weɗ tah wa Kooh wiis, a nakohha ne Pool pulɗu ɗiski a nik, a cohɗohha kilifaacaŋ seeƴkiɗoh caŋ waasiŋ Musaa na ɓooɓa ɓaah ŋ <char style="w" lemma="saangniŋ yakak ciŋ Israayel">saangnaŋ yakak caŋ Israayel</char> jen. A ɓayya Pool, a tufkiɗta ɗe ŋ fikiiɓa.<verse eid="ACT 22:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="ACT 23"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 23:1"/>Pool marakka ɓooɓaŋ saangna, a woosa ne : « Ɓaah ciŋ ngo, ina ŋ camboh po woti, maa pese ŋ fiki Kooh na hel daliɗ. » <verse eid="ACT 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 23:2"/>Weɗ Anañaas, <char style="w" lemma="seeƴkiɗoh">seeƴkiɗoha</char> yakka nakoh ɓa nikee ŋ sero Pool ne ɓa laɓaat ɗe ŋ nguɓ. <verse eid="ACT 23:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 23:3"/>Ŋ ineem, Pool woosa ɗe ne : « A Kooh laɓan ɗa, fu mandiɗ nga haa miir yaanwiɗuuɗ ! Fu nik ndii ne fu attee so findi waasi nakoha, waaye weɗi fu ɗaliɗ waasi, ŋ ini fu nakoh ne ŋ laɓsaat ! » <verse eid="ACT 23:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 23:4"/>Ɓi nikee ŋ sero Pool woosa ɗe ne : « Fu na ɓase seeƴkiɗohi yakki, yiŋ Kooh ! » <verse eid="ACT 23:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 23:5"/>Pool loffa ne : « Ɓaah ciŋ ngo, ŋ inheeɗi ne a seeƴkiɗohi yakki. Fiis ci woyiɗ ne : “ Kina woo yi adgoh cuuɓiŋ ɗa in moɗaaɗi.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 22:27">Pula 22:27</ref></char></note> ” »<verse eid="ACT 23:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 23:6"/>Pool inheen ne ɓooɓa ɓaah ŋ saangnaŋ yakak ca, ɓakii nikee <char style="w"><char style="tl">Sadusen</char></char>, ɓakum nikka <char style="w"><char style="tl">Farisen</char></char>, weɗ tah a leehukka ŋ ɗafka ne : « Ɓaah ciŋ ngo, ŋ <char style="tl">Farisen</char>, ŋ kuɓu <char style="tl">Farisen</char>. A oolki ŋ ooluk ne kaaniɗ ci hey hulte weɗ tah ho atte'se. »<verse eid="ACT 23:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 23:7"/>Wa a woo inaam <char style="tl">Farisen</char> ca na <char style="tl">Sadusen</char> ca lahtoheeɗa, ɓa paysukohha. <verse eid="ACT 23:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 23:8"/><char style="tl">Sadusen</char> ci na woye ne hulit raakɗi, malaaka na <char style="w" lemma="jiini">jiiniici</char> na in ci mand na ca namɗi raak waaye <char style="tl">Farisen</char> ci kos ne in ceem jen raakiɗ. <verse eid="ACT 23:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 23:9"/>Woo ka kurukka ŋ ɗafka. Ɓi jangɗohoh, ɓaah ŋ <char style="tl">Farisen</char> ca, kurukka sannga tic, ɓa woosa ne : « Ɓoo hotɗi ali in moɗaaɗi ŋ ƴaarii ! Nik ne a jiini wala malaaka woo na ɗe ɗah nak ? »<verse eid="ACT 23:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 23:10"/>Lahtoha misikka lool po kilifaanaŋ soldaar ca neƴƴohha ne Pool sifiñsohu. Weɗ tah a nakka soldaar ca ne ɓa ruhsaat nga ɓa, ɓa kooɗoh Pool nga, ɓa dokin ɗe ŋ kahna.<verse eid="ACT 23:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 23:11"/>Ŋ weka, Heɗi hayya, tufukka ŋ sero Pool, woosa ɗe ne : « Ndengɗuka, findi fu seede'oh ho ndii ŋ Yerusalem, fu joyiɗ to nam seede'oh ɗaa ŋ <char style="w">Rom</char>. »<verse eid="ACT 23:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yawuut ca waakohiɗ ne ɓa ap Pool</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 23:12"/>Wa Kooh wiis, ɓi Yawuut waakohha, ɓa ginnja ne feeh ɓa apɗi Pool ɗah, ɓa ñamanɗi, ɓa ananɗi. <verse eid="ACT 23:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 23:13"/>Ini uup ƴaar ndaŋkiyaah-nikiis (40) ɓeɗ giñee giñeem. <verse eid="ACT 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 23:14"/>Ɓa kaɗta ŋ kilifaacaŋ seeƴkiɗoh caŋ <char style="w" lemma="waasiŋ Musaa">waasiŋ</char> <char style="w">Musaa</char> na yakak ca, ɓa woosa ɓa ne : « Ɓoo giñiɗ ne feeh ɓoo apɗi Pool ɗah, ɓoo ñamanɗi, ɓoo ananɗi, te ɓoo tumɗaa ɗah, Kooh alkaat ɓoo. <verse eid="ACT 23:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 23:15"/>Ɗu nak, hunaat na ɓi saangniŋ yakak ci, ɗu kiim kilifaanaŋ soldaar ca a eɗ ɗu Pool, wa mandaat ne ɗu waaɗ ɓaat marak in ciŋ ɗe. Ini kaɗ nga ɓoo, ɓoo ƴutiɗ ne ɓoo ap ɗe bala a reyan ndii ɗah. »<verse eid="ACT 23:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 23:16"/>Waaye kuɓki ƴaariŋ taambɗoh Pool ɓitiɓ kerahha jo'a ɓa waaɗee jo' Pool, a kaɗta kahan soldaar ca, a aassa, a woosa ɗe wa. <verse eid="ACT 23:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 23:17"/>Pool ɓeeɗukka yino ŋ ɓi adgoh soldaar ca, a woosa ɗe ne : « Ɓenda komaakndii ŋ kilifaaniŋ ɗu, raakiɗ ini a waaɗ ɗe woo. » <verse eid="ACT 23:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 23:18"/>Soldaara ɓayya komaaknda ŋ kilifaana, a woosa ɗe ne : « Pool yi ambu, a yi ɓeeɗuk ko, a kiimmba so ne ŋ ɓay komaakndii nga ɗa ; an raakiɗ ini a waaɗ ɗa woo. »<verse eid="ACT 23:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 23:19"/>Kilifaanaŋ soldaar ca ammba komaaknda ŋ yaah, a usɗukka na ɗe, a meekissa ɗe ne : « Fu hay yo ye woye ? » <verse eid="ACT 23:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 23:20"/>A loffa ne : « Yawuut ci kerhiɗohiɗ ne ɓa meekis ɗa Pool kim, fu kom ɓa ɗe ŋ saangnaŋ yakak ca. Wa na hee mande ne ɓa waaɗ markis baahiɗ ini kaɗ nga ɗe. <verse eid="ACT 23:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 23:21"/>Waaye kina ɓa kos, ini uup ƴaar ndaŋkiyaah-nikiis (40) hey ɗe jo'e. Ɓa giñiɗ ne feeh ɓa apɗi ɗe ɗah, ɓa ñamanɗi, ɓa ananɗi. Ɓa ƴutiɗ, ɓa na seke ne fu teyɗuk. » <verse eid="ACT 23:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 23:22"/>Kilifaanaŋ soldaar ca dennga komaaknda ne : « Kina woo ali ɓo' ne fu woyiɗ to inii ! » Ƴutta a woosa ɗe ne a cootaat.<verse eid="ACT 23:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pool cootɗuuɗ Seesare</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 23:23"/>Wa komaaknda coot, kilifaana ɓeeɗukka kanak ŋ ɓa adgohee soldaar ca, a woosa ɓa ne : « Nangɗohaat soldaar teemet-kanak (200), ɗu nam nangɗoh soldaar ndaŋkiyaah-yasna-kanak (70) ŋ ɓi na rape panis ci, na soldaar teemet-kanak (200) ŋ heɗ salmaaci. Kooɗkaat ɗu kaɗ Seesare wahtu yasna-nikiis na weki.<figure style="fig" alt="Paul's journey to Rome" file="WD_Paul4-3D-BW-Saafi.jpg" size="span" loc="Somewhere in 23:23–28:31, preferably so that when you see the map, you can already see or have already seen 23:23" ref="23:23–28:31"/> <verse eid="ACT 23:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 23:24"/>Tokɗiɗaat Pool ɓi panis, ɗu ɓay ɗe po ŋ goornoor Feliksa te ali in kinaat ɗe rahas. »<verse eid="ACT 23:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 23:25"/>A fiissa kayit a woosa inii :<verse eid="ACT 23:25"/></para>
  <para style="mi">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 23:26"/>« Goornoor Feliksa,</para>
  <para style="mi" vid="ACT 23:26">mi yii kañiɗ ɗa kilifaani, mi yi Kolod Lisiyas.<verse eid="ACT 23:26"/></para>
  <para style="mi">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 23:27"/>Ƴaari mi na komee ɗa yii, a Yawuut ci ambee ɗe. Wi ɓa kaɗ po ɓa heeɗa ɗe ape, ŋ hayya na soldaar ciŋ ngo, ŋ naaffa ɗe wi ŋ inah ne a ɓo' Rom.<verse eid="ACT 23:27"/></para>
  <para style="mi">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 23:28"/>Ŋ waaɗta inah ini ɓa yambee ɗe, tahha po ŋ ɓayya ɗe saangnaŋ yakak caŋ ɓa.<verse eid="ACT 23:28"/></para>
  <para style="mi">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 23:29"/>Ŋ hotiɗ ne in ci ɓa yambee ɗe, wa ini kaɗ ŋ waasiŋ ɓa, waaye raakɗi ini a tum ŋ in ci ɓa yambee ɗe po wa joyya ɗe tah apu wala a taƴu.<verse eid="ACT 23:29"/></para>
  <para style="mi">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 23:30"/>Ŋ woyuuɗ nak ne Yawuut ci ɓa ɗii waakoh ɗe ne ɓa ap ɗe. Weɗ tah ŋ komeeɗa ɗe ŋ saasi-saasi, te ŋ teeɓiɗ ɓi na yambee ɗe ne ɓa joy ngeloh na ɗe ŋ ɗiskiŋ ɗa. »<verse eid="ACT 23:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 23:31"/>Soldaar ca tummba ina ɓa naku, ɓa ɓayya Pool ŋ weka, ɓa kaɗta na ɗe po Antipatiris. <verse eid="ACT 23:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 23:32"/>Wa Kooh wiis, soldaar ca tiindee dokukka kahnaŋ ɓa, ɓa faɗta rapoh panis ca, ɓeem taalndiɗta na Pool.<verse eid="ACT 23:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 23:33"/>Wa ɓa ree Seesare, rapoh panis ca eɗta Goornoora ina fiisu, ɓa eɗta ɗe Pool. <verse eid="ACT 23:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 23:34"/>Goornoora jannga ina fiisu, a meekissa Pool ɗiski a puloh. Wa a inah ne a puloh Silisi, <verse eid="ACT 23:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 23:35"/>a woosa ɗe ne : « Ɓi na yambee ɗa hay ɗah, ŋ hey ɗa ɓaate meekis. » A nakohha ne Pool ɗaaksaat a niiɗassee ŋ taɓaha na woyse kahan buur Herod.<verse eid="ACT 23:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="ACT 24"/>
  <para style="s">Yawuut ca yambiɗ Pool</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 24:1"/>Wa degga neeh yatuus, Anañaas, <char style="w" lemma="seeƴkiɗoh">seeƴkiɗoha</char> yakkaŋ <char style="w" lemma="waasiŋ Musaa">waasiŋ</char> <char style="w">Musaa</char> hayya Seesare, a hunnda na ɓi yakak na ngeloh na woyse Tertullus. Ɓa kaɗta ŋ Goornoor Feliksa ne ɓa ngela na Pool.<verse eid="ACT 24:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2-3" style="v" sid="ACT 24:2-3"/>Pool ɓeeɗkuusa, Tertullus cammba ɗe yamb ŋ woo cii : « Feliksa kilifaani, ɓoo ɓii ŋ jam keeh-keeh saguufu ŋ findi fu na tiinɗohe kur ki na in ci as ci fu haytoh ŋ nguuriŋ ɓooɓii, ɓoo hotiɗ in ceem Kooh-nu-wiis na ɗisik nu nik te ɓoo ɓii corkiɗ ɗa nga keeh-keeh. <verse eid="ACT 24:2-3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 24:4"/>Ŋ waaɗɗi ɗa maañiɗ ndii na woo laayiɗ, weɗ tah mi yii kiim ɗa ŋ baah kiŋ ɗa, fu sikɗuk ɓoo ƴissuut rek.<verse eid="ACT 24:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 24:5"/>Ŋ ineem ɓoo hotiɗ ne ƴaarii, a nduhum ŋ kur, a na ɓeke hiñoh ŋ Yawuut ci ŋ Adina jen, a ɓaah ŋ ɓi adgoh ɓi lang na ƴaariŋ Nasareet ci.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 2:23">Macce 2:23</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 24:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 24:6"/>A jeemiɗ sah hoolaaɗi'iɗ <char style="w">Kahan Kooh</char>. Ŋ ineem ɓoo ammba ɗe. [Ɓoo waaɗta ɗe atte ŋ waasiŋ ɓoo, <verse eid="ACT 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 24:7"/>waaye a Lisiyas, kilifaaniŋ soldaar ci, a yi hay a naaffa ɗe na doole ŋ yaah ciŋ ɓoo. <verse eid="ACT 24:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 24:8"/>A woosa ɓoo ne ɓoo hayaat nga ɗa.] Fu miniɗ ɗe meekis sah ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ in ceem jen, fu hey hotoote ne in ci ɓoo na yambe ƴaarii, ca keeh. »<verse eid="ACT 24:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 24:9"/>Yawuut ca ɓaatta ndengiɗ woo ciŋ Tertullus.<verse eid="ACT 24:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pool taasiɗ in ci a yambu ŋ fiki Goornoor Feliksa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 24:10"/>Wa Tertullus ƴut woo, goornoora eɗta Pool woo ka ne a namaat woo, Pool woosa ne : « Ŋ inhiɗ ne a fu na atte'e ɓooɓi ŋ kur kii ɓi kiisi kiis ; weɗ tah ŋ oolkiɗ hay ŋ fikiifu ne ŋ taas in ci ŋ yambu.<verse eid="ACT 24:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 24:11"/>Fu sah, fu miniɗa marak, wa uupɗi neeh ndaŋkiyaah na kanak (12), ŋ kaɗiɗ Yerusalem ne ñaamuk Kooh. <verse eid="ACT 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 24:12"/>Te ali ɓo' hotɗi so jombeeɗa na ɓo' wala ɓekeeɗa mboolndi ŋ yoond, wa ŋ ɗooƴ Kahan Kooh haa, waa ŋ <char style="w"><char style="tl">sinaagog</char></char> ca haa, wa ŋ ɗisik wiiriis ŋ kur-taaha haa.<verse eid="ACT 24:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 24:13"/>Te ɓooɓii minɗi ɗa teeɓ ali firnde ŋ in ci ɓa na yambee so cii. <verse eid="ACT 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 24:14"/>Ŋ teyɗukiɗ inii ŋ fikiifu, weɗ ne : Taamboh ŋ waasiŋ Yeesu, wi ɓa amb ne wa waas tufkaaɗi, mi na ñaamke Koohiŋ caac ciŋ ɓoo nga, maanaam ŋ kosiɗ in ci fiisu ŋ waasiŋ Musaa na fiis ciŋ woosuuɗ ci jen.<verse eid="ACT 24:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 24:15"/>Ŋ raakiɗ ini ŋ oolkoh ŋ Kooh te ɓeɗ ɓii, ɓa nam oolkoh ineem. Weɗ ne Kooh hey hultiɗe kaaniɗ ci, yurhiɗ na yurhaaɗi jen. <verse eid="ACT 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 24:16"/>Weɗ tah ŋ nam gen ŋ ndengɗuk ne ŋ raak hel daliɗ ŋ fiki Kooh na fiki ɓooɓi.<verse eid="ACT 24:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 24:17"/>Wa tumiɗ ɓi kiis laayiɗ ŋ nikeeɗi nga, ŋ neeh cii ŋ hayya ne ŋ kom ɓi cuuɓiŋ ɓoo kopor ɓaatɗohaa ɓa, te ŋ nam <char style="w">seeƴuk</char> wuu Kooh. <verse eid="ACT 24:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 24:18"/>Wi maa haɓɗe ineem, ɓa raak ko ŋ Kahan Kooh ɓoktukiɗ po ƴutiɗ, mboolo ndeereeɗi so, ɗuuɗ raakeeɗi nga. <verse eid="ACT 24:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 24:19"/>Waaye raakiɗ Yawuut ci nikee nga puloh Asi. Ɓeɗ joyee hay ndii ne ɓa seede in ci ɓa na yambee so ŋ fikiifu, ne ɓa raakiɗ ini ɓa taamban ndo ɗah.<verse eid="ACT 24:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 24:20"/>Ɓeɗ ɓi nik ndii nak, ɓa woyaat ini moɗaaɗiini ɓa hot ne ŋ tumiɗa wa ŋ tufkiɗu ŋ <char style="w" lemma="saangniŋ atte'oh ci">saangnaŋ yakak ca</char>. <verse eid="ACT 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 24:21"/>Hanaa woo ki ŋ woyee ŋ ɗafka wii, wi ŋ tufuk ŋ ɗooƴ ɓa ne : “ Ŋ ɓayu woti ne ŋ atte'u ɗah, a ini ŋ kos ne kaaniɗ ci hey hulte ! ” »<verse eid="ACT 24:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 24:22"/>Feliksa inheen in laayiɗ ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ waasiŋ Heɗi, a faɗta ɓa ne ɓa kaɗ po mbeh wiiriis, a woosa ne : « Lisiyas kilifaaniŋ soldaar ci hay ɗah, ŋ hey marke ini ɗu leer. »<verse eid="ACT 24:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 24:23"/>A nakka ƴaara adgohee soldaar ca ne a taalndiɗaat a niiɗee Pool waaye a on ɗe a raak haf ce ƴissuut te ɓooɓiŋ ɗe minee ɗe hay taambkohe.<verse eid="ACT 24:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ɓeesɗohaŋ Pool na Feliksa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 24:24"/>Wa degga ɓi neeh, Feliksa hayya na ɓitiice Dursil, yeem nikee Yawuut. A ɓeeɗkiɗukka Pool, a sikɗukeeɗa ɗe ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ kos Yeesu <char style="w">Kiristaa</char>. <verse eid="ACT 24:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 24:25"/>Waaye, wa Pool woo po a ɓayya woo ka ŋ kiyurah, na amb haf fu, na atteeniŋ Kooh na haye, Feliksa tiitta, woosa ɗe ne : « Fu miniɗ kaɗohaah, ŋ rahsis ne ŋ min woo na ɗa ɗah, ŋ hey ɗa ɓeeɗkisse. » <verse eid="ACT 24:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 24:26"/>Feliksa liiɓee ne Pool hey ɗe eɗe kopor, weɗ tah a meeɗta ɗe ɓeeɗkiɗuk ne a ɓeesɗoh na ɗe.<verse eid="ACT 24:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 24:27"/>Wa degga kiis kanak, Porsiyus Festus namsiɗta Feliksa. Feliksa waaɗee ne Yawuut ca neɓu nga ɗe, tahha po a faɗta Pool ŋ kasoona.<verse eid="ACT 24:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="ACT 25"/>
  <para style="s">Pool nakohiɗ ne buuri yakkiŋ Rom attee ɗe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 25:1"/>Wa Festus tum neeh kaahay ŋ kur ca a joy adgoh, a pulohha Seesare a kaɗta Yerusalem. <verse eid="ACT 25:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 25:2"/>Kilifaacaŋ <char style="w">seeƴkiɗoh</char> caŋ <char style="w" lemma="waasiŋ Musaa">waasiŋ</char> <char style="w">Musaa</char> na kilifaacaŋ Yawuut ca hayya, ɓa kalaameesa Pool nga ɗe. Ɓa kiimeeɗa keeh-keeh <verse eid="ACT 25:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 25:3"/>ne a amboh ɓa, a haytoh Pool Yerusalem. Ɓa waaɗee ɗe jo'nduk ŋ waasi, ɓa ap ɗe. <verse eid="ACT 25:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 25:4"/>Festus loffa ɓa ne : « Pool yaa ŋ Seesare, ŋ yaah soldaar ci te mi na dokke ndaam maañaaɗi. <verse eid="ACT 25:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 25:5"/>Kon ɓi ɓo' oolkuuɗ nga ɗu hunaat na so, ɓa ree ɗah ɓa yamb ɗe, nik ne a tum in moɗaaɗi ɗah. »<verse eid="ACT 25:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 25:6"/>Festus tumɗi ini uup neeh yasna-kaahay mbaa neeh ndaŋkiyaah ndaam, ƴutta a dokukka Seesare. Wa Kooh wiis a kaɗta a ɓooffa ŋ atte'ohaana, a nakohha haytohu Pool. <verse eid="ACT 25:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 25:7"/>Wa yeem ree, Yawuut ca pulohee Yerusalem willa ɗe, ɓa yambeeɗa ɗe in laayiɗ, yakiɗ. Waaye in ci ɓa yambee ɗe jen, ɓa minɗi teeɓoh ali firnde nga. <verse eid="ACT 25:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 25:8"/>Waaye Pool ngeliɗta haf ce an : « Ŋ tumɗi ali in moɗaaɗi, wa waasiŋ Yawuut ci haa, wa <char style="w">Kahan Kooh</char> haa, wa buuri yakkiŋ <char style="w">Rom</char> haa. »<verse eid="ACT 25:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 25:9"/>Festus waaɗta ne Yawuut ca neɓu nga ɗe, a meekissa ɗe ne : « Fu waaɗiɗ kaɗ Yerusalem ne fu atte'u nga ŋ fikiiso, ngaŋ ini kaɗ ŋ inii e ? » <verse eid="ACT 25:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 25:10"/>Pool loffa ne : « Ñam yii tufukka ŋ ngeloha, ŋ ngelohaaciŋ buuri yakkiŋ Rom te ŋ joy atte'ohu nga. Ini kaɗ ŋ Yawuut ci nak, ŋ tooñɗi ɓa te fu ŋ haf fu, fu inhiɗa baahiɗ. <verse eid="ACT 25:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 25:11"/>Ŋ tooñeen wala ŋ tum ini car ne ŋ apu ɗah, ŋ heeɗi sange kaan nga ; waaye nik ne in ci ɓa na yambee so keeh haa ɗah, ali ɓo' joyɗi so deg ŋ yaah ɓa. Ŋ ɓaysaat ŋ buura yakka ! »<verse eid="ACT 25:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 25:12"/>Wi a woo ineem, Festus hotohha na atte'oh ca ɓinooɓaŋ ngelohaana, ƴutta a woosa ne : « Fu woo ne fu ɓaysaat ŋ buura yakka, fu ɓaysan nga ɗe. »<verse eid="ACT 25:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pool ŋ fiki Agiripa na Berenis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 25:13"/>Wa degga ɓi neeh, buura teeku Agiripa na Berenis taambɗoh ce ɓitiɓ, hayya Seesare ne ɓa kañiɗ Festus. <verse eid="ACT 25:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 25:14"/>Nika ɓa joyee nik nga ɓi neeh tahha po Festus woosa buura ina kaɗ ŋ Pool an : « Raakiɗ ƴaari Feliksa faɗ ndii, ŋ kasooni. <verse eid="ACT 25:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 25:15"/>Wa ŋ kaɗ Yerusalem, kilifaacaŋ seeƴkiɗoh ca na yakak caŋ Yawuut ca kalaame'iɗ ɗe, ɓa nakka so ne ŋ deg ɗe in. <verse eid="ACT 25:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 25:16"/>Ŋ loffa ɓa ne : “ Ɓi Rom mbaahkohɗi eɗoh ɓo' yambuuɗ raak ɗe ngelɗi. A joyiɗ onu ne a min taasuk ŋ fiki ɓi na yambee ɗe. ”<verse eid="ACT 25:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 25:17"/>Weɗ ɓa hunoh na so ndii, ŋ sannga ɗaak ineem, Kooh wiis wiis rek, ŋ kaɗta ŋ ɓooffa atte'ohaana, ŋ nakohha haytohu ƴaareem. <verse eid="ACT 25:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 25:18"/>Ɓi na yambee ɗe hayya, waaye ɓa wooɗi ali in ŋ in ci moɗaaɗiici ŋ liiɓee ne ceɗ a tum. <verse eid="ACT 25:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 25:19"/>Ɓa leer na ɗe ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ taastiɗoh ngaŋ ini kaɗ ŋ waas-Koohiŋ ɓa na ƴaar na woyse Yeesu, a kaaniɗ waaye Pool na ndengɗe ne a yi pes.<verse eid="ACT 25:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 25:20"/>Mi nak, wa ŋ inahɗi in nga, ŋ meekissa Pool andi a waaɗiɗ kaɗ Yerusalem ne a atte'u ineem ndaam. <verse eid="ACT 25:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 25:21"/>Waaye Pool nakohha ne a risaat ambuuɗ, a ɓayu ŋ buuri yakki ŋ Rom ne atteeniŋ ɗe tumohu ndaam. Ŋ nakohha ne a risaat ambuuɗ po mbaɗna ŋ tuuƴan ɗe ŋ buuri yakki. »<verse eid="ACT 25:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 25:22"/>Agiripa woosa Festus ne : « Ŋ namiɗ waaɗ sikɗuk ƴaareem de'. » Festus loffa ɗe ne : « Kim ɗah, fu hey ɗe sikɗuke. »<verse eid="ACT 25:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 25:23"/>Ŋ ineem, wa Kooh wiis, Agiripa na Berenis hayya ɗiski na ngelohse, hay roofiɗ. Ɓa hunee na kilifaaciŋ soldaar ci na kilifaaciŋ kur ki, Festus nakohha ne Pool haytohu. <verse eid="ACT 25:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 25:24"/>Ƴutta a woosa ne : « Buur Agiripa na ɗu ɓi nik na ɓoo ndii jen, ƴaari ŋ fikiiɗu yii, Yawuut ci ŋ findi ɓa hend hayiɗ ñaɗtuke nga so ; ndii na Yerusalem jen ɓa na leehkee so ne, a joyɗi pesis.<verse eid="ACT 25:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 25:25"/>Mi nak, ŋ hotiɗ ne a tumɗi ali ini joy ɗe tah apu. Waaye a nakoh ɓayu ŋ buuri yakki, weɗ tah ŋ ambiɗ ne, ŋ hey ɗe ɗe kome. <verse eid="ACT 25:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 25:26"/>Ŋ raakɗi ini hool lo, wi ŋ fiisan kilifaani yakki ŋ ini kaɗ nga. Weɗ tah ŋ ɓayya ɗe ŋ fikiiɗu, ŋ fikiifu sah Agiripa ne ɗu ƴut ɗe meekis ɗah, ŋ raak ini ŋ fiisan. <verse eid="ACT 25:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 25:27"/>Fu amb ɓo', fu tuuƴ ɗe Rom te fu wooɗi hooliɗ in ci a na yambse, weem liiɓaah haa. »<verse eid="ACT 25:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="ACT 26"/>
  <para style="s">Pool ngelɗiɗ haf ce ŋ fiki Agiripa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 26:1"/>Agiripa woosa Pool ne : « Fu onuuɗ ne fu ngeliɗ haf fu. » Pool raɗissa yaah, a cammba ngel an : <verse eid="ACT 26:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 26:2"/>« Buur Agiripa, ŋ sumiɗ woti ŋ mini ŋ min taas ŋ fikiifu in ci Yawuut ci na yambee so jen. <verse eid="ACT 26:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 26:3"/>Fu kangam ŋ inhi fu inah mbaah ciŋ Yawuut ci jen na taastiɗoh ci ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ waasi. Kon mi yii kiim ɗa fu sikɗuk ko te fu sang seesuk nga.<verse eid="ACT 26:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 26:4"/>Yawuut ci jen inhiɗ kipes kiŋ ngo ŋ kikomaakiikaŋ ngo poyi. Ɓa inhiɗ findi ŋ mandee ŋ ɗooƴ cuuɓiŋ ngo ŋ Yerusalem. <verse eid="ACT 26:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 26:5"/>Ɓa inhiɗ to maañiɗ te ɓa miniɗ to seede, ne ɓa waaɗa ɗah, ŋ nikee <char style="w"><char style="tl">Farisen</char></char>, ŋ peseeɗa pes <char style="tl">Farisen</char>, te weɗ ini uup yooɓaaɗi taambiɗ ŋ <char style="w" lemma="waasiŋ Musaa">waasiŋ</char> <char style="w">Musaa</char>.<verse eid="ACT 26:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 26:6"/>Ɗiski wa nik, mi yii atte'u, sagu ini ŋ ooluk gapohi Kooh gapee caac ciŋ ɓoo. <verse eid="ACT 26:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 26:7"/>Cuuɓ ciŋ ɓoo ndaŋkiyaah na kanak ci (12) ambiɗ ne wa hey raake weɗ tah ɓeɗi ñaamuk Kooh noh na wek. Ee kilifaani, oolkeem nak weɗ tah Yawuut ci yambee so. <verse eid="ACT 26:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 26:8"/>Wa ye tah ɗu amb ne wa minɗi kosu ne Kooh na hultiɗe kaaniɗ ci ?<verse eid="ACT 26:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 26:9"/>Mi ŋ haf fo sah, ŋ liiɓee ne ŋ joyee joy hiñoh tiikiŋ Yeesu yiŋ Nasareet ŋ findi naa nu wa minoh nik ɗah. <verse eid="ACT 26:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 26:10"/>Ineem weɗ ŋ tumee ŋ Yerusalem, ŋ taƴca <char style="w" lemma="ɓo'-Kooh ci">ɓo'-Kooh</char> laayiɗ ŋ kaso. Kilifaaciŋ <char style="w">seeƴkiɗoh</char> ciŋ waasiŋ Musaa teyɗukɗeen ndo ne ŋ tuma, te ɓooɓeem atte'seen ne ɓa joy joy apu ɗah, ŋ meeɗ meeɗ hun nga. <verse eid="ACT 26:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 26:11"/>Ŋ kaɗeeɗa ŋ <char style="w"><char style="tl">sinaagog</char></char> nu <char style="tl">sinaagog</char> ne ŋ torhiɗ ɓa, ŋ faɗɗukoh ɓa kosi ɓa kos Yeesu. Ayruki ŋ ayrukee ɓa miskeen lool po wa tahha so tolfiɗeeɗa ɓa po ŋ kur-taah ciŋ kur ci cinooci sah.<verse eid="ACT 26:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pool naandsukiɗ Agiripa findi a tuuɓoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 26:12"/>Wa kaɗeeɗa ɗaa po wa raakka mbeh, ŋ kaɗeeɗa Damas. Kilifaacaŋ seeƴkiɗoh ca woosee so, ɓa onnda so ne ŋ min amb kosiɗ ca nikee ndaam. <verse eid="ACT 26:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 26:13"/>Kilifaani, ñam kaɗoh po ŋ leero noh, ŋ hotta ñiin puloh Eel ci, siñaarɗiŋ wa weɗ uup wiŋ nohi. Wa willa so, mi na ɓi hunee na so, wa siñaarɗeeɗa. <verse eid="ACT 26:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 26:14"/>Ɓoo jen, ɓoo keennda ŋ kehƴi, ŋ kerahha hooso woyiɗ to ŋ peɗmiŋ Yawuut ci ne : “ Sool, Sool, wa ye tah fu tolfiɗee so ? Fu gaañee haf fu findi mbaami na mbalnguuse ndooɗi a na aañohse ! ”<verse eid="ACT 26:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 26:15"/>Ŋ loffa ne : “ A fu ɓa Heɗi ? ” Heɗi woosa so ne : “ E ñam Yeesu, yi fu na tolfiɗe. <verse eid="ACT 26:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 26:16"/>Waaye kurka fu tufuk ! Inii weɗ tah ho teeɓuk ɗa : Ŋ kooɗiɗ ɗa ne fu nik surgaaniŋ ngo ne fu seede'ee ini fu hot nga so woti, na ci ŋ teeɓissan ɗa.<verse eid="ACT 26:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 26:17"/>Ŋ hey ɗa mucɗe ŋ yaah ciŋ Yawuut ci na ɓi nikɗi Yawuut, ɓi maa tuuƴohee ɗa, <verse eid="ACT 26:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 26:18"/>ne fu rangis has ciŋ ɓa, fu pulɗoh ɓa ŋ ñuus, fu ɓek ɓa ŋ siñaari, fu puliɗ ɓa ŋ nguuriŋ Seytaani, fu ɓay ɓa ŋ Kooh, ɓa ɗaasu bakaaɗ ciŋ ɓa, ɓa raak ɓak ŋ lamaahi te ɓa hey ɓaahe ŋ ɓooɓiŋ Kooh hoolɗuuɗ ci sagu kosi ɓa kos so. ”<verse eid="ACT 26:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 26:19"/>Kilifaani, a ineem tah, ŋ taambɗiɗ ini ŋ hotee pulohha Eel ci. <verse eid="ACT 26:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 26:20"/>Ŋ ineem, ŋ kocca woo na ɓi Damas na ɓi Yerusalem, ŋ nammba woo na ɓi Yudee jen na ɓi nikɗi Yawuut, ne ɓa ɓoƴsoh pesohaaɗ, ɓa hay ŋ Kooh te ŋ tumohaaɗ ciŋ ɓa, ɓa teeɓoh ne ɓa ɓoƴsohiɗ pesohaaɗ keeh-keeh.<verse eid="ACT 26:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 26:21"/>Inii de', weɗ tah Yawuut ci ammba so ŋ ɗooƴ <char style="w">Kahan Kooh</char>, ɓa waaɗta so ap. <verse eid="ACT 26:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 26:22"/>Waaye Kooh yii niiɗ to po woti, te ŋ ris pes, ne ŋ seede ŋ fiki yakiɗ na ƴin. Te ŋ wooɗi ini ɗaloh na in ci Musaa na woosuuɗ ci jen woo ne ca hey raake. <verse eid="ACT 26:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 26:23"/>Weɗ ne <char style="w">Mucɗohi Gapohse</char> hey yaaɓe, a yi kocan hulit ŋ kaaniɗ ci te a yegɗoh siñaariŋ muci ŋ Yawuut ci na ɓi nikɗi Yawuut. »<verse eid="ACT 26:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ini Agiripa liiɓ ngaŋ Pool</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 26:24"/>Pool rissa ngelɗeeɗa haf ce ɗaa, weɗ Festus leehkoh ɗe an : « Fu dof dof Pool ! Ini fu jang laay laay po fu arndiɗohiɗ ! » <verse eid="ACT 26:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 26:25"/>Pool loffa ɗe ne : « Muk kilifaani, ŋ arndiɗohɗi. In ci ŋ woo jen keeh te ca wiriɗ. <verse eid="ACT 26:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 26:26"/>Buur Agiripa sah inhiɗ in cii weɗ tah ŋ kaannja ca woo ŋ fikiice an. Wa hooliɗ to ne ali in fusɗi ɗe ŋ in cii, laam, findi ca raakoh ɗembɗi. <verse eid="ACT 26:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 26:27"/>Buur Agiripa, fu kosiɗ woo ciŋ woosuuɗ ci e ? Ŋ inhiɗ ne fu kosiɗ ca ! »<verse eid="ACT 26:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 26:28"/>Agiripa woosa Pool ne : « Tas ƴissuut rek, fu hey yo kosɗukohe, fu tum mbo <char style="tl">Kerceen</char> ! » <verse eid="ACT 26:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 26:29"/>Pool loffa ne : « Wa nik win-win wala wa yiih, ŋ wooɗi ɗa fu dong waaye mi yii kiim Kooh ne ɓi na sikɗukee so woti jen, ɗu nik ini ŋ nikoh, ɗal toku na ceen. »<verse eid="ACT 26:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 26:30"/>Wa Pool woo po ƴutta, buura na goornoora na Berenis na ɓooɓa hunee na ɓa jen, kurukka. <verse eid="ACT 26:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 26:31"/>Wa ɓa pulee, ɓa woyeeɗa ŋ harmban ɓa ne : « Ƴaarii tumɗi ini joy ɗe tah apu wala taƴu. » <verse eid="ACT 26:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 26:32"/>Agiripa woosa Festus ne : « Ƴaarii mineen faɗsu ne a nakoheeɗi ɓayu ŋ buuri yakki ɗah. »<verse eid="ACT 26:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="ACT 27"/>
  <para style="s">Ɓayuukaŋ Pool Itaali ŋ buura yakka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 27:1"/>Wa ɓa tufuk ŋ ɓek ɓoo <char style="tl">bato</char> ne ɓoo kaɗ Itaali, Pool na ɓi ambuuɗ wiiriis deguusa ŋ yaah ƴaar teeku Juliyus. A nikee adgohoh soldaar, ɓa ɓaahee ŋ soldaar ci na woyse "soldaar ciŋ buuri yakki". <verse eid="ACT 27:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 27:2"/>Ɓoo aassa <char style="tl">bato</char> puloh Adaramit kaɗeeɗa Asi ŋ kur ca ŋ sereendaŋ cookmi, ɓoo cootta. Aristarka, ƴaariŋ Tessalonik ŋ kur kaŋ Maseduwaan hunee na ɓoo.<verse eid="ACT 27:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 27:3"/>Ŋ Kooh-wiisiina, ɓoo serra ŋ Sidoon. Juliyus taambkohee Pool taambkoh moɗiɗ, a teyɗukiɗta ɗe ne a kaɗ marka nawleeciŋ ɗe ne ɓa ɓaatɗoh ɗe.<verse eid="ACT 27:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 27:4"/>Wa ɓoo puloh ndaam, ɓoo lahha ŋ sero Siipar ne ɓoo naafuk sagu puuɗsi yurhiɗkohee na ɓoo. <verse eid="ACT 27:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 27:5"/>Ƴutta ɓoo taalndiɗta ŋ cookmiŋ Silisi na wiŋ Pamfili, ɓoo serra <char style="tl">batooni</char> ŋ Miira, kur-taah ngaŋ Lisi.<verse eid="ACT 27:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 27:6"/>Ŋ ndaam, Juliyus, yi adgohee soldaar ci, raakka <char style="tl">bato</char> wiiriis nga puloh Aleksandiri kaɗeeɗa Itaali, a aassa na ɓoo nga. <verse eid="ACT 27:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 27:7"/>Ɓoo tummba ɓi neeh laayiɗ ŋ waas, sagu ne <char style="tl">batoona</char> kaɗee kaɗ yiihiɗ po ɓoo ree ɓak Kenid yaaɓoh na yaaɓoh. Puuɗsi tahha po ɓoo minɗi taalndiɗ ŋ ndaam, ɓoo taambohha Salmone, kaɗta hendɗuka puuɗsi ŋ Keret. <verse eid="ACT 27:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 27:8"/>Sereendkaŋ ɓoo ndaam misikka lool, ɓoo kaɗeeɗa po ɓoo reesa ɗisik teeku "Seroha-Neɓiɗ", wa usoheeɗi na kur-taahi na woyse Lasee.<verse eid="ACT 27:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 27:9"/>Ŋ ineem, ɓaaɓiŋ ɓoo maannja lool, kaɗta po ɓaaɓ ŋ cookma nikka in wooraaɗi kotii, laam jamanooniŋ soosi nikee cambiɗ, mbehi na orse<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:9 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">mbehi na orse </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: weɗ mbehi Yawuut ci na orohe, wa na nike ne seeki pulee ɗah.</char></note> sah cooteen. Weɗ tah Pool woosa ne : <verse eid="ACT 27:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 27:10"/>« Ƴaaɓiŋ ngo, ŋ hotiɗ ne kaɗii woorɗi, <char style="tl">batooni</char> na ini nik nga hey laaye yahkiɗ, te ɓoo sah kiñin ciŋ ɓoo miniɗ tas nga. » <verse eid="ACT 27:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 27:11"/>Waaye Juliyus ya adgohee soldaar ca uupee kos woo caŋ ƴaara nupɗee <char style="tl">batoona</char>, na heɗ <char style="tl">batoona</char>, waaye woo caŋ Pool haa. <verse eid="ACT 27:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 27:12"/>Serohaana baaheeɗi ne ɓo' nik nga ŋ jamano soos, weɗ tahee ini uup ŋ ɓooɓa nikee ŋ <char style="tl">batoona</char> woyee ne ɓoo pulohaat ndaam. Ɓa waaɗee ne ɓoo taalndiɗ ŋ cookma, ɓoo jeem kaɗ Feniksa, seroha wiiriis ŋ caŋ Keret, ne ɓoo nik nga ŋ jamanooniŋ soosi. Serohaaneem, puuɗsi mineeɗi hay nga, ɗal ŋ ɓak kanak dong ŋ muyohaaɗ noh.<verse eid="ACT 27:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Puuɗsa laayɗa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 27:13"/>Wa ɓoo nik ndaam, ɗekka po puuɗis eɗfiɗ puloh cookmi, ef-efɗeeɗa. Ɓa liiɓpa ne ini ɓa waaɗee hey nike. Ɓa nihissa sap caŋ <char style="tl">batoona</char>, ɓa sereendukka Keret baahiɗ, ɓa kaɗeeɗa.<verse eid="ACT 27:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 27:14"/>Waaye wa deg ƴissuut rek, puuɗis wiiriis raakiɗ hatil teeku Erakilon pulohha Keret keennda nga ɓoo. <verse eid="ACT 27:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 27:15"/>Wa uupiɗta <char style="tl">batoona</char> hatil, wa minisseeɗi yurhiɗkoh naa, ɓoo faɗtaa, wa coottoheeɗa ɓoo.<verse eid="ACT 27:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 27:16"/>Wa maañɗi ɓoo lahha ŋ sero kur ƴin na woyse Kawda, a masuɓ wila. Wa ɗippa ɓoo ƴissuut ŋ puuɗsa, tahha po ɓoo hannda min rapiɗ gaala ƴina waaye bala wa nikan ɗah, wa miskeen lool. <verse eid="ACT 27:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 27:17"/>Wa ɓoo rapiɗa po ƴutta, ɓa ɓayya ɓi niy, ɓa tokka <char style="tl">batoona</char> po wa willa. Ɓa namee neƴƴoh ne wa kaɗ giira ŋ merhey maŋ Sirta ŋ Libi, wa ɓaltukoh, tahha po ɓa njaffa in ŋ masma ne wa haawis nupaŋ <char style="tl">batoona</char>, ɓoo taalndiɗta, puuɗsa coottoheeɗa ɓoo ŋ ɗooƴ cookma.<verse eid="ACT 27:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 27:18"/>Wa Kooh wiis, raak puuɗsa ris yoondiɗ <char style="tl">batoona</char> na hatil po ɓa mbetta ɓak ŋ ina <char style="tl">batoona</char> sife. <verse eid="ACT 27:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 27:19"/>Ŋ neeha kaahayɗoh, ɓeɗ ɓa ambohee <char style="tl">batoona</char> mbetootta ɓi in ɓitiɗ ca ɓaahee ŋ <char style="tl">batoona</char>. <verse eid="ACT 27:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 27:20"/>Wa tummba ɓi neeh laayiɗ ci inah ne nohi hotukɗi, hor ci hotukɗi, puuɗsa rissa raakiɗ hatil, wa kaɗta po ɓoo ambisseeɗi ne ɓoo hey muce.<verse eid="ACT 27:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 27:21"/>Wa tummba in maañiɗ, ɓooɓi nikee ŋ <char style="tl">batooni</char> ñamɗi. Ŋ ineem Pool tufukka ŋ leerooɓa, a woosa ɓa ne : « Ƴaaɓiŋ ngo, ɗu sikɗukeen ndo ɗah, ɓoo heeɗi pulohe Keret ; te ɓoo heen mine penduk yahɗukii, te ɓoo ñakuu in ci ɓoo ñak jen. <verse eid="ACT 27:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 27:22"/>Waaye ɗiski wa nik, mi yii kiim ɗu, ɗu tok fit ciŋ ɗu ; ali ɓo' ñakanɗi kiñin kiŋ ɗe nga, a <char style="tl">batooni</char> dong yahkan.<verse eid="ACT 27:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 27:23"/>Kooh yi ŋ ɓaahoh te ŋ ñaamkee ɗe, malaakaaniŋ ɗe hayiɗ nga so ŋ weki, <verse eid="ACT 27:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 27:24"/>a woosa so ne : “ Pool, kina neƴƴoh ! Fu hey kaɗe po fu tufkiɗu ŋ fiki buura yakkaŋ <char style="w">Rom</char>, te Kooh ŋ baahohiŋ ɗe na ɗa, a hey mucɗe kipes ciŋ ɓooɓi hun na ɗa ŋ ɓaaɓiŋ <char style="tl">batooni</char> jen. ”<verse eid="ACT 27:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 27:25"/>Mbaa ɗah, ndengɗukaat ƴaaɓiŋ ngo, ŋ oolkiɗ Kooh ne wa raakohan findi a woyoh ho wa. <verse eid="ACT 27:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 27:26"/><char style="tl">Batooni</char> hey gaƴe ŋ kur ki masuɓ wil. »<verse eid="ACT 27:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 27:27"/>Wa nikee ŋ weka ndaŋkiyaah na nikiisɗoh (14), puuɗsa rissa ɓoo coottoh ŋ cookmaŋ Mediterane. Ŋ ndengelnde weka, wa mannda ŋ ɓa ambohee <char style="tl">batoona</char> ne ɓoo reɓee keheƴ. <verse eid="ACT 27:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 27:28"/>Ɓa yoorra niy na inaa ɓitiɗ ne ɓa marak nooɗiina, ɓa hotta ne wa <char style="tl">meetar</char> ndaŋkiyaah-kaahay na <char style="tl">meetar</char> yasna-kanak (37) ; wa kaɗta ƴissuut, ɓa tumissa ɗaa, wa nikka <char style="tl">meetar</char> ndaŋkiyaah-kanak na <char style="tl">meetar</char> yasna-kaahay (28).<verse eid="ACT 27:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 27:29"/>Ɓa neƴƴohha ne <char style="tl">batoona</char> laɓ ŋ atoh, ɓa njaffa sap nikiis ŋ finhooriŋ <char style="tl">batoona</char>, ɓa seesukka ne Kooh wiis. <verse eid="ACT 27:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 27:30"/>Ɓa ambohee <char style="tl">batoona</char> waaɗta saandoh, ɓa ruhsiɗeeɗa gaala ƴina ŋ masma, ɓa njaf-njafɗukeeɗa sap ŋ fiki <char style="tl">batoona</char>. <verse eid="ACT 27:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 27:31"/>Pool woosa soldaar ca na ya adgohee ɓa ne : « Ƴaaɓii faɗ <char style="tl">batooni</char> ɓa coot ɗah, ɗu minanɗi muc. » <verse eid="ACT 27:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 27:32"/>Ŋ ineem soldaar ca nguɗta niy ca tokee gaala ƴina, ɓa faɗtaa, wa keennda ŋ cookma.<verse eid="ACT 27:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 27:33"/>Bala Kooh wiisan, Pool ñaahha ɓooɓa jen ne ɓa ñam, a woo ɓa ne : « Neeh ndaŋkiyaah na nikiis (14) ceɗɗi, ɗu ɓi sek rook ɓarang, ñamaaɗi ali in. <verse eid="ACT 27:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 27:34"/>Mi yii ñaah ɗu ne ɗu ñam kotii, ɗu etohiɗa ne ɗu min muc. Ali ɓo' nga ɗu ñakanɗi sah find yino ŋ hafiŋ ɗe. »<verse eid="ACT 27:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 27:35"/>Wa a ƴut woo, a ɓayya mbuuru, a corkiɗta Kooh ŋ fikiiɓa jen, a poɓtohhaa, a cammba ñam. <verse eid="ACT 27:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 27:36"/>Ŋ ineem, ɓa jen ɓa raakissa fit, ɓa ñameeɗa. <verse eid="ACT 27:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 27:37"/>Ɓoo nikee ɓo' teemet-kanak na ndaŋkiyaah-yasna-kanak na yasna-yino (276) ŋ ɗooƴ <char style="tl">batoona</char>. <verse eid="ACT 27:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 27:38"/>Wa ɓooɓa jen ñam po ɓa kappa, ɓa ɓayya beleena tasee ŋ ɗooƴ <char style="tl">batoona</char>, ɓa mbettaa ŋ cookmi ne <char style="tl">batoona</char> eɗef.<verse eid="ACT 27:38"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ɓooɓa jen muciɗ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 27:39"/>Wa Kooh wiis, ƴaaɓa ambohee <char style="tl">batoona</char> ƴokka keheƴ, wa raakka kal na merhey suyiɗ, waaye ɓa inhisohɗaa. Ɓa waaɗta gaƴ <char style="tl">batoona</char> nga ne wa min nik ɗah. <verse eid="ACT 27:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 27:40"/>Ɓa tokissa niy caŋ sap ca, ɓa faɗissa ca ŋ cookma. Ɓa nammba tokis niy caŋ <char style="tl">guweernaay</char> ca na nupɗe <char style="tl">batoona</char>, ƴutta ɓa raɗissa baasa ŋ fikiiwa ne puuɗsi min yeñ <char style="tl">batoona</char>, wa yurah ndaam.<verse eid="ACT 27:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 27:41"/>Waaye wa tapukka ŋ jalkiɗ caŋ merhey ma ŋ harmban masuɓ cohiɗ. Fikiiriŋ wa ruɗukka jameet ŋ merhey ma, wa looffa, wa yoondisɗi. Finhoori nak pookeeɗa sagu ginaah ca laɓkee wa na hatil.<verse eid="ACT 27:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 27:42"/>Soldaar ca waaɗta ap ambuuɗ ca ne ali ɓo' nga ɓa weƴuu ne a fus. <verse eid="ACT 27:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 27:43"/>Waaye Juliyus, yi adgohee ɓa waaɗta muciɗ Pool, a hondohha ɓa tum ina ɓa hee tume. A nakohha ne ɓi min weƴ kocaat gong ŋ masma, ɓa kaɗ yaah-cookma. <verse eid="ACT 27:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 27:44"/>Ɓi tas taamb nga, ɓa ambɗuk ŋ hang ca wala pol caŋ <char style="tl">batoona</char>.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 27:44">Ɓooɓa jen teeroh ɗaa te ali in ocɗi ɓa.<verse eid="ACT 27:44"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="ACT 28"/>
  <para style="s">Pool ŋ Malta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 28:1"/>Wa ɓoo fus na jam po ƴutta, ɓoo inahha ne kur ka ɓoo nikohee teeku Malta, a masuɓ wila. <verse eid="ACT 28:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 28:2"/>Ɓooɓa genee nga kerheeɗi <char style="w">gerek</char>, hondohɗi ɓa baahohha ɓoo keeh-keeh, ɓa fuuɗta yongkaah, ɓa ɓayya ɓoo jen ŋ seroowa ne ɓoo yohnuk, raak ɗe toɓeeɗa, soosi laayya.<verse eid="ACT 28:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 28:3"/>Pool parahha ɓi sokoñ, a njaffa ca ŋ yongkaaha, hiriñ pulohha nga ca sagu dohɗa, ñapukka ɗe ŋ yaah. <verse eid="ACT 28:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 28:4"/>Wa ɓooɓa gen kur ka hot iiña ñapkiɗ Pool ŋ yaah, ɓa woosa ŋ ɗooƴ ɓa ne : « Wa wooriɗ ne ƴaarii apoh ɓo', a muciɗ ŋ cookmi waaye koof ki na atte'e faɗɗi ɗe ne a pes. » <verse eid="ACT 28:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 28:5"/>Weɗ Pool lisoh iiña ŋ yongkaaha, te ali in rahasɗi ɗe. <verse eid="ACT 28:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 28:6"/>Ɓooɓa jen sekeeɗa ne a ufis wala a keen ŋ ɗiska ɗiska, a kaan. Ɓa sekka in maañiɗ, ɓa hotta ne ali in rahasɗi ɗe ; ɓa ɓoƴsohha liiɓohaaɗ, ɓa woosa ne : « A ɓaah ŋ kooh ci. »<verse eid="ACT 28:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 28:7"/>Wa raakeen kahan raakiɗ tam ŋ ɓak caam, a ƴaara adgohee kur ka raakee wa. A teeksee Pubiliyus. A taambkohha ɓoo, a daliɗta ɓoo findi nawle ini ree neeh kaahay. <verse eid="ACT 28:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 28:8"/>Baabiŋ Pubiliyus nikee faankiɗ ŋ fiƴaang ; a ambohee faan dohiɗ jip na rook nupiɗ miskiɗ. Pool kaɗta ɗe marka, a kiimiɗta ɗe Kooh, a degga ɗe yaah ciŋ ɗe, a wiriɗta ɗe.<verse eid="ACT 28:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 28:9"/>Wa a wiriɗ ɗe, kosaayiɗ ca ɓinooɓa ŋ kur ka jen nammba hay, ɓa wirɗuusa. <verse eid="ACT 28:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 28:10"/>Ɓoo eɗuusa cir keeh-keeh ŋ ineem, weɗ tah po wa ɓoo hee coote, ini ɓoo etohee ŋ ɓaaɓaŋ ɓoo jen, ɓeɗ eɗee ɓoo wa.<verse eid="ACT 28:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pulohaŋ Pool Malta na kaɗaŋ ɗe Rom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 28:11"/>Wa ɓoo tum caɓin ci kaahay ciŋ soosi ŋ kur kaŋ Malta, ɓoo aassa <char style="tl">bato</char> puloh Aleksandiri, ɓoo cootta. <char style="tl">Batooneem</char> raakeen nataaliŋ komaakci siis ciŋ kilifaaniŋ kooh ciŋ ɓa, wa teeksee ŋ siis ci kanak ceem. Caɓin ciŋ soosi jen wa tum ca ŋ kur ka, wa hannda coot.<verse eid="ACT 28:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 28:12"/>Ɓoo reesa Sirakus, ɓoo serra nga neeh kaahay. <verse eid="ACT 28:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 28:13"/>Ɓoo pulohha ndeem huntiɗkohha na yaah cookmi po ŋ Resiyo. Ŋ Kooh-wiisiina puuɗsa lahha ɓoo finho puuɗseeɗa, ɓoo tum neeh kanak rek ɓoo reesa Pusol, serohaana yakka ŋ <char style="w">Rom</char>. <verse eid="ACT 28:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 28:14"/>Ɓoo raakka ɓi ɓo' ŋ ɓaah caŋ ɓoo kosiɗ ca nga. Ɓa kiimmba ɓoo ne ɓoo nik na ɓa neeh yasna-kanak. Ɓoo kaɗeeɗa ɗaa po ɓoo reesa Rom.<verse eid="ACT 28:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 28:15"/>Ɓaah caŋ ɓoo kosiɗ ca nikee ŋ Rom kerahha ini kaɗ nga ɓoo, ɓa hayya ɓoo taambke po ŋ toonohaaraŋ kurka na woyse Toonohaaraŋ-Apiyus na ɗiska na woyse Daloha-Kaahay. Wa Pool hot ɓa, wa ɓaatta ɗe fit, a corkiɗta Kooh.<verse eid="ACT 28:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 28:16"/>Wa ɓoo ree Rom, Pool onuusa ne a gen kahan kiik ce a yi na soldaara niiɗee ɗe.<verse eid="ACT 28:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pool woyiɗ Yegɗohiŋ Muci ŋ Rom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 28:17"/>Wa degga neeh kaahay, Pool ɓeeɗukka kilifaacaŋ Yawuut ca nik ŋ Rom ne ɓa hay. Wa ɓa teemb a woosa ɓa ne : « Ɓaah ciŋ ngo, ŋ tumɗi cuuɓiŋ ɓoo in, ŋ tumɗi mbaah ciŋ caac ciŋ ɓoo in, waaye ɗu hot nga, ŋ ambohu Yerusalem, ŋ deguusa ŋ yaah caŋ ɓi Rom. <verse eid="ACT 28:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 28:18"/>Wa ɓeem meekis so ŋ woosa ɓa, ɓa hoteeɗi ali ini joy yo tah apu, tahha po ɓa waaɗta so faɗis. <verse eid="ACT 28:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 28:19"/>Waaye Yawuut ca sannga, ŋ minɗi in nga, ɗal kiim ne ŋ ɓayu ŋ buuri yakki ŋ Rom a attee so. Waaye nikɗi haa ne ŋ waaɗ yamb ɓooɓiŋ ngo. <verse eid="ACT 28:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 28:20"/>E ineem tah po ŋ kiimmba ne ŋ hotoh na ɗu, ŋ woo na ɗu, ɗu inah ne ŋ toku ceen cii ɗah, e ini ŋ kos yaakaariŋ Israayel ci tah. »<verse eid="ACT 28:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 28:21"/>Yawuut ca loffa ɗe ne : « Raakɗi ali fiisi ɓoo rahas puloh Yudee ŋ ini kaɗ nga ɗa te ali ɓaah ɓoo ŋ ndaam hayɗi ndii ne a wik wala a woo ɓoo in moɗaaɗi nga ɗa. <verse eid="ACT 28:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 28:22"/>Waaye ɓoo waaɗiɗ ɗa sikɗuk, fu woo ɓoo ini fu liiɓ nga, laam ɓoo inhiɗ ne waasi fu kooɗ, ɗisik nu nik ɓooɓi na woye ne wa waas keeh haa. »<verse eid="ACT 28:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 28:23"/>Ɓa gappa mbeh wiiriis ne ɓa coh. Wa wa ree, ɓa hayya raake Pool ŋ ɗiska a dale. Ɓooɓa hayee, ɓeɗ uupee laay ɓooɓa ɗeɓe hay. A woyeeɗa na ɓa ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ Nguuriŋ-Kooh ina kooɗoh na ɓaaɓa po na niina. A taambohha ŋ <char style="w" lemma="waasiŋ Musaa">waasiŋ</char> <char style="w">Musaa</char> na woo ciŋ woosuuɗ ci, a teeɓeeɗa ɓa ne ɓa min kos Yeesu. <verse eid="ACT 28:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 28:24"/>Ɓum kossa ini a woo, ɓinooɓi sannga kos.<verse eid="ACT 28:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 28:25"/>Wa ɓa hee coote raak ɓa kerhiɗohɗi ŋ ɗooƴ ɓa, Pool ɓaatta nga ne : « <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani</char> woyee keeh wa a woyee na caac caŋ ɗu taamboh ŋ woosuuɗi Esayi ! <verse eid="ACT 28:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 28:26"/>A woyee ne :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:26">“ Kaɗa ŋ cuuɓii, fu woo ɓa ne :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:26">Ɗu hey sikɗuke baahiɗ, waaye ɗu inhanɗi muk ;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:26">ɗu hey marke baahiɗ, waaye ɗu hotanɗi muk.<verse eid="ACT 28:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 28:27"/>Keeñ ciŋ ɓooɓii</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">raakisɗi yeg yeg ;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">ɓa rangiɗ nof ciŋ ɓa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">ɓa ɗuungiɗ has ciŋ ɓa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">ne ɓa hotuu na has ciŋ ɓa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">ɓa kerhuu na nof ciŋ ɓa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">te ɓa inhuu ngaŋ keeñ ciŋ ɓa ;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">te ŋ ineem,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">ɓa minuu wiiruk nga so</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">ne ŋ wiriɗ ɓa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:9-10">Esayi 6:9-10</ref></char></note> ” »<verse eid="ACT 28:27"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 28:28"/>Pool woyissa ɓa ne : « Inhaat ne <char style="w">Yegɗohiŋ Muci</char> puloh ŋ Kooh woosohuuɗ po ŋ ɓi nikɗi Yawuut, te ɓeɗ, ɓa hey wa sikɗuke. » [<verse eid="ACT 28:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 28:29"/>]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ngaŋ Fiis ci maañiɗ ci, cum raak ayaanii : "Wa Pool woo ineem, Yawuut ca cootta ; ɓa lahtoheeɗa lahtoh miskiɗ ŋ ɗooƴ ɓa." Waaye Fiis ci uup woor ngaŋ ci maañiɗ ci ris woti raakɗi woo keem.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 28:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 28:30"/>Pool gennda kiis kanak ŋ kahna, caɓin nu kaan ɗa a wirind. A dalɗee ɓi hee ɗe marke jen nga. <verse eid="ACT 28:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 28:31"/>A yegɗoheeɗa Nguuriŋ-Kooh, a jangɗoheeɗa na fit ini kaɗ ŋ Yeesu <char style="w">Kiristaa</char> Heɗi, te ali ɓo' hondoheeɗi ɗe tuma.<verse eid="ACT 28:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 28"/>
</usx>
